{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T09:48:26+08:00","record":{"name":"Guoqiang Ai","current_title":"Associate Medical Director","current_company":"Suzhou Immunofoco Biotechnology Co. Ltd. · 正式","location":"中国 四川省 成都市","headline":"Associate Medical Director at Suzhou Immunofoco Biotechnology CO., Ltd.","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/aiguoqiang","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAnFKAIBoFt3uAIovIANy-vY16BRhsAk1tM","core_skills":["NASH","Pharmaceutical Industry","protein activity assay"],"positions":[{"title":"Associate Medical Director","company":"Suzhou Immunofoco Biotechnology Co. Ltd. · 正式","date_range":"2022年3月 - 2024年5月","duration":"2 年 3 个月","location":"中国 四川省 成都市","description":"- Provide medical strategy, expertise, and decisions on critical aspects of the Clinical Development Plan, including the target product profile \n- Oversee clinical development activities including study design, protocol development, patient selection, safety monitoring, from the launch of a study to the finalization of its clinical study report \n- Interact with health authorities (FDA, EMA) and be responsible for medical input \n- Responsible for translational medicine function of oncology research \n- Finished 2 CAR-T cell products for CDE and FDA IND applications with medical support and got approved \n- Got approved of 3 CAR-T drugs ODD application to FDA","skills":["Oncology","Medical Groups"]},{"title":"Senior Medical Manager","company":"Shenzhen Chipscreen Biosciences Co., Ltd. · 正式","date_range":"2019年9月 - 2022年3月","duration":"2 年 7 个月","location":"中国 四川省 成都市","description":"- Finished the Pre-IND/IND application of a NASH drug with no defect \n- Finished the protocol design and launch the studies for a phase II NASH drug and a Phase III diabetes drug \n- Supporting the launch of marketing of a first-in-class anti-diabetic drug with the function of post-marketing medical affair \n- Communicating with CDE for the NDA approva