{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T09:49:23+08:00","record":{"name":"Leia Jiang","current_title":"Medical Writer","current_company":"Therapeutics Inc. · 全职","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","headline":"Medical Writer | Clinical Pharmacist | Clinical Research","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/leiajiang","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAD-kUToBv4rqbISX4ej9YWkgpaI8ZrAED2A","core_skills":["Organization Skills","Regulatory Guidelines","Product Management"],"positions":[{"title":"Medical Writer","company":"Therapeutics Inc. · 全职","date_range":"2024年9月 - 现在","duration":"2 年 1 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Regulatory Research Assistant","company":"National Taiwan University School of Pharmacy - Regulatory Science Innovation Center · 全职","date_range":"2022年8月 - 2023年7月","duration":"1 年","location":"Taipei, Taiwan","description":"• Managed regulatory science research projects integrating insights from FDA and EMA pharmacovigilance guidelines, leading to the publication of a co-first-authored article, contributing novel findings to the field of pharmaceutical sciences and clinical practice.  \n• Organized 10 conferences and effectively communicated with diverse stakeholders from TFDA (APAC Asia Pacific), academia, and industry to advance global regulatory harmonization, fostering knowledge exchange among regulatory science professionals worldwide. \n• Assisted in drafting technical guidance for the Center for Drug Evaluation in Taiwan to align with FDA patient-focused drug development, incorporating clinical outcome assessments into endpoints for regulatory decision-making. \n• Drove cross-disciplinary collaboration at the Platform for Research and Inspiration in Regulatory Science, facilitating partnerships for innovative medicinal product development.","skills":["Technical Reviews","U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA)","Regulatory Documentation","Written Communication","Regulatory G