ti-billion-dollar preclinical co-development programs in autoimmune and neurological diseases (where I am program lead and co-chair of the Joint Research Committee). I also take the role of clinical liaison for our clinical asset between the clinical team and our licensee partner presenting clinical results to the latter and coordinting communication and information exchanges among all parties.","skills":["技能: Therapeutic antibody discovery • Target selection and program inception • Program portfolio management • Preclinical candidate (PCC) & preclinical discovery and development • Business Development • Project leadership • Nonclinical NHP safety, PK • Preclinical discovery • Oncology • Immuno-oncology • Immunological & inflammatory • Autoimmune Diseases • Bispecific and multispecific antibodies • Antibody drug conjugate (ADC) & bispecific ADC • In vivo pharmacology • Biotechnology • Drug Discovery • In Vivo • Life Sciences","Therapeutic antibody discovery","Target selection and program inception","Program portfolio management","Preclinical candidate (PCC) & preclinical discovery and development","Business Development","Project leadership","Nonclinical NHP safety, PK","Preclinical discovery","Oncology","Immuno-oncology","Immunological & inflammatory","Autoimmune Diseases","Bispecific and multispecific antibodies","Antibody drug conjugate (ADC) & bispecific ADC","In vivo pharmacology","Biotechnology","Drug Discovery","In Vivo","Life Sciences","技能: Business Development • Project leadership • Preclinical discovery • Oncology • Immuno-oncology • Immunological & inflammatory • Autoimmune Diseases • In vivo pharmacology • In vitro pharmacology • Assay Development • Molecular & Cellular Biology • Cell Biology • Biochemistry • Biotechnology • Drug Discovery • In Vitro • In Vivo • Life Sciences","In vitro pharmacology","Assay Development","Molecular & Cellular Biology","Cell Biology","Biochemistry","In Vitro"]},{"title":"Head of Immuno-oncology Assays & Laboratory Operation