{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T09:52:22+08:00","record":{"name":"Ömer A.","current_title":"Bioinformatics and Cloud Infrastructure Lead","current_company":"Mirxes","location":"新加坡","headline":"Bioinformatics and Cloud Infrastructure Lead","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/omer-an","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAASu6_8BN62QxybcZlPa2t2SamsFnAu4Iqc","core_skills":["Genome Analysis","Gene Expression","Systems Biology"],"positions":[{"title":"Bioinformatics and Cloud Infrastructure Lead","company":"Mirxes","date_range":"4 年 5 个月","duration":"1 年 1 个月","location":"新加坡","description":"• Developed diagnostics tools for analyzing targeted gene sequencing panels in cancer patients Implemented bioinformatics pipelines for methylation and small RNA sequencing data analysis Processed over 1000 clinical samples using both cloud and local server environments Investigated biomarker discovery on RNA editing events and isomiRs in tissue and plasma samples Developed an in-house online platform on AWS for hosting, querying and exporting sample metadata Set up a local server from hardware procurement to user configuration for the data science team Supported internal wet lab projects providing QC, optimization and downstream analysis.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Bioinformatician","company":"Mirxes","date_range":"4 年 5 个月","duration":"1 年 1 个月","location":"新加坡","description":"• Developed diagnostics tools for analyzing targeted gene sequencing panels in cancer patients Implemented bioinformatics pipelines for methylation and small RNA sequencing data analysis Processed over 1000 clinical samples using both cloud and local server environments Investigated biomarker discovery on RNA editing events and isomiRs in tissue and plasma samples Developed an in-house online platform on AWS for hosting, querying and exporting sample metadata Set up a local server from hardware procurement to user configuration for the data science team S