{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T09:52:33+08:00","record":{"name":"Caoimhe Nic An tSaoir","current_title":"Founder & Principal Strategist","current_company":"Lonrú Consulting Ltd. · 全职","location":"爱尔兰","headline":"PhD, MBA | Founder & Principal, Lonrú Consulting | Practitioner-Builder for Life-Science Strategy, Governed Systems & Digital Execution","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/caoimhe-nic-an-tsaoir-74734951","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAroOOcB2MOWnIbmXcjg5WCuv2WZS9XZ1MQ","core_skills":["Assay Development","Budgeting","Lifesciences"],"positions":[{"title":"Founder & Principal Strategist","company":"Lonrú Consulting Ltd. · 全职","date_range":"2024年2月 - 现在","duration":"2 年 8 个月","location":"","description":"I founded Lonrú Consulting after observing a recurring execution gap in life sciences: strong strategies lose momentum when evidence, workflows, governance and practical tools are fragmented or missing. \nI operate at the intersection of molecular science, business strategy and digital product development. With a PhD in Molecular Oncology, an MBA and 15+ years across multinational clinical programmes, government agencies and venture-backed biotechnology companies, I lead the framing, architecture and accountability for each engagement. \n \nLonrú is a principal-led, specialist-supported practitioner-builder firm. We combine scientific depth, commercial judgement, governed data and technical execution through three connected services: \n \n• Strategic Consulting: translate scientific milestones, market signals and partner questions into clear commercial or operating decisions. \n• ActiveArchitecture™: design governed context, agentic workflows, human-review pathways, integrations and operating interfaces. \n• VantagePoint™: deploy approved work through portals, dashboards, dossiers, trackers and decision tools. \nActiveArchitecture™ connects Lonrú Context Engineering™, Lonrú Agentic Systems™, accountable review through Lonrú Consulting™, and VantagePoint™ activation. \n \nCurrent solutions include custom AI agent architecture and deployment, partner portals and dashboards, competitive intelligence engines, digital go-to-market strategy, workflow auditing and AI integration mapping, RFP and tender-response automation, and Generative Engine Optimization and SEO. \n \nWe support cell and gene therapy developers, CDMOs, CROs, technology providers, investors and academic translation teams. Lonrú Studios™ provides bespoke technical execution where required. \n \nMy aim is to make scientific complexity legible, governable and ready for the next decision.","skills":["Business Strategy","Product Development","Gene Therapy","Management Consulting","Competitive Intelligence","Digital Transformation","Workflow Automation","Market Analysis","Cell Therapy","Data Analytics","Solution Architecture","Go-to-Market Strategy","Artificial Intelligence (AI)","Pricing Strategy","Strategic Partnerships","Life Sciences","Biotechnology","Biopharmaceuticals","Business Development"]},{"title":"Founder","company":"SculleryMade - Home, Cook, Brew.","date_range":"2014年12月 - 现在","duration":"11 年 10 个月","location":"爱尔兰","description":"SculleryMade produces award winning artisan goods using quality, local ingredients via licensed partners.  \n \nProducts include:  \nBlack Puddin': OriginalBlack, BlackBrew, BlackLava.  \nVegan Black Pudding: BeetPuddin'.","skills":["Go-to-Market Strategy","Competitive Analysis","Sales Processes","Resource Allocation","Sales Management","Pricing Strategy","Soft Skills","Account Planning","Customer Service","Business Resilience","Management Review","Strategic Initiatives","Business Continuity","Digital Marketing","Change Management","Risk Management","Microsoft Excel","Business Analysis","Team Motivation","Strategic Vision","Scenario Planning","Program Management","Organization Skills","Mitigation Strategies","Communication","Budgeting","Management","Leadership","Cro