{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T09:55:41+08:00","record":{"name":"Dr. Jagadish KV PhD, MBA.","current_title":"Subject Matter Expert","current_company":"Solix Technologies, Inc. · 全职","location":"印度 特郎加纳 海得拉巴","headline":"Driving LifeSciences Healthcare Excellence with Smart Solutions","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dr-jagadish-kv-phd-mba-15704844","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAlCutMBuhHa_B8xcJ4yFjmdwWOfVrDp4Yo","core_skills":["Prompt engineer (non technical)","AI knowledge","Prompt Engineering","biology"],"positions":[{"title":"Subject Matter Expert","company":"Solix Technologies, Inc. · 全职","date_range":"2025年7月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 3 个月","location":"印度 特郎加纳 海得拉巴","description":"Enterprise AI Content Strategy & Data Curation SME,  \nI serve as the Subject Matter Expert (SME), bridging the gap between pharmaceutical domain knowledge and advanced technological development to build next-generation Enterprise AI capabilities. My primary focus is establishing the foundational data integrity required for high-fidelity  \n \nAI/ML applications in life sciences. Key responsibilities include:  \nAI-Ready Content Strategy: Collaborating directly with the Enterprise AI (EAI) Engineering team to design and build a 4th-generation AI platform featuring a curated, model-ready content library. \n \nKnowledge Transfer & Data Curation: Providing critical pharma domain expertise to ensure the content library is built with only the most relevant and required data extracted from multiple complex databases. I define comprehensive data curation and quality control methodologies. \n \nProcess Establishment: Establishing and implementing robust data extraction processes tailored to various data types, ensuring efficiency and scalability. Document and present findings and solutions clearly and effectively to both technical and non-technical stakeholders. \n \nFAIR Implementation & Accessibility: Implementing the FAIR Principles (Findable, Accessible, Interoperable, Reusable) across the entire dataset. This ensures the high-quality, normalized content is immediately and reliably accessible to bioinformaticians and biologists for downstream research and analysis. \n \nMy work directly enables the development of powerful AI tools that accelerate drug discovery and research.","skills":["Prompt engineer (non technical)","Subject Matter Experts","business analyst","AI knowledge","People Management"]},{"title":"Delivery manager / Project manager","company":"Innoplexus - a Partex Company · 全职","date_range":"2024年11月 - 2025年7月","duration":"9 个月","location":"印度 马哈拉斯特拉邦 浦那","description":"As Project / delivery manager I am responsible for the entire project life cycle. Starts with getting involved at the scoping of the project requirements, coordinating with stake holders in project budgeting, resource allocation, collaborating with teams in executing project execution, managing risks, and communicating with stakeholders to ensure the project is completed successfully, meets quality standards, and supports business goals. \n \nProjects contributed: Clinical trial prediction, Asset out licensing, Asset in licensing, product development (CTP and market analysis),","skills":["Business Strategy","Account Management","Program Delivery Management","Project Management"]},{"title":"Team lead, Strategy | Business development| Life science","company":"MOURI Tech · 全职","date_range":"2022年9月 - 2024年11月","duration":"2 年 3 个月","location":"hyderabad","description":"SME life sciences and healthcare: \nFacilitate knowledge transfer between technical team and client. \nAct as technical sales support. \nParticipate in pre sales calls, take responsibility of addressing clients issues. \nPreparing SOW and work proposals. \n \nMarketing:  \nDevelop case studies for ongoing projects. \nContribute to digital marketing. \nDrafting broachers, blogs and technical pages. \n \nBusiness analyst: \nConduct end to end business analyst functionalities starting from conducting discovery sessions, capturing the requirements, developing BRD, flowcharts, user stories, conducting grooming sessions, assisting in test case creation, managing client communication, developing UAT and support in post deployment activities.","skills":["Buiness analyst","scrum master","Generative AI"]},{"title":"Lead of Biology data Curation Vertical, Pharma Analytics Team","company":"Excelra","date_range":"6 年 6 个月","duration":"2 年 11 个月","location":"印度","description":"As a lead of biology data curation vertical, following are major responsibilities \nTeam management \nProject Management \nProject Planning, Execution and Delivery \nResource management \nProviding the training to the team as required","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Scientific Manager","company":"Excelra","date_range":"6 年 6 个月","duration":"2 年 11 个月","location":"印度","description":"As a lead of biology data curation vertical, following are major responsibilities \nTeam management \nProject Management \nProject Planning, Execution and Delivery \nResource management \nProviding the training to the team as required","skills":[]},{"title":"Scientific Manager","company":"Excelra","date_range":"6 年 6 个月","duration":"2 年 11 个月","location":"印度","description":"As a lead of biology data curation vertical, following are major responsibilities \nTeam management \nProject Management \nProject Planning, Execution and Delivery \nResource management \nProviding the training to the team as required","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Subject Matter Expert at Solix Technologies, Inc. · 2025年 - 现在 | a Partex Company - Delivery manager / Project manager at Innoplexus · 2024年 - 2025年 | Team lead, Strategy | Business development| Life science at MOURI Tech · 2022年 - 2024年 | Lead of Biology data Curation Vertical, Pharma Analytics Team at Excelra · 2019年 - 2022年 | Senior Scientific Manager at Excelra · 2019年 - 2022年 | Scientific Manager at Excelra · 2016年 - 201