{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T09:56:09+08:00","record":{"name":"Ivan Mejia, BA, BPS","current_title":"Pharmacy Intern","current_company":"CVS Pharmacy · 兼职","location":"美国 纽约 纽约","headline":"Student at Long Island University","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ivan-mejia-ba-bps-a2682423b","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAADu-kr4Bzn7_x6KoV1lWykZ_sHet4eDqDa0","core_skills":["紫外－可见分光光度法","发酵","光谱学"],"positions":[{"title":"Pharmacy Intern","company":"CVS Pharmacy · 兼职","date_range":"2023年6月 - 现在","duration":"3 年 4 个月","location":"","description":"• Assist in filling prescriptions under the supervision of a pharmacist by accurately counting and packaging medication, ensuring proper labeling, and maintaining a clean and organized workspace Help patients with questions regarding prescriptions, over-the-counter medications, dosage instructions, managing side effects, and general health inquiries Involved in clinical services such as medication therapy management, outreach phone calls, and vaccination services Accurately input prescription details into the pharmacy management system Assist with receiving, stocking, and monitoring medication expiration dates while maintaining adequate inventory by ordering medications and supplies as needed.","skills":[]},{"title":"Non-Patient Care Elective- Pharmacogenetics","company":"Mt. Sinai Medical Center","date_range":"2025年3月 - 2025年5月","duration":"3 个月","location":"","description":"• Engaged in intensive literature review in the following projects: Irinotecan and UGT1A1, the association of Marfan syndrome and fluoroquinolones, decongestants, stimulants, and systemic corticosteroids, using a drug panel for dosing medication based on pharmacogenetic results Streamlining the project on creating alerts based on pharmacogenetic results on EPIC Presented Journal club titled “The INGENIOUS trial: Impact of pharmacogenetic testing on adverse events in a pragmatic clinical trial” Presented Journal club titled “Clinical Benefits and Utility of Pretherapeutic DPYD and UGT1A1 Testing in Gastrointestinal Cancer: A Secondary Analysis of the PREPARE Randomized Clinical Trial”.","skills":[]},{"title":"Patient Care Elective","company":"Onco360 Oncology Pharmacy","date_range":"2025年1月 - 2025年2月","duration":"2 个月","location":"","description":"• Made phone calls to the doctor's office to confirm any updates regarding therapy changes, medication discontinuation, potential drug-drug interactions, and insurance matters related to the patient’s cancer medications. \n• Was exposed to the different types of cancer treatments, including chemotherapy, immunotherapy, and targeted therapies Completed 360 training modules covering the mechanism of action, black box warnings, precautions, and common side effects of chemotherapeutics dispensed by the pharmacy Observed how pharmacists contributed to treatment planning and provided empathetic support to both patients and their families.","skills":[]},{"title":"General Inpatient Medicine","company":"Northwell Health - Long Island Jewish Forest Hills","date_range":"2024年10月 - 2024年11月","duration":"2 个月","location":"","description":"• Participated in daily interdisciplinary rounds and addressed questions related to pharmacotherapy, including therapy adjustments, drug-drug interactions, and alternative pharmacological options Monitored the entire general medicine floor for therapeutic efficacy and adverse drug events while communicating any necessary dose adjustments for comorbidities, organ function, or lab results Conducted patient counseling as part of the STAR program and Vivo Health, which aims to provide pharmacist-led medication counseling to reduce recurrent hospital visits Documented assessments and interventions in patient’s electronic medical records using FARM format Presented journal club titled “Finerenone in Heart Failure with Mildly Reduced or Preserved Ejection Fraction” and patient case presentation on Angioedema.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Pharmacy Intern at CVS Pharmacy · 2023年 - 现在 | Non-Patient Care Elective- Pharmacogenetics at Mt. Sinai Medical Center · 2025年 - 2025年 | Patient Care Elective at Onco360 Oncology Pharmacy · 2025年 - 2025年 | Long Island Jewish Forest Hills - General Inpatient Medicine at Northwell Health · 2024年 - 2024年 | Weill Cornell Medical Center - Ambulatory Care at New York Presbyterian · 2024年 - 2024年 | Institutional at Brookdale University Hospital Medical Center · 2023年 - 2023年 | Community Care at Salzman Chemist · 2022年 - 2022年","education":[{"school":"Long Island University","degree":"Doctor of Pharmacy - PharmD","field_of_study":"Pharmacy","date_range":"2021年 - 2025年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"Long Island University","degree":"Bachelor's degree","field_of_study":"Pharmaceutical Sciences","date_range":"2021年 - 2023年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"Hunter College","degree":"Bachelor of Arts - BA","field_of_study":"Chemistry","date_range":"2017年 - 2020年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | Long Island University，Doctor of Pharmacy - PharmD · 2021年 - 2025年 | Long Island University，Bachelor's degree · 2021年 - 2023年 | Hunter College，Bachelor of Arts - BA · 2017年 - 2020年 | Borough of Manhattan Community College，Associate of Science - AS · 2015年 - 2017年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 Pharmacist 转变 每日津贴和轮换 晚班 日 职位性质 全职 所在地点 现场办公: 美国 纽约 纽约 10030 远程办公: 美国 开始日期 我在随便看看，时间可灵活安排 工作场所类型 现场办公 混合办公 远程办公"],"languages":[],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
