{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T09:58:06+08:00","record":{"name":"Yuchen Bai","current_title":"VP, Head of Computational Biology","current_company":"IDEAYA Biosciences · 全职","location":"美国 宾夕法尼亚州 诺里斯敦","headline":"VP, Head of Computational Biology","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yuchenbai","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAFOWlYBrco5DnnpEV7OzOFAbDK5HWB5mzs","core_skills":["Spatial Transcriptomics technology","Clinical","Pharmaceutical Industry"],"positions":[{"title":"VP, Head of Computational Biology","company":"IDEAYA Biosciences · 全职","date_range":"2023年3月 - 现在","duration":"3 年 7 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 南旧金山","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Consultant, AI & Advanced Technology","company":"Genentech · 全职","date_range":"2022年10月 - 现在","duration":"4 年","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 南旧金山","description":"• Apply machine learning to predictive biomarker identifications. \n• Focus on clinical biomarker, omics and imaging data from clinical trials. \n• In-depth profiling and analysis of TME and immune profiles of patients. \n• Develop multimodality models for disease progression, patient stratification, and response to therapeutics, in cancer and inflammatory diseases. \n• Build custom knowledge graphs for project and disease-specific knowledge discovery, to enable deep learning and interpretable AI models.","skills":[]},{"title":"VP, Head of Data Science","company":"Mestag Therapeutics · 全职","date_range":"2021年1月 - 2022年10月","duration":"1 年 10 个月","location":"","description":"• Function lead in computational biology under CSO and a dotted line reporting to CEO. \n• In silico target discovery and validation, and disease mechanism deconvolution in cancer and autoimmune diseases. \n• Focused on disease microenvironment, immunocytes (e. \n• g. \n• , tumor infiltrating T-cells) and stroma interaction, immune check point inhibition, and pathogenic fibroblast biology. \n• Provided integrated data science, omics, and translational supports to all therapeutics programs within the company. \n• Develop biomarker hypotheses for patient stratification through integrated analysis of omics studies with machine learning. \n• Omics-profiled in vitro disease (cancer, autoimmune diseases, etc. \n• ) models, which co-cultured organoids with stroma cells and immunocytes for CRISPR screening. \n• Helped design screening formats and readout assays, constructed screening gene lists based on omics analysis of healthy donor and patient samples. \n• Performed screening hit identification and prioritization analysis. \n• Developed single cell genomics (e. \n• g. \n• , scRNA-seq) analysis capability. \n• Continuously expanded and optimized various data analysis pipelines. \n• Carried out scRNA-seq studies, used machine and deep learning to perform in-depth and integrated data analysis. \n• Applied spatial transcriptomics data analysis (10X Visium, Nanostring CosMx, and Vizgen MERFISH, etc. \n• ) to therapeutics development research. \n• Designed and conducted spatial transcriptomics experiments to study immune suppressive TME. \n• Developed analysis solutions that combined imaging, protein staining and mRNA signals for cell segmentation. \n• Built cloud-native computational biology and data science infrastructure. \n• Developed state-of-art multi-omics analysis solutions in AWS.","skills":["Computer Vision","Cloud Computing","Single Cell Sequencing","Program Management","Team Management","Python (Programming Language)","Statistical Modeling","Pharmacology","Clinical Development","Deep Learning","Biostatistics","Single Cell Genomics","Spatial Transcriptomics technology","Machine Learning","Immune-Mediated Inflammatory Diseases"]},{"title":"Senior Director, Transitional Genomics","company":"Autolus Ltd. · 全职","date_range":"2018年2月 - 2020年12月","duration":"2 年 11 个月","location":"","description":"• Group leader in translational genomics under Senior VP of Translational Medicine. \n• Biomarker identification and validation. \n• Identify biomarkers for cancer immunotherapies such as CAR-T; Focused on biomarkers that predict response and safety. \n• Clinical Biomarker data management; Working with clinical operation teams, biometrics, IT and CROs to develop solutions for biomarker data collection, standardization, analysis, visualization and sharing. \n• Develop NGS-based companion diagnostics for clinical trial recruitment with external partner; support and contribute to the generation of regulatory documents and patents. \n• Indication selection and target identification and validation. \n• Identify and validate CAR-T targets through genomics; select and prioritize cancer indications; develop pre-clinical biomarkers. \n• Identify mechanisms of resistance and develop combination therapies for cancer. \n• Decipher immunosuppressive TMEs for selected cancer types; Use methods including deep learning to develop rational combinations of cancer therapy strategies. \n• Tissue and single cell multi-omics studies. \n• Apply technologies such as 10X genomics Ab-Seq, CyTOF, Nanostring and chip cytometry to the whole development process from construct design, to drug product characterization, manufacturing, patient selection and patient response in clinical trials. \n• Novel antibody/binder development. \n• Immune Repertoire and clonality analysis; NGS-based methods to select binders for novel CAR-T binder and antibody-based therapeutics development; Analyze human, mouse and rat IgG, TCR, BCR and HLA libraries. \n• Genomics data integration focusing around cancer immunogenomics. \n• Establish and grow centralized data storage and data integration as well as integrated data analysis of multi-omics platforms. \n• Use Machine learning algorithms to analyze large multi-omics studies, to build predictive models, to decipher the tumor microenvironment and patient immune response.","skills":["Cloud Computing","Single Cell Sequencing","Program Management","Team Management","Python (Programming Language)","Statistical Modeling","Pharmacology","Clinical Development","Deep Learning","Biostatistics","Single Cell Genomics","Machine Learning","Clinical Research","Immune-Mediated Inflammatory Diseases"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | VP, Head of Computational Biology at IDEAYA Biosciences · 2023年 - 现在 | Senior Consultant, AI & Advanced Technology at Genentech · 2022年 - 现在 | VP, Head of Data Science at Mestag Therapeutics · 2021年 - 2022年 | Senior Director, Transitional Genomics at Autolus Ltd. · 2018年 - 2020年 | Associate Director at Janssen Pharmaceuticals · 2014年 - 2018年 | Associate Scientific Director at Johnson & Johnson · 2014年 - 2018年 | Head of Bioinformatics, Oncology R&D at GlaxoSmithKline · 2013年 - 2014年 | Manager, Oncology Bioinformatics at GlaxoSmithKline · 2012年 - 2013年 | Senior Principal Research Scientist at Pfizer Pharmaceuticals · 2009年 - 2012年 | Principal Research Scientist at Wyeth Pharmaceuticals · 2005年 - 2009年 | Senior Research Scientist at Wyeth Research · 2000年 - 2005年 | Post-doctoral Scientist at J&J · 2000年 - 2000年 | Postdoc Fellow at University of Pennsylvania · 1997年 - 1999年 | Doctoral Candidate at Rutgers University · 1992年 - 1997年","education":[{"school":"Villanova University","degree":"M.S.","field_of_study":"Computer Sciences","date_range":"1998年 - 1999年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"Rutgers University–Newark","degree":"Ph.D.","field_of_study":"Molecular Biology","date_range":"1992年 - 1997年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"天津医科大学","degree":"M.D.","field_of_study":"Medicine","date_range":"1988年 - 1992年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | Villanova University，M.S. · 1998年 - 1999年 | Rutgers University–Newark，Ph.D. · 1992年 - 1997年 | 天津医科大学，M.D. · 1988年 - 1992年 | 清华大学，BS · 1985年 - 1988年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 Head Vice President Director Team Manager Team Leader 职位性质 兼职 合同制 全职 所在地点 现场办公: 美国 英国 加拿大 远程办公: 美国 宾夕法尼亚州 诺里斯敦 开始日期 我在随便看看，时间可灵活安排 工作场所类型 现