{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:03:00+08:00","record":{"name":"Dane Bao","current_title":"Senior Director Research Development","current_company":"MilliporeSigma","location":"美国 俄亥俄州 Holland","headline":"Enjoying Life!","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dane-bao-679551187","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAACwKi30BnWf9ojgaq8nLLEkatmw6itBTkB4","core_skills":["Customer Support"],"positions":[{"title":"Senior Director Research Development","company":"MilliporeSigma","date_range":"13 年","duration":"1 年 8 个月","location":"美国","description":"Led the development of integrated intelligent laboratory systems combining artificial intelligence and laboratory automation to significantly enhance data acquisition efficiency in life science research. \n \nIntroduced AI-driven analytical tools integrated with automated experimental platforms to support drug discovery, gene editing, and large-scale screening workflows. \n \nAccelerated data analysis pipelines by enabling real-time experimental feedback, optimizing experimental design and driving laboratory digitalization and automation.","skills":["技能: Customer Support","Customer Support"]},{"title":"Director of Research Development","company":"MilliporeSigma","date_range":"13 年","duration":"1 年 8 个月","location":"美国","description":"Led the development of integrated intelligent laboratory systems combining artificial intelligence and laboratory automation to significantly enhance data acquisition efficiency in life science research. \n \nIntroduced AI-driven analytical tools integrated with automated experimental platforms to support drug discovery, gene editing, and large-scale screening workflows. \n \nAccelerated data analysis pipelines by enabling real-time experimental feedback, optimizing experimental design and driving laboratory digitalization and automation.","skills":["技能: Customer Support","Customer Support"]},{"title":"Chief Scientist","company":"MilliporeSigma","date_range":"13 年","duration":"1 年 8 个月","location":"美国","description":"Led the development of integrated intelligent laboratory systems combining artificial intelligence and laboratory automation to significantly enhance data acquisition efficiency in life science research. \n \nIntroduced AI-driven analytical tools integrated with automated experimental platforms to support drug discovery, gene editing, and large-scale screening workflows. \n \nAccelerated data analysis pipelines by enabling real-time experimental feedback, optimizing experimental design and driving laboratory digitalization and automation.","skills":["技能: Customer Support","Customer Support"]},{"title":"Senior Research Development Scientist","company":"MilliporeSigma","date_range":"13 年","duration":"1 年 8 个月","location":"美国","description":"Led the development of integrated intelligent laboratory systems combining artificial intelligence and laboratory automation to significantly enhance data acquisition efficiency in life science research. \n \nIntroduced AI-driven analytical tools integrated with automated experimental platforms to support drug discovery, gene editing, and large-scale screening workflows. \n \nAccelerated data analysis pipelines by enabling real-time experimental feedback, optimizing experimental design and driving laboratory digitalization and automation.","skills":["技能: Customer Support","Customer Support"]},{"title":"Research Scientist","company":"MilliporeSigma · 全职","date_range":"2010年 - 2013年","duration":"3 年 1 个月","location":"美国","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Chemical Probe Development Scientist","company":"CICBDD · 全职","date_range":"2004年 - 2010年","duration":"6 年 1 个月","location":"美国","description":"Led target selection strategies across oncology, immunology, and neurodegenerative diseases, defining comprehensive probe development roadmaps. \n \nIdentified critical structural domains of disease-relevant targets to guide high-selectivity probe design. \n \nApplied