{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:03:42+08:00","record":{"name":"鲍一帆","current_title":"研究助理","current_company":"牛津大学 · 全职","location":"牛津地区","headline":"鲍一帆, DPhil Student in Oxford","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yifan-bao98","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAB4Pc5kBUz9rjOzso82Q1tQOuU-A80D3Wc8","core_skills":["CCK-8 Assay","Pulldown Assay","Nuclease Assay"],"positions":[{"title":"研究助理","company":"牛津大学 · 全职","date_range":"2022年9月 - 2023年8月","duration":"1 年","location":"英国牛津","description":"乳腺癌靶点开发中的分子机制研究 \n牛津大学临床实验室科学纳菲尔德分部（NDCLS）David Kerr Group \n• 完成包含249个候选基因的CRISPR筛选，选取2个候选开展RNA干扰、细胞因子刺激及药物剂量与时间梯度验证。 \n• 结合Western blot、CCK-8与IncuCyte分析蛋白表达和细胞活力；在结果未能复现预期表型时，根据细胞形态及生长动力学异常识别潜在模型质量问题并提出重新建模与复筛方案。","skills":["RNAi","Tissue Culture","Real-Time Polymerase Chain Reaction (qPCR)","Western Blotting","ELISA","Transfection","IncuCyte","CRISPR","MTT","Flow Cytometry","ImageJ","Origin (Software)"]},{"title":"研究助理","company":"上海绿谷制药有限公司 · 全职","date_range":"2019年12月 - 2020年5月","duration":"6 个月","location":"中国上海浦东","description":"制剂辅料相容性研究 \n本科毕业项目，华东理工大学与上海绿谷制药有限公司合作项目 \n• 筛选9种药用辅料及丸芯，依据分子量分布、含量、溶解性与检测干扰初筛出蔗糖丸芯和甘露醇丸芯。 \n• 经HPLC、IR及氢/碳核磁验证后推荐甘露醇丸芯；研究结论已用于企业后续制剂工艺开发。","skills":["High-Performance Liquid Chromatography (HPLC)","IR Spectroscopy","NMR Spectroscopy","Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP)","Standard Operating Procedure (SOP)","Fluidization","mals"]},{"title":"质量控制分析员","company":"天士力生物医药股份有限公司 · 实习","date_range":"2019年9月 - 2019年10月","duration":"2 个月","location":"中国上海浦东","description":"• 按SOP协助2批稳定性样品的外观、pH值、蛋白质浓度及无菌检查，并参与检测记录与文件整理。","skills":["High-Performance Liquid Chromatography (HPLC)","Stability Testing","Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP)","Standard Operating Procedure (SOP)"]},{"title":"研发实验助理","company":"杭州九源基因工程有限公司 · 实习","date_range":"2017年7月 - 2017年8月","duration":"2 个月","location":"中国浙江杭州","description":"• 小规模测试10种培养基配方，筛选出促进细胞生长的候选条件，供后续放大及蛋白产量验证。 \n• 按SOP处理并分析3批HPLC研发样品。","skills":["Tissue Culture","High-Performance Liquid Chromatography (HPLC)","Good Manufacturing Practice (GMP)","Standard Operating Procedure (SOP)"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 研究助理 at 牛津大学 · 2022年 - 2023年 | 研究助理 at 上海绿谷制药有限公司 · 2019年 - 2020年 | 质量控制分析员 at 天士力生物医药股份有限公司 · 2019年 - 2019年 | 研发实验助理 at 杭州九源基因工程有限公司 · 2017年 - 2017年","education":[{"school":"英国牛津大学","degree":"博士 - DPhil","field_of_study":"肿瘤学","date_range":"2023年 - 2027年","activities":"活动与社团: 牛津中国学生学者联谊会 主席团成员／宣传部长","grade":""},{"school":"英国帝国理工学院","degree":"理学硕士","field_of_study":"应用基因组学","date_range":"2020年 - 2021年","activities":"","grade":"Merit"},{"school":"华东理工大学","degree":"工程学士","field_of_study":"制药工程","date_range":"2016年 - 2020年","activities":"活动与社团: 华理足协 主席","grade":"85%"}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 英国牛津大学，博士 - DPhil · 2023年 - 2027年 | 英国帝国理工学院，理学硕士 · 2020年 - 2021年 | 华东理工大学，工程学士 · 2016年 - 2020年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 Scientist Researcher Research Assistant 所在地点 现场办公: 英国伦敦地区 英国 英格兰 牛津 中国 上海市 中国 北京市 工作场所类型 现场办公 混合办公 远程办公"],"languages":[{"name":"Chinese","proficiency":"母语"}],"native_chinese":true,"detail_error":""}}
{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:03:52+08:00","record":{"name":"Jian B.","current_title":"Co-founder and CEO","current_company":"ZY Therapeutics Inc.","location":"美国 北卡罗来纳州 达勒姆","headline":"Entrepreneur, Chemist","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jian-bao-nc","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAAQ_hMByQ1SrNFdZgJ_u6xQsSdneUrzWiU","core_skills":["Solid State Analysis","Topical Formulation","Pharmaceutical Industry"],"positions":[{"title":"Co-founder and CEO","company":"ZY Therapeutics Inc.","date_range":"2015年9月 - 现在","duration":"11 年 1 个月","location":"400 Park Offices Dr., Suite 310, Research Triangle Park, NC 27709","description":"ZY Therapeutics, Inc., focuses on developing innovative precision drug delivery technology.  \nThe ZY team has developed two Smart Formulation platforms, Active Targeting and Solubility Optimization. Active Targeting allows inclusion of tumor specific targeting ligands to increase the therapeutic index. Solubility Optimization has proven effective in dramatically increasing water solubility, shortening the clinical pathway to market. ZY’s lead formulation was recognized by the NCL, part of a national lab established by FDA, NCI and NIST, in a concerted effort to regulate and support nanotechnology in the oncology space. \nZY’s first biodegradable nano-formulation of a cytotoxic agent, ZY-010-PNP for solid tumors, completed Pre-IND with the FDA with the 505b(2) regulatory path way and our development proposal agreed to by the agency. ZY-010-PNP demonstrated a ‘unique drug-release profile’ in in vitro human plasma stable isotope studies conducted by NCL scientists. Another ZY formulation ZY-012-CNP, an active targeting delivery nanomedicine for prostate cancer, is in preclinical development. \nZY has a full pipeline of nano-formulations with target indications covering the majority of solid tumors including, but not limited to, TNBC, OC and mCPRC. \nZY Therapeutics has a strong interdisciplinary R&D team with 4,500+ ft2 lab space equipped with modern chemistry and formulation equipment in the heart of the southeast bio-hub. The core team has a combined decades of pharmaceutical product development experience, with veteran cross-functional leadership. \nZY welcomes inquiries for potential partnerships or collaboration.","skills":[]},{"title":"Founding Partner and Business Development","company":"Onward Innovations","date_range":"2013年6月 - 现在","duration":"13 年 4 个月","location":"Cary, NC","description":"• Proposing Small Business Innovative Research grant for NSF, NIH/NCI solicitations  \n• Process optimization and trouble shooting for drug manufacturing \n• Bridging the technology innovation and market needs between the US and China","skills":[]},{"title":"member","company":"NCRAF","date_range":"2013年 - 现在","duration":"13 年 9 个月","location":"","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Vice President Regulatory Affairs and International Strategy","company":"Solipharma Inc.","date_range":"2015年1月 - 2015年9月","duration":"9 个月","location":"Cary, NC / Hangzhou, China","description":"• Leading regulatory strategy for pipeline product development \n• Providing strategic guidance and supervision for the optimal portfolio management  \n• Planning and implementing business development strategy in the US / EU market","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Co-founder and CEO at ZY Therapeutics Inc. · 2015年 - 现在 | Founding Partner and Business Development at Onward Innovations · 2013年 - 现在 | member at NCRAF · 2013年 - 现在 | Vice President Regulatory Affairs and International Strategy at Solipharma Inc. · 2015年 - 2015年 | Senior Scientist at Novan Therapeutics · 2010年 - 2013年 | Senior Research Associate at Covidien (Tyco Healthcare) · 2004年 - 2010年 | Senior Chemist at Synthetech Inc · 2003年 - 2004年 | Postdoc Researcher at pfizer · 2001年 - 2002年","education":[{"school":"University of Pittsburgh","degree":"Ph.D.","field_of_study":"Organic Chemistry","date_range":"1997年 - 2001年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"北京大学","degree":"B.S.","field_of_study":"Chemistry","date_range":"1991年 - 1996年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"Xinyang High","degree":"","field_of_study":"","date_range":"1989年 - 1991年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | University of Pittsburgh，Ph.D. · 1997年 - 2001年 | 北京大学，B.S. · 1991年 - 1996年 | Xinyang High · 1989年 - 1991年 | 档案分析行 | 最新动态 | 1 次浏览 | 保存到项目 | 将Jian保存到项目 | 发消息给Jian | Jian B.的更多操作","open_to_work":[],"languages":[{"name":"English, Chinese","proficiency":""}],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
