{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:04:42+08:00","record":{"name":"Di Bei","current_title":"QTS Leader","current_company":"Otsuka Pharmaceutical Companies (U.S.)","location":"美国 新泽西州 普林斯顿","headline":"Knowledge is power","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/di-bei-52005723","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAATP9ygBGLtd83hGRaCUfljN7gyYbuYaJuc","core_skills":["Phoenix","Pharmaceutical Industry","Gastroplus"],"positions":[{"title":"QTS Leader","company":"Otsuka Pharmaceutical Companies (U.S.)","date_range":"2 年 4 个月","duration":"9 个月","location":"","description":"Lead Early Clinical Development in IMM/CNS \nLCM of Abilify and Rexulti","skills":[]},{"title":"EPTM lead","company":"Otsuka Pharmaceutical Companies (U.S.)","date_range":"2 年 4 个月","duration":"9 个月","location":"","description":"Lead Early Clinical Development in IMM/CNS \nLCM of Abilify and Rexulti","skills":[]},{"title":"Clinical Pharmacology Lead","company":"Johnson & Johnson · 全职","date_range":"2020年11月 - 2024年6月","duration":"3 年 8 个月","location":"美国 宾夕法尼亚州 Spring House","description":"Lead global late stage development","skills":[]},{"title":"Associate Director (CPP – Immunology)","company":"Janssen","date_range":"2020年11月 - 2024年6月","duration":"3 年 8 个月","location":"","description":"• Drive decision-makings for immunology TA and also across TA (late stage asset for multiple TAs) via application of quantitative methods to integrate knowledge of PK, PD (biomarkers, TE, RO), patient characteristics, disease states, MoA, and DDI to optimize dose selection, dosage regimens and study designs. \n• Develop clin pharm and pharmacometric plan from pre-IND to post-approval. \n• Manage internal and external quantitative pharmacometrics to inform Go-No-Go: including timely deliverables external NCA vendor, internal popPK/PD pharmacometrician and QSP/MBMA modeler. \n• Contribute to key product differentiation strategies based on a compound’s key attributes and relevant therapeutic landscape. \n• Participate in HA interactions globally (including IBs, IND’s, briefing books, NDA / MAA submissions, EoP2 mtg, MIDD pilot-program, Type-C mtg, Type-D mtg, PMDA mtg, BB/BD and responses to health authority questions) Assess potential business development opportunities (ie. \n• due diligence effort in in-licensing and out-licensing of assets). \n• Present and publish scientific data at conferences and in peer-reviewed journals Identify new opportunities for applied scientific and technical advancement within the division. \n• Keep track of HA (FDA, EMEA, ICH) guidelines in the design of clinical development plans and studies. \n• Mentor junior scientists Highlights of achievements (Publications on Nipocalimab).","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior clinical pharmacologist (CPP – Oncology)","company":"Bristol-Myers Squibb","date_range":"2017年5月 - 2020年4月","duration":"3 年","location":"","description":"• Liaison between Japan CPP and US CPP (manage collaborations across TAs) Mapped out Clinical Pharmacology and Pharmacometrics strategy Hands-on pharmacometrician for Fibrosis and Oncology pipelines. \n• Managed CRO professionals and external pharmacometric vendor (Certara, Pharmetheus, and pmx group of Prof. \n• Joga). \n• Highlights of achievements (Publications on Nivolumab).","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | QTS Leader at Otsuka Pharmaceutical Companies (U.S.) · 2026年 - 现在 | EPTM lead at Otsuka Pharmaceutical Companies (U.S.) · 2024年 - 2025年 | Associate Director (CPP – Immunology) at Janssen · 2020年 - 2024年 | Clinical Pharmacology Lead at Johnson & Johnson · 2020年 - 2024年 | Associate Director at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2020年 - 2020年 | Senior clinical pharmacologist (CPP – Oncology) at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2017年 - 2020年 | Senior Research Investigator at Bristol Myers Squibb · 2017年 - 2020年 | Clinical Pharmacologist & Pharmacometrician at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2016年 - 2017年 | Summer intern at Novartis · 2015年 - 201