{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:09:19+08:00","record":{"name":"Ekkaphon Metharom","current_title":"Co-Founder and Chief Executive Officer","current_company":"Acceleron Co., Ltd. · 自雇","location":"泰国 曼谷 曼谷","headline":"Driving Health Innovation | Catalyst for Emerging Tech & Circular Economy | Let’s Connect & Build Together","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ekkaphon-metharom-86758a60","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAzmTE8BeWGYKD4L68A4uK7eyrf8t77tXfU","core_skills":["Pharmaceutical Industry","Medical Affairs","Virology"],"positions":[{"title":"Co-Founder and Chief Executive Officer","company":"Acceleron Co., Ltd. · 自雇","date_range":"2024年4月 - 现在","duration":"2 年 6 个月","location":"曼谷地区","description":"Bridging the gap between groundbreaking technological discoveries and their transformative impact on patients' lives. Our mission is to empower a dynamic ecosystem of innovators, researchers, and healthcare providers by offering the tools and expertise needed to bring cutting-edge solutions to market efficiently and effectively. \n \nSpecialize in fostering collaboration across the healthcare and technology sectors, ensuring that novel ideas are not only developed but also seamlessly integrated into real-world applications. By accelerating the journey from lab to bedside, we enable faster access to life-changing therapies, diagnostics, and digital health solutions that improve patient outcomes and drive meaningful progress in global healthcare. \n \nOur commitment to innovation extends beyond technology—we are dedicated to creating a sustainable ecosystem where science, business, and patient care converge. Through strategic partnerships, we don’t just support innovation— we make it impactful.","skills":[]},{"title":"Managing Partner","company":"Micro Energy Co., Ltd. · 自雇","date_range":"2024年10月 - 现在","duration":"2 年","location":"曼谷地区","description":"Pioneering sustainable solutions through battery regeneration and the circular battery economy. Our mission is to help businesses and individuals reduce costs, minimize environmental impact, and extend the lifecycle of their energy storage systems. By combining cutting-edge technology with a commitment to sustainability, we are redefining how the world thinks about battery use and disposal. \n \nWe specialize in advanced battery regeneration techniques that restore used and degraded batteries to near-original performance, offering a cost-effective alternative to replacement. Our innovative processes not only save clients significant expenses but also contribute to a cleaner planet by reducing electronic waste and the demand for raw materials. \n \nAs champions of the circular battery economy, we design and implement closed-loop systems that prioritize reuse, recycling, and recovery. From collection and regeneration to repurposing and responsible end-of-life management, we ensure that every battery reaches its full potential while minimizing its environmental footprint. \n \nHelping our clients gain access to sustainable, economically viable solutions that align with their environmental goals. Together, we are powering a greener future.","skills":[]},{"title":"Advisor to Subcommittee on Research and Innovation for Economic and Social Development","company":"Parliament of Thailand · 季节性","date_range":"2025年4月 - 2025年10月","duration":"7 个月","location":"泰国","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Advisor to Sub-Committee on Thailand Copyright Act","company":"Parliament of Thailand · 季节性","date_range":"2021年2月 - 2021年11月","duration":"10 个月","location":"","description":"","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Co-Founder and Chief Executive Officer at Acceleron Co., Ltd. · 2024年 - 现在 | Managing Partner at Micro Energy Co., Ltd. · 2024年 - 现在 | Advisor to Subcommittee on Research and Innovation for Economic and Social Development at Parliament of Thailand · 2025年 - 2025年 | Advisor to Sub-Committee on Thailand Copyright Act at Parliament of Thailand · 2021年 - 2021年 | Country Medical Lead - Southeast Asia at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2017年 - 2023年 | Country Medical Lead-Thailand and South East Asia/ Board of Directors at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2015年 - 2023年 | Medical Advisor- Vaccines, Oncology and Women's Health at MSD (Thailand) Ltd. · 2014年 - 2015年 | Senior Scientific Advisor - Oncology and Liver Health - Thailand and Singapore at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2011年 - 2014年 | Official attached to Senator at The Senate of Thailand · 2003年 - 2004年 | Research Scientist at Medical Molecular Biology Unit, Siriraj Hospital · 2002年 - 2003年","education":[{"school":"悉尼新南威尔士大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)","field_of_study":"Medicine","date_range":"2005年 - 2010年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"英国伦敦大学学院","degree":"Master of Science (M.Sc.)","field_of_study":"Molecular Medicine","date_range":"2000年 - 2001年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"英国伦敦大学学院","degree":"Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.)","field_of_study":"Biotechnology","date_range":"1997年 - 2000年","activities":"","grade":"Second-class honour"}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 悉尼新南威尔士大学，Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.) · 2005年 - 2010年 | 英国伦敦大学学院，Master of Science (M.Sc.) · 2000年 - 2001年 | 英国伦敦大学学院，Bachelor of Science (B.Sc.) · 1997年 - 2000年 | Mander Portman Woodward Limited (MPW)，GCSEs and A-levels · 1994年 - 1997年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":[],"languages":[],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
