{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:11:18+08:00","record":{"name":"Qi Cai, Ph.D.","current_title":"Senior Director","current_company":"Therakos LLC · 全职","location":"美国","headline":"Scientific Innovator| Drug Discovery & Development| Cell and Gene Therapies| Oncology| Immunology| Inflammation| Medical Device| Small Molecule| Antibody, TCE and ADC| Strategy and Portfolio Management |Inclusive Mentor","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/qicaiphd","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAABLBUIB-IUqf0P0zxD8wDrn9BC8rdwIWU8","core_skills":["In vivo delivery","Non-Viral Vectors","T cell therapy"],"positions":[{"title":"Senior Director","company":"Therakos LLC · 全职","date_range":"2025年10月 - 现在","duration":"1 年","location":"","description":"• Spearheaded the development of the science team at Therakos Healthcare Limited, focusing on innovative healthcare solutions.  \n• Led initiatives on the mechanism of action of Extracorporeal Photopheresis (ECP) to enhance treatment efficacy.  \n• Drove AI initiatives in science and engineering, integrating cutting-edge technology into clinical practices.  \n• Oversaw patent review and strategy, ensuring robust intellectual property management.\n\n• Built the company’s first integrated science function within a 40-year medtech organization, establishing new capabilities in wet-lab discovery research, translational biology, biomarker strategy, and mechanism-of-action studies.","skills":[]},{"title":"Head of Disruptive Biology","company":"Kite Pharma","date_range":"7 年 4 个月","duration":"3 年 9 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣莫妮卡","description":"-- Directed multi-modal discovery programs leveraging validated targets for concurrent development of small molecules, T cell engagers, and cell therapies. \n-- Integrated automation and AI to reduce assay turnaround time while enhancing data reproducibility. \n-- Accelerated IND clearance for novel platforms by embedding downstream functions into early discovery, reducing development timelines by over 50% for increased efficiency. \n-- Engineered and optimized cell-based pharmacology assays (e.g., viability, activation, cytokine profiling) to support SAR-guided compound development. \n-- Monitored competitive landscape to identify scientific gaps and opportunities, directly informing asset prioritization and development strategies in oncology, inflammatory and rare diseases. \n-- Served as primary relationship owner for over five strategic external collaborations at Kite Pharma, leading partner selection, agreement structuring, issue resolution, and tailored site engagement strategies to enable successful delivery of clinical programs.\n\n• Accelerated IND clearance for novel platforms by embedding downstream functions into early discovery, reducing development timelines by over 50%, setting the record speed from target identification to IND.","skills":["技能: Epigenetics • Budget Management • Business Strategy • Innovation Consulting • Technological Innovation • Publications • Public Speaking • Communication • Matrix Leadership • Oncology • Product Lifecycle Management • Project Management • Drug Development • Immunology • Product Development • Drug Discovery • Cell Therapy","Epigenetics","Budget Management","Business Strategy","Innovation Consulting","Technological Innovation","Publications","Public Speaking","Communication","Matrix Leadership","Oncology","Product Lifecycle Management","Project Management","Drug Development","Immunology","Product Development","Drug Discovery","Cell Therapy","技能: Epigenetics • Budget Management • Business Strategy • Innovation Consulting • Technological Innovation • Publications • Public Speaking • Communication • Matrix Leadership • Oncology • Program Evaluation • Product Lifecycle Management • Project Management • Bioinformatics • Drug Development • Immunology • Product Development • Drug Discovery • Cell Therapy","Program Evaluation","Bioinformatics","技能: Innovation Consulting • Techn