{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:13:22+08:00","record":{"name":"Tianyu (Clement) Cai","current_title":"Principal Scientist, CMC Analytical development - Cell Therapy","current_company":"Aurion Biotech · 全职","location":"波士顿地区","headline":"Analytical Development and CMC","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tianyu-clement-cai-212a14119","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAB2ENS4BYxckygPhVqbgJbjmNqsoY8PMDtk","core_skills":["PDX animal model","Polymerase Chain Reaction (PCR)","CART"],"positions":[{"title":"Principal Scientist, CMC Analytical development - Cell Therapy","company":"Aurion Biotech · 全职","date_range":"2023年6月 - 现在","duration":"3 年 4 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Team Lead, CMC Analytical development - Gene and Cell Therapy","company":"Prime Medicine, Inc. · 全职","date_range":"2022年11月 - 2023年6月","duration":"8 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"• The innovation of prime editor, a next-generation gene editing tool that can search and correct the individual mutations found across patients. \n• Lead analytical team in the development, qualification, and validation of assays to characterize and release 5 different gene and cell therapy products. \n• Lead cross-functional project team for developing prime editing, viral and non-viral gene and cell therapy platforms for therapeutic application. \n• Working as a key SME on supporting GMP-compliant analytical methods to meet US FDA requirements for clinical stages, such as ELISA, flow cytometry, CCV, HPLC, qPCR, potency assay, etc. Support technology transfer of products and processes into the cGMP facility and work with external CTL (contract testing lab)/CDMO (contract development and manufacturing organizations) Manage internal analytical group to execute routine analytical testing to support research development and process development for cell therapy products. \n• Play a key role in project team meetings and work closely with other functions such as Process Development, Manufacturing, Research Development, and Quality Control Departments to ensure project milestones and deliverables are met. \n• Provide strategic and scientific guidance to analytical, formulation, and process development from discovery to clinical stage for gene and cell therapy products.","skills":[]},{"title":"Principal Scientist, CMC Analytical development","company":"Codiak BioSciences · 全职","date_range":"2021年8月 - 2022年9月","duration":"1 年 2 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"• The innovation of exosome-based therapeutics aimed at treating a broad range of disease areas. \n• Lead analytical team in the development, qualification, and QC transfer of assays to characterize and release 3 clinical-stage products. \n• Play a key row in early and late-stage clinical bioassay qualification and validation to support the required testing of exosome products, and ensure the assays meet regulatory requirements for the clinical stage. \n• Working on method SOP, qualification reports, and other technical documents to support regulatory submissions and other groups. \n• Develop bioassay using design of experiments (DoE) and other contemporary development tools. \n• Evaluate and implement the novel high throughput (HTP) and automated analytical technologies and platforms for productivity and product quality, and residual process impurities. \n• Providing scientific and strategic leadership in all analytical development technical areas, serving as the analytical development expert on project team meetings.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Scientist II, Analytical development - Cell Therapy","company":"Luye Pharma Group · 全职","date_range":"2020年7月 - 2021年8月","duration":"1 年 2 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 沃本","description":"• The innovation of immunotherapies against human cancer and novel CAR-T treatment against solid tumors. \n• Lead cross-functional program team for the development and execution of multiple in vit