{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:14:58+08:00","record":{"name":"Yamei Cai, Ph.D.","current_title":"Microfluidics Scientist","current_company":"RevivBio · 全职","location":"波士顿地区","headline":"Postdoctoral Fellow at Harvard University","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yamei-cai-ph-d-7b529129a","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAEhM3DkBoI8x_pFsNFNeKcrOytbrZDBEFK0","core_skills":["Droplet Microfluidics","High-Performance Liquid Chromatography (HPLC)","Droplet Digital PCR (ddPCR)"],"positions":[{"title":"Microfluidics Scientist","company":"RevivBio · 全职","date_range":"2024年2月 - 现在","duration":"2 年 8 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"• Developing droplet-based microfluidics platform for ultra-high-throughput enzyme evolution in droplets for Climate and Agriculture applications Fabricated microfluidic devices, generated hydrogel-barcoded beads for protein capture, encapsulated single cells in droplets, and conducted droplet sorting to enrich for highly active enzymes.","skills":[]},{"title":"Postdoctoral Fellow","company":"Harvard University · 全职","date_range":"2018年1月 - 2023年1月","duration":"5 年 1 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"· Developed an ultra-sensitive single-cell barcoded lung cancer mutation detection platform in response to drugs towards precision medicine \n· Conducted next-generation sequencing using Illumina instruments and conducted data analysis. Developed custom Python and R codes to process various single-cell projects, notably including single-cell multiple mutation detection to capture EGFR mutations at loci 19, 20, and 21 per cell, as well as single-cell RNA-Seq analysis on mice retinal cells. \n· Developed an ultra-sensitive protein detection platform using droplet-microfluidics in collaboration with David Walt’s group: 25x more sensitive than state-of-art SIMOA by Quanterix (NASDAQ: QTRX); licensed to Quanterix in 2022\n\n• Developed an ultra-sensitive single-cell barcoded lung cancer mutation detection platform in response to drugs towards precision medicine Conducted next-generation sequencing using Illumina instruments and conducted data analysis.","skills":[]},{"title":"Engineering Lead - single-cell platform","company":"Suzhou Industrial Park Dragondrop Inn Biotech · 全职","date_range":"2017年7月 - 2017年12月","duration":"6 个月","location":"中国 江苏省 苏州市","description":"•Developed a streamlined workflow for performing single-cell RNA sequencing utilizing droplet- \nmicrofluidics and barcoded beads \n•Designed and fabricated custom microfluidics chips to optimize experimental conditions \n•Successfully managed a team of three individuals, overseeing their work and ensuring effective collaboration in building a state-of-the-art microfluidics setup in a newly established office. \n•Demonstrated leadership skills by coordinating tasks, providing guidance, and fostering a cohesive work environment to achieve project objectives\n\n• Developed a streamlined workflow for performing single-cell RNA sequencing utilizing droplet-microfluidics and barcoded beads Designed and fabricated custom microfluidics chips to optimize experimental conditions Successfully managed a team of three individuals, overseeing their work and ensuring effective collaboration in building a state-of-the-art microfluidics setup in a newly established office.","skills":[]},{"title":"Pharmacist","company":"First Sanatorium Navy Qingdao · 全职","date_range":"2016年7月 - 2017年6月","duration":"1 年","location":"中国 山东省 青岛","description":"• Dispensed prescription medications and provided comprehensive instructions to patients regarding drug usage and related information. \n• Assigned to this role immediately following graduation from Second Military Medical University.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Microfluidics Scientist at RevivBio · 2024年 - 现在 | Postdoctoral Fellow at Harvard University · 2018年 - 2023年 | Engineering Lead - single-cell platform at Suzh