{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:17:14+08:00","record":{"name":"Hui Cai","current_title":"Vice President and Head of PR, Head of Content","current_company":"药明康德","location":"美国","headline":"innovator and ecosystem builder shaped by science, strategy and a global perspective - working collaboratively to advance meaningful progress in health | PhD, MBA","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/hui-cai-69b9302","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAB-QtcBMAhxkw2UMrNgpjb_FlxvmgMjuNc","core_skills":["Pharmaceutical Industry","Life Sciences","Genomics"],"positions":[{"title":"Vice President and Head of PR, Head of Content","company":"药明康德","date_range":"17 年","duration":"7 年 9 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"WuXi AppTec is a trusted partner and contributor to the pharmaceutical and life sciences industries, providing R&D and manufacturing services that help advance healthcare innovation. With operations across Asia, Europe, and North America, we offer integrated, end-to-end services through our CRDMO (Contract Research, Development, and Manufacturing Organization) platform. We are privileged to work alongside thousands of customers and partners to support their efforts to bring breakthrough treatments to patients. Guided by our vision that every drug can be made and every disease can be treated, we are committed to advancing breakthroughs for patients – one collaboration at a time.  \n \nIn my role, I draw on a career shaped by science, strategy, and a global perspective to help strengthen WuXi AppTec’s engagement with the broader community. It centers on building understanding across disciplines and regions, supporting conversations that move ideas forward, and fostering an environment where collaboration can take root, and where meaningful progress can happen — whether by convening global forums, shaping strategic dialogue, or supporting partners as they navigate scientific and industry challenges.  \n \nWhile my work spans communications, ecosystem engagement, and industry partnerships, the deeper purpose is to contribute collaboratively to propel our industry forward. This is the same one that has guided WuXi AppTec for 25 years: enabling breakthroughs for patients and supporting innovators wherever they are. I am grateful to play a small part in that larger mission.","skills":[]},{"title":"Vice President of Corporate Alliances and Head of PR and Corporate Communications","company":"药明康德","date_range":"17 年","duration":"7 年 9 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"WuXi AppTec is a trusted partner and contributor to the pharmaceutical and life sciences industries, providing R&D and manufacturing services that help advance healthcare innovation. With operations across Asia, Europe, and North America, we offer integrated, end-to-end services through our CRDMO (Contract Research, Development, and Manufacturing Organization) platform. We are privileged to work alongside thousands of customers and partners to support their efforts to bring breakthrough treatments to patients. Guided by our vision that every drug can be made and every disease can be treated, we are committed to advancing breakthroughs for patients – one collaboration at a time.  \n \nIn my role, I draw on a career shaped by science, strategy, and a global perspective to help strengthen WuXi AppTec’s engagement with the broader community. It centers on building understanding across disciplines and regions, supporting conversations that move ideas forward, and fostering an environment where collaboration can take root, and where meaningful progress can happen — whether by convening global forums, shaping strategic dialogue, or supporting partners as they navigate scientific and industry challenges.  \n \nWhile my work spans communications, ecosystem engagement, and industry partnerships, the deeper purpose is to contribute collaboratively to propel our industry forward. This is the same one that has guided WuXi AppTec for 25 years: enabling breakthroughs for patients and supporting innovators wherever they are. I am grateful to play a small part in that larger mission.","skills":[]},{"title":"Vice President of Corporate Alliances","company":"药明康德","date_range":"17 年","duration":"7 年 9 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"WuXi AppTec is a trusted partner and contributor to the pharmaceutical and life sciences industries, providing R&D and manufacturing services that help advance healthcare innovation. With operations across Asia, Europe, and North America, we offer integrated, end-to-end services through our CRDMO (Contract Research, Development, and Manufacturing Organization) platform. We are privileged to work alongside thousands of customers and partners to support their efforts to bring breakthrough treatments to patients. Guided by our vision that every drug can be made and every disease can be treated, we are committed to advancing breakthroughs for patients – one collaboration at a time.  \n \nIn my role, I draw on a career shaped by science, strategy, and a global perspective to help strengthen WuXi AppTec’s engagement with the broader community. It centers on building understanding across disciplines and regions, supporting conversations that move ideas forward, and fostering an environment where collaboration can take root, and where meaningful progress can happen — whether by convening global forums, shaping strategic dialogue, or supporting partners as they navigate scientific and industry challenges.  \n \nWhile my work spans communications, ecosystem engagement, and industry partnerships, the deeper purpose is to contribute collaboratively to propel our industry forward. This is the same one that has guided WuXi AppTec for 25 years: enabling breakthroughs for patients and supporting innovators wherever they are. I am grateful to play a small part in that larger mission.","skills":[]},{"title":"Vice President of Business Development","company":"药明康德","date_range":"17 年","duration":"7 年 9 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"WuXi AppTec is a trusted partner and contributor to the pharmaceutical and life sciences industries, providing R&D and manufacturing services that help advance healthcare innovation. With operations across Asia, Europe, and North America, we offer integrated, end-to-end services through our CRDMO (Contract Research, Development, and Manufacturing Organization) platform. We are privileged to work alongside thousands of customers and partners to support their efforts to bring breakthrough treatments to patients. Guided by our vision that every drug can be made and every disease can be treated, we are committed to advancing breakthroughs for patients – one collaboration at a time.  \n \nIn my role, I draw on a career shaped by science, strategy, and a global perspective to help strengthen WuXi AppTec’s engagement with the broader community. It centers on building understanding across disciplines and regions, supporting conversations that move ideas forward, and fostering an environment where collaboration can take root, and where meaningful progress can happen — whether by convening global forums, shaping strategic dialogue, or supporting partners as they navigate scientific and industry challenges.  \n \nWhile my work spans communications, ecosystem engagement, and industry partnerships, the deeper purpose is to contribute collaboratively to propel our industry forward. This is the same one that has guided WuXi AppTec for 25 years: enabling breakthroughs for patients and supporting innovators wherever they are. I am grateful to play a small part in that larger mission.","skills":[]},{"title":"Chair, American Chemical Society San Diego Section","company":"American Chemical Society","date_range":"2006年 - 2007年","duration":"1 年 1 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Commissioner, Science and Technology Commission","company":"The City of San Diego","date_range":"2002年 - 2008年","duration":"6 年 1 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"The Science & Technology Commission advises the Mayor and San Diego City Council on policy and issues shaping biotechnology, digital wireless communication, high definition digital technology, medical imaging, and materials science technology. Commissioners also advise the Mayor and City Council on matters which impact both the technology industry and the city’s research and scientific institutions in order to help ensure that the San Diego Region can continue to attract and incubate growth and investment.","skills":[]},{"title":"Project Leader, Drug Discovery","company":"Johnson & Johnson · 全职","date_range":"1999年2月 - 2008年3月","duration":"9 年 2 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Vice President and Head of PR, Head of Content at WuXi AppTec · 2019年 - 现在 | Vice President of Corporate Alliances and Head of PR and Corporate Communications at WuXi AppTec · 2013年 - 2018年 | Vice President of Corporate Alliances at WuXi AppTec · 2011年 - 2013年 | Vice President of Business Development at WuXi AppTec · 2009年 - 2011年 | Chair, American Chemical Society San Diego Section at American Chemical Society · 2006年 - 2007年 | Commissioner, Science and Technology Commission at The City of San Diego · 2002年 - 2008年 | Project Leader, Drug Discovery at Johnson & Johnson · 1999年 - 2008年","education":[{"school":"Scripps Research","degree":"PhD","field_of_study":"Chemistry","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"北京大学","degree":"Bachelor of Science (B.S.)","field_of_study":"","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"University of California, San Diego - Rady School of Management","degree":"MBA","field_of_study":"","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | Scripps Research，PhD | 北京大学，Bachelor of Science (B.S.) | University of California, San Diego - Rady School of Manag