{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:17:26+08:00","record":{"name":"Cynthia Cai","current_title":"Founder and Principal","current_company":"Tharton Consulting","location":"费城地区","headline":"Life Sciences Executive | Investor | Board Director | Cross-Border Strategy Advisor","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cynthiacai","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAGP5ZABFIcC-x61l3vmZris71vZS9vtM1s","core_skills":["Post Investment Management","Segmentation","New Business Development"],"positions":[{"title":"Founder and Principal","company":"Tharton Consulting","date_range":"2018年4月 - 现在","duration":"8 年 6 个月","location":"费城地区","description":"As Founder and Principal of Tharton Consulting, serve as a trusted advisor to biopharma companies and life science investors, including venture capital and private equity firms. Specialize in business development, cross-border market expansion, and commercialization strategy. Tharton provides strategic support for global partnerships, fundraising, M&A, and portfolio growth. Leveraging deep industry knowledge and a global network, I help clients navigate complex markets, accelerate innovation, and scale internationally. With a focus on both scientific and commercial value, Bridge stakeholders across geographies to drive meaningful outcomes in the healthcare and life sciences sectors.","skills":["Organizational Consulting","Board Level"]},{"title":"Independent Board of Director","company":"RNA NanoBiotics, Inc. · 兼职","date_range":"2025年8月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 2 个月","location":"","description":"RNA Nanobiotics was established to transform cutting-edge RNA nanotechnology into an innovative delivery system that improves the therapeutic outcomes of patients with cancer. Its proprietary RNA Nanotechnology Platform enables the targeted delivery of RNAi, Radioisotopes, and Chemotherapeutics for safe and effective cancer treatments.","skills":["Early Stage Investment","Board of Directors"]},{"title":"Member, Board of Directors","company":"Basking Biosciences Inc","date_range":"2022年10月 - 2024年1月","duration":"1 年 4 个月","location":"","description":"Basking Biosciences is a clinical-stage biopharmaceutical company developing a first-in-class, reversible thrombolytic therapy for acute ischemic stroke and other thrombotic conditions. Its lead candidate, BB-031, is an RNA aptamer designed for rapid clot dissolution, paired with a proprietary reversal agent, BB-025, which enables immediate neutralization in the event of bleeding—bringing a new level of safety and precision to acute stroke treatment. \n \nIn late 2023, Basking successfully closed a $55 million Series A financing, led by ARCH Venture Partners with participation from other leading life sciences investors. The funding supports continued clinical development of BB-031 and further positions the company to transform stroke care.","skills":["Board Level","Early Stage Investment"]},{"title":"Member, Board Of Directors","company":"Amberstone Biosciences · 兼职","date_range":"2021年12月 - 2026年8月","duration":"4 年 9 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 欧文","description":"Amberstone Biosciences is a biotech startup dedicated to discovering and developing transformative therapeutic antibodies using innovative technologies and creative partnerships. The company focuses on addressing serious unmet medical needs through a novel antibody discovery platform and a pipeline of first-in-class candidates. As a Board Member, provide strategic guidance on corporate development, fundraising, and scientific direction, supporting Amberstone’s mission to bring life-changing therapies to patients worldwide.","skills":["Board Level","Early Stage Investment"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Founder and Principal at Tharton Consulting · 2018年 - 现在 | Independent Board of Director at RNA NanoBiotics, Inc. · 2025年 - 现在 | Member, Board of Directors at Basking Biosciences Inc · 2022年 - 2024年 | Member, Board Of Directors at Amberstone Bioscien