th Finance. \n• Directed proposal-to-award lifecycle (RFPs, contracts, change orders), shaping program scope and resource strategy for new and existing clients. \n• Acted as senior escalation point for complex operational and client issues, driving cross-functional resolution across biometrics, clinical, and data teams. \n• Led process improvement initiatives, enhancing project tracking, reporting efficiency, and operational scalability via Microsoft Dynamics 365. \n• Mentored and developed project managers, strengthening organizational capability and delivery consistency.","skills":["Clinical Trials","CRO Management","Biopharmaceuticals","Project Management"]},{"title":"Global Programme Manager","company":"LumiraDx","date_range":"2021年4月 - 2022年8月","duration":"1 年 5 个月","location":"","description":"- Led concept-to-launch development programs for infectious and respiratory disease molecular diagnostic products. \n \n- Partnered with R&D, Regulatory Affairs, Quality, Product Management, and Operations teams to ensure milestone execution and compliance with FDA and EU regulatory frameworks. \n \n- Conducted risk assessments and implemented mitigation strategies to address technical and regulatory challenges. \n \n- Communicated program status, risks, and roadmap updates to senior stakeholders. \n \n- Supported Design Control documentation and regulatory submissions (FDA 510k, IVDR CE Marking).\n\n• Directed global IVD development programs for infectious and respiratory disease diagnostics, spanning feasibility, design, validation, and commercialization. \n• Drove cross-functional alignment across R&D, Product, Regulatory, Quality, and Operations, ensuring adherence to Design Control and global regulatory frameworks. \n• Established integrated program plans, milestone governance, and risk management strategies, enabling on-time delivery across geographically distributed teams. \n• Partnered with executive leadership to support program prioritization, tradeoff decisions, and resource allocation across multiple initiatives. \n• Led program execution through regulatory submission readiness and product launch, ensuring compliance and market readiness.","skills":["Program Management","Molecular Diagnostics","Medical Devices","Product Management","In Vitro Diagnostics (IVD)"]},{"title":"Sr. Project Manager/ Sr. Regulatory & Marketing Manager","company":"Wondfo USA","date_range":"2017年11月 - 2021年4月","duration":"3 年 6 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"- Led US regulatory team through the 510K submission process from start to end including regulatory  \nstrategy and planning, as well as technical document preparation; also managed clinical CROs as company liaison. \n \n- Planned and executed project schedules, monitored deliverables, and facilitated risk planning and issue resolution. \n \n- Coordinated with regulatory, quality, operations, and marketing teams to prepare compliance documentation and product launch readiness. Built and led the in-house US regulatory function and successfully submitted FDA 510(k) applications. \n \n- Supported commercialization and product launch through coordinated marketing programs for sales teams, distributors, and external partners for IVD devices in drugs of abuse, infectious disease and women's health.","skills":["ISO 13485","Medical Devices","Product Management","Marketing Strategy","Project Management"]},{"title":"Account Manager","company":"Selleck Chemicals LLC","date_range":"2014年8月 - 2017年11月","duration":"3 年 4 个月","location":"","description":"Supporting early drug discovery, target functional study and cellular signal transduction research with highest quality and most comprehensive collection of bioactive molecules and screening compound libraries","skills":["Biotechnology","Marketing","Biopharmaceuticals"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Associate Director Project Management at Pharmapace, Inc. · 2023年 - 2025年 | Global Programme Manager at LumiraDx · 2021年 - 