{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:27:37+08:00","record":{"name":"Song Cao","current_title":"PHD Researcher","current_company":"University of Cambridge","location":"英国 英格兰 Cambridge","headline":"UCambridge CompBio and AI researcher | PhD in Biochemistry","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/song-cao-a8170a1b0","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAADE6HYEBYH2zZstzroEirM1S2K1YdPeniKM","core_skills":["Model safety evaluation","In-silico Cell Model","Recombinant protein"],"positions":[{"title":"PHD Researcher","company":"University of Cambridge","date_range":"2023年10月 - 现在","duration":"3 年","location":"Hollfelder Lab","description":"• Develop multimodal language models and novel fitness metrics to optimize protein engineering \n• Design cell foundational models for genome-scale cell reprogramming strategies & identify novel enzymatic/regulatory elements \n• Evaluate and optimize large DNA models for biosafety using adversarial learning and CoT\n\n• Advisor: Dr. \n• Florian Hollfelder, professor of Chemical and Synthetic Biology. \n• LLM for protein optimization: Devise novel fitness metrics and multimodal LMs to learn from high-throughput protein mutational scanning of IRED & Mid1 enzymes and form an active learning loop to efficiently guide directed evolution by suggesting variants with enhanced Kcat/Km; AUC↑4.5% / Top 20 Jaccard Index↑15% on held-out libraries. \n• Novel gene component mining: Utilize contrastive learning and prompt-tuned GPT to discover novel enzymes/ gene editors with novel functions from microbe/plant metagenomes. \n• AI-assisted cell modeling: Reconstruct quantitative gene regulatory networks (GRNs) from single-cell data using cross attention-based genome language foundation models; combine inferred GRNs with VAE structure to encode and predict transcriptome-level perturbation effects.","skills":["Cell Biology","Model safety evaluation","In-silico Cell Model","Large Language Models (LLM)","Protein Engineering","High Throughput Screening","Graph Neural Network"]},{"title":"AI Algorithm Engineer","company":"XLab, Tianrang Intelligence","date_range":"2022年12月 - 2023年6月","duration":"7 个月","location":"中国 上海市","description":"• Design transformer-based antibody-antigen interaction (AAI) prediction with 88.2% precision in leave-one-out experiment \n• Fine-tune and redesign RFDesign and RFDiffusion to efficiently design and screen for novel IL-10 inhibitor and EPOR agonists peptides \n• Write 3 patents and software copyright in the field of drug design and protein analysis\n\n• Advisor: Dr. \n• Hongjiang Miao, director of XLab Platform. \n• Lead compound discovery: Design novel reinforcement learning supervised graph convolutional network to simultaneously model interaction complex and generate small molecule inhibitors from target protein sequence. \n• Antibody-antigen interaction (AAI) prediction: Design de novo TransformerPPI model from scratch to mimic residue-level protein-protein interactions, and increase AAI prediction precision to 88.2% in leave-one-out experiment; utilize the prediction to redesign CDR sequences for antibody targeting LAG3 with 62.5% better-than-WT rate. \n• Protein structure design: Combine protein 3D generation models such as RFDesign and RFDiffusion with structure evaluation models such as AlphaFold2 and Rosetta to efficiently design and screen for novel IL-10 inhibitor and EPOR agonists peptides.","skills":["Generative AI Tools","Protein Structure","Diffusion","Protein-protein Interactions","Drug Design"]},{"title":"AI Consultant","company":"Trusteem Information Technology, Shanghai","date_range":"2022年2月 - 2022年12月","duration":"11 个月","location":"","description":"• Advisor: Mrs. \n• Lu Gao, founder and CEO of Trusteem. \n• Industrial AI: Help Aero Engine Corporation of China build own agentic AI models of dynamic assembly-line defect detection (computer vision) and systematic manufacturing pipeline optimization (graph policy network). \n• Manufacturing and management intelligence: Build efficient manufacturing planning system for Ingersoll Rand’s MSG production project in Wujiang, reducing 15.8% annual cost, and design an associated intelligent management system based on reinforcement learning to forecast future changes in enterprise demand and growth.","skills":[]},{"title":"Research Intern (Remote)","company":"Shanghai Jiao Tong University","date_range":"2020年8月 - 2020年12月","duration":"5 个月","location":"Key Laboratory of Systems Biomedicine","description":"• Compare and review performance of multiple protein sequence encoding schemes which utilize physiochemical features of amino acids \n• Propose and validate the significance of genome 3D position information in deep and convolutional prediction of protein-protein interaction","skills":["Literature Reviews","Gated Recurrent Units (GRU)","Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN)","Protein encoding"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | PHD Researcher at University of Cambridge · 2023年 - 现在 | AI Algorithm Engineer at XLab, Tianrang Intelligence · 2022年 - 2023年 | AI Consultant at Trusteem Information Technology, Shanghai · 2022年 - 2022年 | Research Intern (Remote) at Shanghai Jiao Tong University · 2020年 - 2020年 | Junior Programmer at UC San Diego School of Medicine · 2019年 - 2021年 | Research Assistant at UC San Diego · 2017年 - 2019年 | Research And Development Intern at ABB Inc. · 2016年 - 2016年","education":[{"school":"英国剑桥大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy - PhD","field_of_study":"Biochemistry","date_range":"2023年 - 2026年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"美国加州大学圣迭戈分校","degree":"Bachelor of Science - BS","field_of_study":"Bioinformatics","date_range":"2015年 - 2019年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 英国剑桥大学，Doctor of Philosophy - PhD · 2023年 - 2026年 | 美国加州大学圣迭戈分校，Bachelor of Science - BS · 2015年 - 2019年 | 美国加州大学圣迭戈分校，Bachelor of Science - BS · 2015年 - 2019年 | 美国加州大学圣迭戈分校 | 美国加州大学圣迭戈分校 | 档案意向行装饰","open_t