hed in 6 scientific papers.","skills":[]},{"title":"Associated Researcher","company":"Center of Molecular Immunology","date_range":"2013年8月 - 2016年6月","duration":"2 年 11 个月","location":"Havana, Cuba","description":"Development of Bioconjugates comprising therapeutic monoclonal Antibodies and inorganic nanoparticles (gold and iron) for the diagnosis and treatment of autoimmune diseases. \nDevelopment of electrochemical biosensors for monitoring consumption of essential amino acids in bioreactors.\n\n• Company focused on the production of monoclonal antibodies for the therapy of cancer and autoimmune diseases. \n• Conceived and lead 3 projects: 1- Development of new enzyme-based amperometric biosensors for monitoring the consumption of amino acids in CHO-cells fermentation tanks. \n• 2- Development of antibody-nanoparticle conjugates for the development of new treatments for cancer and autoimmune diseases. \n• 3- Synthesis and use of magnetic nano particle-protein conjugates for purification of antibodies from fermentation supernatants.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Sr. Development Scientist at Malvern Panalytical · 2023年 - 现在 | Sr. Development Scientist at MicroCal from Malvern-Panalytical · 2019年 - 现在 | Development Scientist at Malvern Panalytical · 2019年 - 2023年 | Research Assistant Professor-A at University of Massachusetts Amherst · 2016年 - 2019年 | Associated Researcher at Center of Molecular Immunology · 2013年 - 2016年 | Assistant Professor at University of Havana · 2010年 - 2016年","education":[{"school":"Universidad de La Habana","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy - PhD","field_of_study":"Chemistry","date_range":"2007年 - 2010年","activities":"","grade":"4.0/4.0"},{"school":"Universidad de La Habana","degree":"Master of Science - MS","field_of_study":"Inorganic Chemistry","date_range":"2003年 - 2007年","activities":"","grade":"4.0/4.0"},{"school":"Universidad de La Habana","degree":"Bachelor of Science - BS","field_of_study":"Chemistry"