{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:29:50+08:00","record":{"name":"Yiting Cao","current_title":"Senior Medical Affairs & Regulatory Affairs Specialist, Clinical Evaluation & Regulatory Compliance","current_company":"Baxter International Inc. · 全职","location":"芝加哥地区","headline":"Senior Medical Affairs / Regulatory Affairs / Clinical Quality Assurance Specialist","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/yiting-cao-70513251","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAArgIHUB0PafbI0W3-zBT_BPJLQ3w7zwCYU","core_skills":["Post-Market Clinical Follow-Up","Clinical Experience","Clinical Trial / Study"],"positions":[{"title":"Senior Medical Affairs & Regulatory Affairs Specialist, Clinical Evaluation & Regulatory Compliance","company":"Baxter International Inc. · 全职","date_range":"2020年3月 - 现在","duration":"6 年 7 个月","location":"芝加哥地区","description":"• Strategically plan, develop and execute clinical evaluation strategies and procedures for deliverables and projects of Class I - Class III implantable medical devices, IV solution products, drug-device combination (DDC), intelligent patient monitoring systems, therapeutic systems, medical device software, etc manufactured by Baxter, Hill-Rom and Vantive (a spin-off from Baxter). \n• Overseeing and guiding multiple international cross-functional product teams (MA, RA, PMS, QA, Product Development Owners, Clinical Research Leads, Business/Marketing, etc) to execute medical writing strategies for deliverables required for regulatory registration/approval/certification. \n• Planning, developing, and managing global QMS procedures/SOPs, templates and guidance for MA/RA deliverables such as CEP, CER, PMCFP, PMCFER and SSCP throughout the entire product lifecycle to ensure compliant with EU MDR, MEDDEV 2.7/1 Rev. 4, MDD, MDCG guidance, IMDRF guidance, and ISO standards. \n• Developing and managing global QMS procedures/SOP and templates for China CER to ensure compliance with NMPA regulations and guidelines. \n• Identifying issues and gaps in medical affairs deliverables and providing remediation solutions and assistance for corporate executives, directors, managers, product teams, SMEs, and medical writers on regulatory compliance, interpretation of regulations, guidance and standards, medical writing strategies & processes for pre-market and post-market medical devices. \n• Regulatory auditing expert for MDD/MDR/ISO 13485/MDSAP and for new medical device manufacturer or recertification \n• Providing regulatory compliance trainings on clinical evaluation / medical writing for teams.","skills":["Transparency","Stakeholder Engagement","Business Case Preparation","Self-confidence","Project Risk","Project Reviews","Project Initiation","Competitive Strategies","Product Delivery","Change Control","Cross-functional Team Leadership","Project Management","Employee Training","Medical Device Quality Assurance","Medical Device Regulation (MDR)","medical device","Medical Affairs","Regulatory Affairs","Post-Market Clinical Follow-Up","SSCP","clinical evaluation","Regulatory Requirements","Protocol Development","Clinical Trials","Clinical Data","Healthcare Industry","Literature Reviews","Medical Writing"]},{"title":"Senior Medical Writer","company":"BD (Becton Dickinson)","date_range":"2019年9月 - 2019年12月","duration":"4 个月","location":"","description":"• Conducted clinical evaluation for conformity assessment, safety and performance / risk-benefit analysis for pre-market and post-market medical devices. \n• Planned, prepared, wrote, reviewed, revised and updated EU clinical evaluation reports (CERs) with extensive communication, coordination, and cooperation with multiple cross functional teams from different divisions including medical affairs (MA), quality assurance (QA), regulatory affairs (RA), and R&D, etc. \n• Developed literature search protocols and reports, performed systematic literature search in PubMed and Embase and supplemental internet search, appraised and analyzed abstracts and full-text articles for clinical evaluation. \n• Performed extensive searches in both internal post-market surveillance database and external clinical experience database including FDA MAUDE database, FDA recall database, MHRA database, BfArM database, Swissmedic database, etc. \n• Reviewed and appraised clinical trial reports, clinical claims, clinical benefits, IFU/labelling, medical affair reports, quality assurance reports, regulatory affair reports, R&D reports, and product safety reports for clinical evaluation.","skills":["Transparency","Stakeholder Engagement","Business Case Preparation","Communication","Clinical Trials","Clinical Data","Healthcare Industry","Literature Reviews","Medical Devices"]},{"title":"Senior Clinical Evaluation and Regulatory Specialist","company":"Aidrox","date_range":"2018年8月 - 2019年8月","duration":"1 年 1 个月","location":"芝加哥地区","description":"• Developed literature search strategies, protocols and reports, performed literature search, appraisal and critical analysis for deliverables including EU CER and China CER. \n• Performed external vigilance and recall database searches (FDA MAUDE, FDA Recall, MHRA, BfArM, Swissmedic, etc.) and analyzed search results for deliverables. \n• Provided quality reviewing for deliverables compliant with EU MDD, MEDDEV 2.7/1 Rev 4, MDR and MDCGs, IMDRF, ISO, and China NMPA regulations. \n• Identified clinical evaluation and regulatory compliance gaps in deliverables and provided strategical and tactical remediation solutions.","skills":["teaching and mentoring","build and manage a team","training experience","clinical evaluation"]},{"title":"Professional Trainee","company":"Kaplan and USMLE World","date_range":"2016年2月 - 2018年7月","duration":"2 年 6 个月","location":"","description":"• Took courses and received professional training from Kaplan and USMLE World on USMLE exams.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Senior Medical Affairs & Regulatory Affairs Specialist, C