{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:31:44+08:00","record":{"name":"Zongfu Cao","current_title":"Bioinformatician and Biostatistician","current_company":"National Institute for Family Planning","location":"中国 北京市 海淀区","headline":"MD., Biostatistician / Bioinformatician","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/zongfu-cao-a355ab1b","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAQuZgkB3PocGSkTiFA1bKUzgLNhowOD_OU","core_skills":["Text Mining","Biostatistics","Sequencing"],"positions":[{"title":"Bioinformatician and Biostatistician","company":"National Institute for Family Planning","date_range":"2015年8月 - 现在","duration":"11 年 2 个月","location":"中国 北京市","description":"1. Compile the phenotype-gene-variant databases related to genetic disease based on the public databases including HPO, Orphanet, OMIM, ClinVar, Uniprot, COSMIC, GeneReview, etc; \n2. Text mining the information of phenotype-gene-variant from PubMed literatures; \n3. Design multiple primers and probes for NIPT for T21; \n4. Identify the pathogenic mutations in trios/patients of rare diseases with whole-exome sequencing and targeted sequencing; \n5. Design and development of genetic testing products in precision medicine on different platforms, such as NGS, Microfluidics, massarray.","skills":[]},{"title":"Principal Scientist","company":"BeiGene","date_range":"2011年7月 - 2015年7月","duration":"4 年 1 个月","location":"中国 北京市","description":"Bioinformatics and biostatistics in oncology drug discovery \n1. Clinical trial design, sample size calculation, PKPD analysis,statistical analysis and visualization. \n2. Compile public datasets from NCBI GEO, EBI ArrayExpress, Broad CCLE, Sanger cell line project, and patent database etc \n3. whole-genome biomarker screening, and background investigation of targeted biomarkers, including gene expression, copy number, and mutations(SNPs and indels) \n4. Patenability analysis for new antibody development; \n5. Develop tools for fitting dose-response curves, synergy evaluation of two compounds, extract and visualization for the genetic information of fishing genes.","skills":[]},{"title":"Data analyst","company":"CapitalBio","date_range":"2008年7月 - 2011年6月","duration":"3 年","location":"中国 北京市","description":"1. Develop efficient tools based on R/BioConductor and perl for microarray gene expression analysis \n2. Perform genome-wide association analysis, linkage analysis, copy number analysis \n3. Statistical analysis for the development of custom chips","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Bioinformatician and Biostatistician at National Institute for Family Planning · 2015年 - 现在 | Principal Scientist at BeiGene · 2011年 - 2015年 | Data analyst at CapitalBio · 2008年 - 2011年","education":[{"school":"北京协和医学院","degree":"Doctor of Medicine (MD)","field_of_study":"Epidemiology and statistics","date_range":"2013年 - 2016年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"北京协和医学院","degree":"master","field_of_study":"genetics","date_range":"2005年 - 2008年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"Peking University Health Science Center","degree":"B.A.","field_of_study":"preventive medicine","date_range":"2000年 - 2005年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 北京协和医学院，Doctor of Medicine (MD) · 2013年 - 2016年 | 北京协和医学院，master · 2005年 - 2008年 | Peking University Health Science Center，B.A. · 2000年 - 2005年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":[],"languages":[],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:31:52+08:00","record":{"name":"Pengxiao Cao","current_title":"Postdoctoral associate","current_company":"University of Louisville","location":"美国 肯塔基州 列克星敦","headline":"Postdoctoral associate at University of Louisville","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/pengxiao-cao-19661a5a","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAyMvYIBd_2HIz-qUibQcq3GTDS9BgGB6gU","core_skills":["Molecular Cloning","In Vitro","Drug Delivery"],"positions":[{"title":"Postdoctoral associate","company":"University of Louisville","date_range":"2013年2月 - 现在","duration":"13 年 8 个月","location":"","description":"• Introducing suicide genes (HSVtk & Nitroreductase) into rat cardiac stem cells (CSCs) using lentivirus system thus to establish stably transduced cell lines; Determine the therapeutic window of CSCs in vivo. \n• Generating a transgenic mouse model in which HSVtk-EGFP not only specifically expressed in c-kit+ CSCs, but also in a prodrug triggered manner. Through this model, the function of c-kit+ CSCs in cardiac development and injury recovery can be traced. \n• Investigating cardiac fibrosis and potential anti-fibrotic reagents.","skills":[]},{"title":"Postdoctoral scholar","company":"University of Kentucky","date_range":"2011年8月 - 2013年1月","duration":"1 年 6 个月","location":"","description":"• Formulated polymeric nanoparticles with designed functions. \n• Investigated the biodistribution of polymeric nanoassemblies and drugs entrapped in these nanoparticles in vivo. \n• Investigated the efficacy of drug payload delivered by polymeric nanoparticles in the treatment of cancer.  \n• Investigated the possible toxicity associated with polymeric nanoparticles.","skills":[]},{"title":"Graduate Student","company":"University of Louisville","date_range":"2007年8月 - 2011年8月","duration":"4 年 1 个月","location":"","description":"• Investigated the mechanism of action of green tea polyphenols in the prevention and treatment of cancer disease both in vitro and in vivo.  \n• Established the quantification methods for green tea polyphenols in plasma and tissues using LC/MS and HPLC.  \n• Formulation and characterization of polymeric implants as delivery vehicles for natural compounds and their pharmacologic effects. \n• Tested the anti-tumor effects of several natural compounds besides green tea polyphenols, such as anthocyanidins, withaferin A etc. Investigated the efficacy and toxicity of combination therapy using natural compounds and traditional chemotherapeutic agents.","skills":[]},{"title":"Graduate Student","company":"University of Cincinnati","date_range":"2006年8月 - 2007年7月","duration":"1 年","location":"","description":"Investigated the effects of natural PPAR-γ agonists on reduction of nitric oxide production in macrophages.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Postdoctoral associate at University of Louisville · 2013年 - 现在 | Postdoctoral scholar at University of Kentucky · 2011年 - 2013年 | Graduate Student at University of Louisville · 2007年 - 2011年 | Graduate Student at University of Cincinnati · 2006年 - 2007年 | Manager of Medical Department at Cinkate Pharm. Corp. · 2001年 - 2005年 | Resident to Attending doctor in Urology at Qindao Central Hospital · 1994年 - 2000年","education":[{"school":"University of Louisville","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)","field_of_study":"Pharmacology and Toxicology","date_range":"2007年 - 2011年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"Shandong Medical University","degree":"Doctor of Medicine (M.D.)","field_of_study":"Medicine","date_range":"1989年 - 1994年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | University of Louisville，Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.) · 2007年 - 2011年 | Shandong Medical University，Doctor of Medicine (M.D.) · 1989年 - 1994年 | 保存到项目 | 将Pengxiao保存到项目 | 发消息给Pengxiao | Pengxiao Cao的更多操作","open_to_work":[],"languages":[{"name":"English","proficiency":""}],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:32:33+08:00","record":{"name":"Syed A Rizvi, MD PhD(Pharm) PhD(Chem) MPH MBA MS MSc BSc BSN CCRN CEN CMRN TNS VABC LSSBB FRSM","current_title":"Public Health Program Specialist","current_company":"Illinois Department of Public Health (IDPH) · 全职","location":"芝加哥地区","headline":"Physician-Scientist | Clinical & Translational Researcher | Medical Educator | Global Health Advocate | Drug Development Innovator | Turning Discovery into Clinical Impact | Transformational Leader | Student of Science","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/drsyedarizvi","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAALr93IB0MwBhbe2i9OJWhEuP26dZ0-peJw","core_skills":["Pharmaceutical Industry","UV/Vis","Surface Chemistry"],"positions":[{"title":"Public Health Program Specialist","company":"Illinois Department of Public Health (IDPH) · 全职","date_range":"2024年6月 - 现在","duration":"2 年 4 个月","location":"Office of Disease Control, Westchester, Illinois, United States.","description":"🔹 Vaccine Coverage & Compliance Assessment \n• Traveled statewide to conduct vaccine coverage level assessments at public vaccine provider sites, including Vaccines for Children (VFC) providers and Federally Qualified Health Centers (FQHCs) \n• Performed retrospective validation of reported immunization levels at daycare centers and schools as required by federal immunization grants \n🔹 Quality Assurance & Program Monitoring \n• Conducted annual clinic reviews at local health departments to monitor VFC program compliance \n• Documented and implemented quality assurance and quality improvement methods \n• Maintained and refined systems for tracking VFC provider participation and vaccine accountability \n🔹 Training & Technical Assistance \n• Delivered training and orientation programs for local health professionals on current immunization recommendations and epidemiological follow-up of vaccine-preventable diseases \n• Served as first point of conta