{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:32:50+08:00","record":{"name":"Shuyi Cen, MD","current_title":"Associate","current_company":"McKinsey & Company · 全职","location":"美国","headline":"Healthcare innovation | Medical Doctor | McKinsey | Stanford","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/shuyi-cen","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAB0GYCgBs4c8Fh68PDtAVM2FaWkl_2rzyV0","core_skills":["Node.js","财务分析","研究项目"],"positions":[{"title":"Associate","company":"McKinsey & Company · 全职","date_range":"2024年8月 - 现在","duration":"2 年 2 个月","location":"Silicon Valley","description":"I bring a clinician–scientist perspective to strategy consulting, focusing on the intersection of life sciences, healthcare, and technology. My client experience spans portfolio strategy, due diligence, organizational transformation, and AI-enabled innovation. \n \nRepresentative areas of focus include: \n- Pharma R&D strategy: Led therapeutic and disease-area strategies for C-Suite discussions. Advised on R&D productivity (e.g., clinical trial acceleration), portfolio prioritization, digital/GenAI transformation through AI tools, extensive desk research, data analysis, KOL/expert interviews, and financial modeling \n- Commercial strategy: Supported launch excellance and GTM strategies for novel therapeutics \n- M&A and due diligence: Conducted due diligence for private equity clients, including synergy assessment, growth modeling, and competitive intelligence analysis \n- Digital & AI transformation: Led change management and pilot monitoring for GenAI transformation initiatives; supported agentic AI applications in clinical trial acceleration and data management\n\n• R&D strategy: Led therapeutic-area and portfolio strategies for C-suite discussions, integrating market projections, unmet-need assessment, emerging scientific breakthroughs, clinical development pathways, and alignment with client capabilities. \n• R&D operations: Advised on R&D productivity across clinical-trial acceleration and data-management optimization, including MSL/KOL engagement, scenario planning, and demand forecasting. \n• Commercial strategy & M&A due diligence: Drove commercial and exit due diligence and financial analysis for investment and growth decisions — valuation, market-entry barriers, synergies, and strategic fit through desk research, data analysis, KOL/expert interviews, and financial modeling; supported launch excellence and GTM strategy for novel therapeutics.","skills":[]},{"title":"Clinical development","company":"Dyne Therapeutics","date_range":"2023年6月 - 2023年9月","duration":"4 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 波士顿","description":"• Advanced two clinical pipelines in rare neuromuscular disease by evaluating primary and secondary endpoints, and revised clinical-development strategies to reflect current thinking. \n• Monitored adverse events and performed causality assessments (timing, plausibility, natural history, and alternative causes), reporting directly to the Chief Medical Officer. \n• Partnered with clinical operations to anticipate and resolve emerging issues during a rare-disease clinical trial.","skills":[]},{"title":"Fellowship","company":"Fusion Fund","date_range":"2023年5月 - 2023年8月","duration":"4 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 帕罗奥图","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Investment Analyst","company":"Qiming Venture Partners","date_range":"2023年 - 2024年5月","duration":"1 年 5 个月","location":"","description":"• Interviewed Bay Area academics, venture investors, and KOLs to map an investment thesis for generative AI and large language models in healthcare. \n• Screened recent digital-health financings and authored 10+ deal memos, synthesizing US-market investment trends for the partnership.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Associate at McKinsey & Company · 2024年 - 现在 | Clinical development at Dyne Therapeutics · 2023年 - 2023年 | Fellowship at Fusion Fund · 2023年 - 2023年 | Investment Analyst at Qiming V