{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:36:59+08:00","record":{"name":"DeKuan C.","current_title":"Managing Director & Chief Translational Strategist","current_company":"Catalyst BioAdvisors","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 布鲁克莱恩","headline":"Translational Science Leader | Driving Phase I/II Cell Therapy Programs & Biomarker Strategy | Lead, Clinical Programs","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/dekuanchang","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAt00dsBdEY2RZXRyG-pU5grLX8divGDYgU","core_skills":["Solid Tumor","Drug","Antibody drug conjugates"],"positions":[{"title":"Managing Director & Chief Translational Strategist","company":"Catalyst BioAdvisors","date_range":"2025年7月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 3 个月","location":"","description":"Provide independent, strategic advisement and technical due diligence for biotechnology firms, global investment networks, and clinical programs. Specialized in translating early-stage assets into robust Phase I protocols, biomarker strategy, and advanced assay development.","skills":[]},{"title":"Executive Director, Translational Science","company":"Shinobi Therapeutics","date_range":"2026年5月 - 现在","duration":"5 个月","location":"","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Translational Lead Consultant","company":"Shinobi Therapeutics","date_range":"2025年6月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 4 个月","location":"","description":"• Managed complex, cross-departmental programs from preclinical phases to clinical development, ensuring alignment with organizational objectives. \n• Design and review and clinical protocol of iPSC-derived T and NK cell therapy in different indications.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Director, Functional Assessment and Program Team Lead","company":"BeOne Medicines","date_range":"2023年5月 - 2025年6月","duration":"2 年 2 个月","location":"","description":"• Lead cross-functional teams in developing iPSC-derived cell therapy and assessing creative solutions to challenging problems. \n• Delivered complex scientific data and concepts through presentations, protocols, and detailed reports. \n• Oversee intricate, cross-functional programs from preclinical stages to clinical development to ensure organizational goals were met. \n• Monitor the oncology landscape, focusing on pipelines, scientific advancements, partnerships, and regulatory developments of cell therapy. \n• Transform data into actionable insights that identify risks and opportunities within cell therapy pipeline. \n• Formulate detailed program strategies and roadmaps that align with company’s organizational goals. \n• Advocate for the program team's stance on resource allocation, budgeting, and financial oversight. \n• Enhance governance frameworks, team structures, and decision-making processes within research and development. \n• Foster and sustain relationships with key stakeholders, while creating interactive dashboards to track program performance and manage risks effectively. \n• Prepared comprehensive and accurate documentation of experiments to facilitate evidence-based study submissions. \n• Designed and executed cellular, immunological, protein, molecular biology, and PK/PD experiments aligned with translational strategies and program timelines. \n• Managed multiple projects simultaneously while ensuring deadlines were met. \n• Designed clinical outcome prediction frameworks targeting hematological malignancies, solid tumors, and autoimmune diseases using allogeneic alpha/beta and gamma/delta T and NK cells. \n• Directed core team in executing strategic plans for research, nonclinical studies, CMC development, regulatory coordination, and clinical operations. \n• Developed and implemented assessment strategies to align with project goals, scope, and timelines. \n• Engage in document preparation and editing for submission to regulatory authorities. \n• Communicated platform, program timelines, associated risks, strategy and roadblocks to stakeholders and KOLs clearly. \n• Presented data to governance committees, KOLs, and research organizations while offering technical and scientific insights. \n• Negotiated high-value contracts with vendors and partners to optimize resource allocation. \n• Promoted a culture of innovation and encouraged staff to contribute ideas. \n• Led change management efforts to adapt to market shifts and organizational needs. \n• Established key performance indicators to track progress towards goals. \n• Oversaw budgeting processes and ensured fiscal responsibility was maintained throughout the year.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Managing Director & Chief Translational Strategist at Catalyst BioAdvisors · 2025年 - 现在 | Executive Director, Translational Science at Shinobi Therapeutics · 2026年 - 现在 | Translational Lead Consultant at Shinobi Therapeutics · 2025年 - 现在 | Senior Director, Functional Assessment and Program Team Lead at BeOne Medicines · 2023年 - 2025年 | Senior Director, Clinical Science and Clinical Biomarker at Sana Biotechnology, Inc. · 2020年 - 2023年 | Associate Director, Cell Product Clinical Translation at TAKEDA PHARMACEUTICALS AMERICA, INC. · 2019年 - 2020年 | Scientific Consultant Biologic Representative at Tikcro Technologies · 2017年 - 2019年 | Principal Scientist, Pharmacology Lead at TORQUE THERAPEUTICS, INC · 2016年 - 2019年 | Scientist, Cell Therapy at Juno Therapeutics, Inc. · 2015年 - 2016年 | Instructor / Researcher in Medicine at Harvard Medical School · 2010年 - 2016年 | Medical Lieutenant Medical Officer at Taiwan Army · 2009年 - 2010年","education":[{"school":"台湾大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)","field_of_study":"Pathology/Experimental Pathology","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"美国东北大学","degree":"","field_of_study":"English Language and Literature, General","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 台湾大学，Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.) | 美国东北大学 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 Executive Director Senior Director 职位性质 全职 所在地点 现场