{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:38:01+08:00","record":{"name":"Kevin Chang","current_title":"Associate Director, Analytical Development","current_company":"Abzena · 全职","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","headline":"Analytical Development, CMC, Biologics/AAV Gene Therapy, PhD, PMP","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevintkchang","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAABDE0msBRhMma4BUk39bieuN7COlbZIAOgE","core_skills":["Immunoprecipitation","Chemistry","Manufacturing","and Controls (CMC)","Protein Expression"],"positions":[{"title":"Associate Director, Analytical Development","company":"Abzena · 全职","date_range":"2025年8月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 2 个月","location":"","description":"• ​ Leading day‑to‑day operations and strategic direction of the Analytical Development team in the CDMO organization, ensuring high performance and scientific excellence. \n• ​ Overseeing analytical laboratory operations, maintaining optimal functionality while enforcing strict quality, documentation, and safety standards. \n• ​ Directing development, optimization, and validation of analytical methods supporting process development, in‑process controls, and release/stability testing for regulatory submissions. \n• ​ Implementing and improving systems for sample management, workflow efficiency, and data integrity in a fast‑paced, client‑focused environment. \n• ​ Managing team resources and budget while proactively identifying capacity constraints and maintaining rigorous scientific and regulatory compliance.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Principal Scientist, CMC Analytical Development","company":"Neurocrine Biosciences · 全职","date_range":"2024年4月 - 2025年4月","duration":"1 年 1 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥","description":"• ​ CMC Analytical lead for AAV gene therapy projects. \n• ​ CDMO AD/QC supervision and management. \n• ​ Formulating GMP and non-GMP sampling plan, DS/DP release testing strategy, specification, long term and accelerated stability 