{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:40:25+08:00","record":{"name":"Chuan-Hsin Chang","current_title":"Staff II","current_company":"RIKEN BioResource Research Center (BRC) · 合同","location":"日本 Ibaraki 筑波市","headline":"PhD | Biomedical Scientist | Translational Medicine | Drug Discovery | Scientific Communication | Cancer Research","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/chuan-hsin-chang-69a274143","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAACK-ndYBP39otmXs8er5f03QEO2fob5cjo8","core_skills":["Immonology","Pharmaceutical Research","Project Management"],"positions":[{"title":"Staff II","company":"RIKEN BioResource Research Center (BRC) · 合同","date_range":"2025年6月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 4 个月","location":"日本 Ibaraki","description":"1. Conduct genomics and epigenetics research using next-generation sequencing and molecular biology approaches. \n2. Collaborate with multidisciplinary research teams to develop experimental strategies, optimize workflows, and interpret complex biological data. \n3. Support research projects involving ChIP-seq, DAP-seq, DNA and chromatin analysis, sequencing library preparation, and quality control. \n4. Communicate scientific findings with international collaborators and contribute to team-based research activities. \n5. Apply systematic problem-solving, scientific documentation, and project coordination to support high-quality research outcomes.","skills":[]},{"title":"Assistant Researcher","company":"Chang Gung University of Science and Technology · 合同","date_range":"2022年8月 - 2024年7月","duration":"2 年","location":"台湾 桃园市 桃园市","description":"1. Conducted translational and biomedical research focusing on the pharmacological effects and molecular mechanisms of natural products and Chinese herbal medicines. \n2. Designed and performed molecular biology, cell biology, and biochemical experiments, including gene and protein expression analysis. \n3. Applied a range of laboratory techniques such as cell culture