n":"美国 加利福尼亚 洛杉矶","description":"• Experience in CRISPR technology, epigenetic/genetic library screening, RNA-seq, next generation sequencing, and high-throughput flow cytometry for new target discovery and validation. \n• Experience in drug-sensitization, CRISPR tiling, CRISPR interference (CRISPRi), and CRISPR activation (CRISPRa) screens for novel functional target identification. \n• Experience in single cell RNA seq and CRISPR screen pipeline development. \n• Experience in virtual compound screening for cancer therapeutics. \n• Experience in functional cell line generation and validations. \n• Experience in viral engineering and production. \n• Experience in data mining and omic analysis. \n• Experience in R/Unix for data analysis.","skills":["FACS","AAV/Lentiviral production and engineering","High Throughput CRISPR Screening","High Throughput Flow/Image-based Cytometry"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Senior Manager - Nanomedicine at Pharmaceutical · 2024年 - 现在 | Senior Scientist at Rejuvenate · 2022年 - 2023年 | Scientist III at Thermo Fisher Scientific · 2020年 - 2022年 | Postdoctoral Research Fellow at City of Hope · 2017年 - 2020年 | Visiting Scholar at Salk Institute for Biological Studies · 2015年 - 2016年","education":[{"school":"阳明大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy - PhD","field_of_study":"Institute of Brain Science","date_range":"2009年 - 2016年","activities":"活动与社团: • Graduate student representative","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 阳明大学，Doctor of Philosophy - PhD · 2009年 - 2016年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 Principal Scientist Senior Scientist 职位性质 兼职 全职 所在地点 现场办公: 美国 加利福尼亚 圣地亚哥 远程办公: San Diego Metropolitan Area 开始日期 我在积极找工作，可以马上开始 工作场所类型 现场办公 混合办公 远程办公"],"languages":[{"name":"Mandarin","proficiency":"母语"}],"native_chinese":true,"detail_error":""}}
