{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:46:56+08:00","record":{"name":"Arnold C.","current_title":"AI Evaluation Research Specialist (CS/Math Lead)","current_company":"Mercor · 自雇","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 洛杉矶","headline":"Research Scientist | Data Science","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/arnoldchang","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAABCAy6MBmyiz0MLS5XgdvuNmBA57zFSjU7w","core_skills":["Virtual Collaboration","Cisco Technologies","Network Security"],"positions":[{"title":"AI Evaluation Research Specialist (CS/Math Lead)","company":"Mercor · 自雇","date_range":"2025年6月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 4 个月","location":"","description":"·       Directed domain-specific eval of LLM outputs in algorithms, data structures, mathematics \n·       Curated and refined datasets to train and fine-tune AI models in core computer science/math domains \n·       Assessed AI-generated content for technical accuracy, clarity, and educational quality \n·       Identified edge cases, misconceptions, and coverage gaps to improve model robustness \n·       Advised cross-functional AI teams on domain coverage, content alignment, and system improvements\n\n• Collaborated with senior project leads, engineering teams, and PhD researchers to clarify requirements, update guidelines, and support evaluations that improve SOTA model performance for frontier AI labs. \n• Improved project workflows for large AI evaluation efforts by updating documentation, addressing bottlenecks, and supporting smooth cross-team execution. \n• Coordinated contributor alignment on projects with 200+ distributed workers to maintain consistency, throughput, and data quality. \n• Used Python to review datasets, check outputs, and run final audits before data delivery to clients. \n• Supported onboarding for new contributors to maintain consistent understanding of project expectations.","skills":["PyTorch","Deep Learning","Scientific Papers","TensorFlow","Python (Programming Language)