{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:47:19+08:00","record":{"name":"Chih-Wei Chang","current_title":"Director, Head of Medicinal Chemistry","current_company":"Institute of Innovative Medicine, Grand Pharma · 全职","location":"澳洲 Queensland 黄金海岸","headline":"Director, Head of Medicinal Chemistry @ Grand Pharma | Medicinal Chemistry Project Management","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/chih-wei-chang-00360070","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAA8KCAMBkLe9catX1HVj2dutlbKf_qG3pug","core_skills":["Multicultural Team Leadership","UV/Vis","Collaborative Problem Solving"],"positions":[{"title":"Director, Head of Medicinal Chemistry","company":"Institute of Innovative Medicine, Grand Pharma · 全职","date_range":"2023年8月 - 现在","duration":"3 年 2 个月","location":"中国 湖北省 武汉","description":"I lead transformative drug discovery initiatives, achieving significant milestones in preclinical candidate development.  \n• Directed a 20-member team, fostering collaboration across functions and enhancing project outcomes.  \n• Employed advanced CADD and AI technologies to design novel compounds, driving innovation in medicinal chemistry and ensuring project success within budget constraints. \n• Mentored the next generation of chemists, ensuring knowledge transfer and skill development within the team.","skills":["Schrodinger","Multicultural Team Leadership","Team Building","Team Management","Global Cross-Functional Team Leadership","Project Management","Artificial Intelligence (AI)"]},{"title":"Director of Medicinal Chemistry","company":"Grand Pharmaceutical","date_range":"","duration":"","location":"","description":"• Lead two drug discovery programs into the later stages of development. \n• Constructed a 20-member medicinal chemistry team to support multiple projects. \n• Developed and carried out medicinal chemistry strategies to produce high-quality preclinical candidates. \n• Worked collaboratively across functions to enhance Grand Pharma's pipeline. \n• Led drug discovery programs in effective collaboration with both internal and external teams, including CROs. \n• Driven and advanced cutting-edge drug discovery strategies by utilizing extensive knowledge in medicinal chemistry and synthetic route design, combined with a thorough understanding of DMPK, pharmacology, and toxicology. \n• Utilized CADD (Schrödinger)/AIDD and AI-related tools (Chemical AI) to design new target compounds within existing and novel chemical spaces. \n• Facilitated the identification, isolation, and characterization of metabolites (MetID). \n• Inspired, mentored, and educated the next generation of medicinal chemists. \n• Achieved project goals within the allocated time and budget.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Director","company":"WuXi AppTec · 全职","date_range":"2022年2月 - 2023年7月","duration":"1 年 6 个月","location":"中国 天津市 滨海新区","description":"• Managed a team of approximately 200 chemists specializing in the synthesis of diverse drug-like molecules, including PROTACs, Molecular glue, ADC components, lipids, polypeptides, nucleotides, oligosaccharides, and covalent inhibitors. \n• Integrated resources for drug discovery, collaborated with global experts, and ensured seamless communication with clients. \n• Provided extensive support for Hit to Lead services, DELight and fragment-based drug discovery programs, and high-throughput screening. \n• Assisted in structure-based design for lead optimization. \n• Utilized CADD platforms to predict drug activity, DMPK profiles, toxicity, and hERG liability.","skills":["Multicultural Team Leadership","Team Building","Team Management","Global Cross-Functional Team Leadership","Project Management","Artificial Intelligence (AI)"]},{"title":"Medicinal Chemistry Team Leader","company":"Institute for glycomics, Griffith University · 全职","date_range":"2011年5月 - 2021年10月","duration":"10 年 6 个月","location":"澳洲 Queensland","description":"• Complete multiple contract researches (CRO) including relocation of resource, milestone and communication to meet up the timeline set in agreements and report to the executive board of industry partners; resulted in 2 awarded patents (WO2019113645, WO2019113646) and clinical trial (Investigational Product name: STC314) \n• Lead and manage multiple medicinal chemistry research projects in fields of therapeutic development against sepsis, antiviral and anticancer including SAR analysis, drug design, synthesis optimization- resulted in 5 publications including Nature Chem Bio, Chemical Science, ACS Infectious Disease \n• Translate half-kilo scale synthetic protocol to CMO company for production GMP batch of drug candidate (mCBS) up to 7 KG  \n• Patent filing and management; Draft of specification and communication with patent attorney \n• Experience in Computer-Aided Drug Design (CADD) and prediction of drug-like property using in silico tools","skills":["Schrodinger","Multicultural Team Leadership","Team Building","Team Management","Global Cross-Functional Team Leadership","Project Management"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Director, Head of Medicinal Chemistry at Institute of Innovative Medicine, Grand Pharma · 2023年 - 现在 | Director of Medicinal Chemistry at Grand Pharmaceutical | Senior Director at WuXi AppTec · 2022年 - 2023年 | Medicinal Chemistry Team Leader at Institute for glycomics, Griffith University · 2011年 - 2021年 | Postdoc at Academia Sinica · 2010年 - 2011年 | Research Assistant at TaiGen Biotechnology · 2000年 - 2004年","education":[{"school":"Université Paris-Sud","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD)","field_of_study":"Carbohydrate Chemistry","date_range":"2006年 - 2010年","activities":"活动与社团: • Developed new synthetic method using organometallic catalyst for modification of sialic acid; established sugar library exploited as active anti-influenza agents; resulted in 3 publications","grade":""},{"school":"交通大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy - PhD","field_of_study":"Carbohydrate Chemistry