{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:49:06+08:00","record":{"name":"Bernard Chang 章煥 PhD MBA","current_title":"Project Manager","current_company":"Hong Kong Polytechnic University 香港理工大學","location":"芝加哥地区","headline":"Seeking R&D project and alliance management opportunities.","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/bernardchang","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAAtJF0B7f-3cyM3xbaxcsjJebRWse0QEhg","core_skills":["Pharmaceutical Industry","Systems Biology","Cheminformatics"],"positions":[{"title":"Project Manager","company":"Hong Kong Polytechnic University 香港理工大學","date_range":"2017年1月 - 2022年2月","duration":"5 年 2 个月","location":"Hong Kong","description":"Project Manager for the Food Safety Consortium. Seeked collaborations with industries on all things related to food safety. \n \n• Developed and secured funding (US$1.6 million) for collaborative research projects on food safety with commercial entities along the food supple chain (e.g. Danone, Mengniu, Oracle, Hewlett-Packard). \n• Managed and leveraged multidisciplinary expertise (on chemistry, biology, computing, mathematics and engineering) for a concerted effort on improving food safety. In areas of authentication and detection of fraud, tracing and tracking, packaging, testing, and alerting system. \n• Cultivated relationship with various stakeholders in food safety. Including food producers and retailers (e.g., Nestle, BRF, Lee Kum Kee, McDonald’s, Walmart), instrument and testing companies (e.g., Thermo Fisher, SGS, Merireaux), research institutions (e.g., Anses, BfR, Fera, Teagasc), regulatory bodies (e.g., EFSA, CFSA, DTU National Food Institute), and supranational organizations (e.g., FAO, Codex Alimentarius).","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Project Research Manager","company":"Lam Soon (Hong Kong) Limited","date_range":"2015年2月 - 2016年6月","duration":"1 年 5 个月","location":"香港特别行政区","description":"(Flour miller, manufacturer of edible oils and cleaning prod