{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:52:44+08:00","record":{"name":"William H Chang","current_title":"Associate Director","current_company":"Novartis · 全职","location":"纽约地区","headline":"PhD Lead Statistician (Retired) | Clinical Biostatistics | Novartis Pharmaceuticals | Author of A Dual-Layered Structure of Reality","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/william-h-chang-89885193","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAABPhcLQBRM9nqEn6dx1KZZHmL29717F2VvI","core_skills":["Pharmaceutics","SAS","Clinical Development"],"positions":[{"title":"Associate Director","company":"Novartis · 全职","date_range":"2008年9月 - 2022年6月","duration":"13 年 10 个月","location":"East Hanover, New Jersey","description":"Provided statistical support for clinical development in CV/Oncology including mega-trials (e.g. NATALEE, CANTOS, APOLLO) as lead statistician \n \nCollaborate with clinical and others on various tasks including TPP, CDP, study designs, selection of primary endpoints and analyses including interim efficacy/futility anlayses, sample size, CSP, DMC, CRFs, and RMP/PSUR/DSUR \n \nProvide statistical support for due-diligence review as lead statistican \n \nOversee Novartis and CRO statistics/programming activities on various projects \n \nPerformed exploratory analyses (e.g. calculated the probability for a mega trial to stop at interim analysis for superiority and futility, estimated the time for a meta trial to reach the targeted number of events, programed expected survival using Hakulinen method, etc)","skills":[]},{"title":"Principal Statistician/Associate Director, Clinical Biostatistics","company":"AstraZeneca · 全职","date_range":"2003年12月 - 2008年9月","duration":"4 年 10 个月","location":"Wilmington, Delaware","description":"Provided statistical support for clinical development in neuroscience and oncology \n \nProvided statistical support for Seroquel bipolar depression IR US submission, and worked as the lead statistician for Seroquel bipolar depression IR EU submission \n \nCollaborated with medical and others on various tasks including CDP, study designs, selection of primary endpoints/analyses, SDCs, CSP, CSE/CSS/CSO, CSRs, IDMC/SC guidelines, and CRFs \n \nDeveloped SAPs and table mockups \n \nProvided statistical support for TG3 and TG2.5 decisions \n \nDrafted a white paper to discuss the properties of clinical trials with one interim futility analysis \n \nPerformed various exploratory analyses and programmed key efficacy tables including decision matrix for parallel weighted Bonferonni GateKeeping procedure","skills":[]},{"title":"Manager, Clinical Biostatistics","company":"Johnson & Johnson · 全职","date_range":"2002年6月 - 2003年12月","duration":"1 年 7 个月","location":"Pharmaceutical R&D, Raritan, New Jersey","description":"Provided statistical support for clinical development \n \nCollaborated with medical on variety tasks in new drug development including the correspondence with regulatory authorities, study designs, selection of primary endpoints and primary analyses, sample size calculations, protocol developments, and study reports. \n \nPerformed various exploratory analyses \n \nDrafted a white paper to predict the risk of transfusion based on hemoglobin level","skills":[]},{"title":"Statistical Scientist II, Clinical Biostatistics","company":"Pharmacia · 全职","date_range":"1999年 - 2002年5月","duration":"3 年 5 个月","location":"Kalamazoo, Michigan","description":"Served as lead statistician in various Phase II/III clinical trials \n \nCollaborated with medical from new drug development strategy to protocols development to NDA, this includes the correspondence and meeting with FDA and CPMP, study designs, selection of primary endpoints and primary analyses, sample size calculations, interim analysis, development of the statistical section in protocols, and study reports. \n \nContributed to successful NDA filing for a second-generation antibiotic compound, responsible for three phase III adult 