{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:56:31+08:00","record":{"name":"Shih-Ying Chang","current_title":"VP, CMC head","current_company":"Dizal Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd · 正式","location":"中国 上海市","headline":"VP, CMC head at Dizal Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/shih-ying-chang-30260b7","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAFWA_IB1yuXmrr9A9YANVFMYIH5PB-eH1s","core_skills":["Scale Up","Drug Product","Manufacturing"],"positions":[{"title":"VP, CMC head","company":"Dizal Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd · 正式","date_range":"2019年1月 - 现在","duration":"7 年 9 个月","location":"中国 上海市","description":"Pharmaceutical development of API and drug product. Clinical manufacturing and supply chain management. NDA and PAI preparation and response. Commercial launch execution. Technology transfer management and delivery. Commercial supply production and management. CMCExternal collaboration evaluation and development.","skills":["Technology Transfer","GMP","Formulation","Team Management","Pharmaceutical process development"]},{"title":"Executive Director, Formulation R&D","company":"Hutchison MediPharma","date_range":"2015年11月 - 2018年12月","duration":"3 年 2 个月","location":"Shanghai","description":"Develop and manage staffs in formulation department to support clinical trials.  \nWork with discovery and DMPK teams to optimize candidate compounds and to develop toxicological and clinical formulations for IND submission and first-in-human trials. \nSupervise formulation development teams to optimize, scale-up, and manufacture of clinical materials in support of clinical studies. \nCoordinate with external collaborators including international Pharmaceutical companies to overlook the progress of joint-development projects. \nEvaluate and manage contract manufacturing organizations to ensure the timely delivery of clinical supplies. \nDraft and review regulatory filing documents of IND, supplementals, and NDA for CFDA, USFDA, and HEC(Australia). Prepare and participate interactive meetings with officials in CDE.  \nEvaluate new formulation technologies and present in peer conferences to sustain research and innovation.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Principal Scientist","company":"百时美施贵宝","date_range":"12 年 3 个月","duration":"4 年 2 个月","location":"New Brunswick, NJ","description":"• Established workflow of solubilized/lipid formulations to screen early stage candidates and to establish proof of concept of formulation development for bioavailability enhancement. Tested on 10 active compounds and one commercial drug with as minimal as 5 gm of API and very short of time for each test. \n• Developed a platform of Solubilized Tablet formulations combining with mesoporous particle technology to design solubilized formulations from exploratory and to facilitate fixed dosage combination (FDC) formulations. \n• Developed a patented co-precipitation process for high load water sensitive compounds to overcome the problems of flow and compressibility caused by cohesive powders. \n• Developed a patented co-precipitation process for high load metformin extended release and its fixed dose combo products. Clinical study has proved the equivalency of this reduced mass tablet.  \n• Established and managed partnership with key excipient vendors to conduct joint-research projects and to secure the supply of special excipients for exploratory trials. \n• Co-developed micro-dissolution methodology with in-line UV probe and bio-relevant media for early stage formulation screening and optimization. \n• Served as technical champion to oversee scale-up and transfer of an active coating process from R&D to production and between production sites. Provided consultation and guideline for manufacturing operation to transfer the process from US production site to Shanghai in China.","skills":[]},{"title":"Principal Scientist","company":"百时美施贵宝","date_range":"12 年 3 个月","duration":"4 年 2 个月","location":"New Brunswick, NJ","description":"• Established workflow of solubilized/lipid formulations to screen early stage candidates and to establish proof of concept of formulation development for bioavailability enhancement. Tested on 10 active compounds and one commercial drug with as minimal as 5 gm of API and very short of time for each test. \n• Developed a platform of Solubilized Tablet formulations combining with mesoporous particle technology to design solubilized formulations from exploratory and to facilitate fixed dosage combination (FDC) formulations. \n• Developed a patented co-precipitation process for high load water sensitive compounds to overcome the problems of flow and compressibility caused by cohesive powders. \n• Developed a patented co-precipitation process for high load metformin extended release and its fixed dose combo products. Clinical study has proved the equivalency of this reduced mass tablet.  \n• Established and managed partnership with key excipient vendors to conduct joint-research projects and to secure the supply of special excipients for exploratory trials. \n• Co-developed micro-dissolution methodology with in-line UV probe and bio-relevant media for early stage formulation screening and optimization. \n• Served as technical champion to oversee scale-up and transfer of an active coating process from R&D to production and between production sites. Provided consultation and guideline for manufacturing operation to transfer the process from US production site to Shanghai in China.","skills":[]},{"title":"Group leader/Senior Research Investogator","company":"百时美施贵宝","date_range":"12 年 3 个月","duration":"4 年 2 个月","location":"New Brunswick, NJ","description":"• Established workflow of solubilized/lipid formulations to screen early stage candidates and to establish proof of concept of formulation development for bioavailability enhancement. Tested on 10 active compounds and one commercial drug with as minimal as 5 gm of API and very short of time for each test. \n• Developed a platform of Solubilized Tablet formulations combining with mesoporous particle technology to design solubilized formulations from exploratory and to facilitate fixed dosage combination (FDC) formulations. \n• Developed a patented co-precipitation process for high load water sensitive compounds to overcome the problems of flow and compressibility caused by cohesive powders. \n• Developed a patented co-precipitation process for high load metformin extended release and its fixed dose combo products. Clinical study has proved the equivalency of this reduced mass tablet.  \n• Established and managed partnership with key excipient vendors to conduct joint-research projects and to secure the supply of special excipients for exploratory trials. \n• Co-developed micro-dissolution methodology with in-line UV probe and bio-relevant media for early stage formulation screening and optimization. \n• Served as technical champion to oversee scale-up and transfer of an active coating process from R&D to production and between production sites. Provided consultation and guideline for manufacturing operation to transfer the process from US production site to Shanghai in China.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior engineer","company":"Exxon Mobil Chemical Co.","date_range":"2001年6月 - 2003年8月","duration":"2 年 3 个月","location":"休斯敦地区","description":"• Deployed Raman and FTNIR spectroscopy-based process analytical technologies for different chemical business units.  \n• Lead technology programs to support plant operation, analyzer calibration, and deployment.  \n• Developed proprietary data processing and chemometric tools in Matlab to facilitate application development.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | VP, CMC head at Dizal Pharmaceutical Co., Ltd · 2019年 - 现在 | Executive Director, Formulation R&D at Hutchison MediPharma · 2015年 - 2018年 | Senior Principal Scientist at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2011年 - 2015年 | Principal Scientist at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2006年 - 2011年 | Group leader/Senior Research Investogator at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2003年 - 2006年 | Senior engineer at Exxon Mobil Chemical Co. · 2001年 - 2003年 | Principal Engineer at Hamilton-Sunstarnd, United Technology · 1996年 - 2001年","education":[{"school":"美国马里兰大学帕克分校","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)","field_of_study":"Chemical Engineering","date_range":"1990年 - 1996年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"Tsing-Hua University","degree":"Master of sciences","field_of_study":"Chemical Engineering","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 美国马里兰大学帕克分校，Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.) · 1990年 - 1996年 | Tsing-Hua University，Master of sciences | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 副總裁 VP 职位性质 全职 所在地点 现场办公: 中国 上海市 远程办公: 中国 上海市 开始日期 我在随便看看，时间可灵活安排 工作场所类型 现场办公 混合办公 远程办公"],"languages":[{"name":"Chinese","proficiency":""}],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
