{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T10:56:41+08:00","record":{"name":"Kyle Chang","current_title":"Bioinformatics Scientist","current_company":"Guardant Health · 全职","location":"美国 华盛顿州 西雅图","headline":"Bioinformatics Scientist at Guardant Health","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kychang","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAFGzO0BKmE53sQbr7toLKiU_XdrZ7-ea10","core_skills":["Algorithms","Perl","Computational Biology"],"positions":[{"title":"Bioinformatics Scientist","company":"Guardant Health · 全职","date_range":"2020年5月 - 现在","duration":"6 年 5 个月","location":"","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Computational Scientist","company":"MD Anderson Cancer Center · 全职","date_range":"2018年8月 - 2020年5月","duration":"1 年 10 个月","location":"休斯敦地区","description":"- Characterize key genomic and transcriptomic alterations acquired in Gprc5a-/- mice exposed to nicotine-specific tobacco carcinogen to model the carcinogenesis of smoking-associated Lung cancer \n- Improve allelic imbalance detection in array and sequencing data by incorporating B allele frequency and log R ratio in a hidden markov model \n- Identify recurrent pre-malignant neoantigens for vaccine immunoprevention in hereditary mismatch-repair deficient colorectal cancer syndrome","skills":[]},{"title":"Graduate Research Assistant","company":"The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center UTHealth Graduate School of Biomedical Sciences · 全职","date_range":"2013年8月 - 2018年8月","duration":"5 年 1 个月","location":"休斯敦地区","description":"- Developed analysis pipeline to profile immune expression and neoantigens in mismatch-repair deficient premalignant polyps from Lynch Syndrome patients using WES and RNAseq \n- Performed transcriptomic classification of colorectal premalignant lesions and associate them to carcinomas subtypes \n- Analyzed mutational clonality of premalignant colonic polyps using WES and deep targeted sequencing","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Bioinformatics Programmer","company":"Baylor College of Medicine","date_range":"2008年4月 - 2013年6月","duration":"5 年 3 个月","location":"休斯敦地区","description":"- Managed mutational analysis and validation process for The Cancer Genome Atlas (TCGA) and projects to ensure data analysis progress in timely manner. Liaised with other TCGA analysis groups to solve any outstanding issues \n- Implemented a mutation and validation tracking system for Sanger and Next-Generation medical re-sequencing projects. It is designed with an object-oriented model in JAVA and utilizes object-relational Hibernate framework to facilitate data query and retrieval on Oracle database \n- Led bioinformaticians to design specifications of mutation calling pipeline components and refine filtering heuristics for finding high quality somatic mutation in SOLiD and Illumina sequenced mutation data","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Bioinformatics Scientist at Guardant Health · 2020年 - 现在 | Computational Scientist at MD Anderson Cancer Center · 2018年 - 2020年 | Graduate Research Assistant at The University of Texas MD Anderson Cancer Center UTHealth Graduate School of Biomedical Sciences · 2013年 - 2018年 | Senior Bioinformatics Programmer at Baylor College of Medicine · 2008年 - 2013年 | Developer at Invesco Ltd. · 2007年 - 2008年","education":[{"school":"UT MD Anderson UTHealth Houston Graduate School of Biomedical Sciences","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)","field_of_study":"Bioinformatics, Human Molecular Genetics","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"美国卡内基梅隆大学","degree":"Bachelor of Science (BS)","field_of_study":"Electrical and Computer Engineering","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | UT MD Anderson UTHealth Houston Graduate School of Biomedical Sciences，Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.) | 美国卡内基梅隆大学，Bachelor of Science (BS) | 保存到项目 | 将Kyle保存到项目 | 发消息给Kyle | Kyle Chang的更多操作","open_to_work":[],"languages":[{"name":"Chinese","proficienc