{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:02:39+08:00","record":{"name":"Allen (Qinglin) Che","current_title":"Senior Director, Head of Drug Substance Development & Manufacturing","current_company":"NewAmsterdam Pharma Corporation · 全职","location":"美国","headline":"Senior Director, Drug Substance at NewAmsterdam Pharma","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/allen-che","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAFNAloBMd7Ash7sqS4WfYIFm_NWa-cVuHY","core_skills":["Pharmaceutical Industry","CDMOS","scale up"],"positions":[{"title":"Senior Director, Head of Drug Substance Development & Manufacturing","company":"NewAmsterdam Pharma Corporation · 全职","date_range":"2024年10月 - 现在","duration":"2 年","location":"","description":"Spearhead end-to-end drug substance development, manufacturing, and regulatory registration. Including oversight of external manufacturing, vendor relationship management, and strategic planning to optimize timelines and resources. Author and review CMC regulatory documents for global submissions. Act as the DS functional head in cross-functional collaborations with external partners, vendors, and internal stakeholders, driving alignment of technical, operational, and regulatory strategies to meet organizational objectives. \nProduct working on: Obicetrapib; Obicetrapib/Ezetimibe FDC","skills":["Life-cycle Management","Marketing Authorisation Application (MAA)"]},{"title":"Director, Drug substance CMC","company":"Relay Therapeutics","date_range":"4 年 2 个月","duration":"2 年 4 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"Program leadership: End-to-end API development and manufacturing from nonclinical through commercial readiness. \n• CDMO management: Partner selection, contracting, tech transfer, campaign oversight, and performance/issue management (incl. improvement plans). \n• Process development: Route design/scouting, optimization, green chemistry, crystallization, and solid-state/SDD. \n• Enabling technologies: Biocatalysis, flow/continuous processing, PAT, and other scale-up enablers. \n• Regulatory: Authored/reviewed CMC for IND/IMPD and NDA; led agency interactions, briefing books, and responses. \n• Portfolio: Zovegalisib (RLY-2608) (Ph I/II/III), RLY-5836 (Ph I), RLY-2139 (IND-ready). \n• People leadership: Built and led a team of scientists/managers; mentored early-career talent; directed all external GMP API manufacturing.","skills":["技能: Marketing Authorisation Application (MAA) • Manufacturing Process Improvement • Failure Mode and Effects Analysis (FMEA) • Quality Assurance • Project Management • Team Management • Request for Proposal (RFP) • ICH","Marketing Authorisation Application (MAA)","Manufacturing Process Improvement","Failure Mode and Effects Analysis (FMEA)","Quality Assurance","Project Management","Team Management","Request for Proposal (RFP)","ICH","技能: Quality Assurance • Request for Proposal (RFP) • ICH"]},{"title":"Associate Director, Drug Substance CMC","company":"Relay Therapeutics","date_range":"4 年 2 个月","duration":"2 年 4 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"Program leadership: End-to-end API development and manufacturing from nonclinical through commercial readiness. \n• CDMO management: Partner selection, contracting, tech transfer, campaign oversight, and performance/issue management (incl. improvement plans). \n• Process development: Route design/scouting, optimization, green chemistry, crystallization, and solid-state/SDD. \n• Enabling technologies: Biocatalysis, flow/continuous processing, PAT, and other scale-up enablers. \n• Regulatory: Authored/reviewed CMC for IND/IMPD and NDA; led agency interactions, briefing books, and responses. \n• Portfolio: Zovegalisib (RLY-2608) (Ph I/II/III), RLY-5836 (Ph I), RLY-2139 (IND-ready). \n• People leadership: Built and led a team of scientists/managers; mentored early-career talent; directed all external GMP API manufacturing.","skills":["技能: Marketing Authorisation Application (MAA) • Manufacturing Process Improvement • Failure Mode and Effects Analysis (FMEA) • Quality Assurance • Project Management • Team Management • Request for Proposal (RFP) • ICH","Marketing Authorisation Application (MAA)","Manufacturing Process Improvement","Failure Mode and Effects Analysis (FMEA)","Quality Assurance","Project Management","Team Management","Request for Proposal (RFP)","ICH","技能: Quality Assurance • Request for Proposal (RFP) • ICH"]},{"title":"Principal Scientist, Project leader, CMC","company":"Enanta Pharmaceuticals · 全职","date_range":"2018年4月 - 2020年9月","duration":"2 年 6 个月","location":"watertown, MA","description":"• Managed the small molecule drug substances chemical development, tech transfer, and external manufacturing activities for the HBV portfolio (Including EDP-514 & EDP-721); \n• RFP, vendor selection, contract negotiation, and vendor management. \n• Authored and reviewed technical reports and CMC sections for regulatory filing (IND/IMPD); prepared for agency meeting briefing documents, provided responses to agency inquiries. \n• Led polymorph/co-crystal/salt screening, material characterization; form and salt selection, and crystallization development for GMP production.  \n• Support pre-formulation, formulation development and drug product manufacturing. \n• Cross-functional collaboration (DMPK, tox, medicinal chemistry, Quality & regulatory, clinical) to support the development of drug substance/drug product supply chains to fulfill the development requirement. \n• 14-C radiolabel Drug substance prep of EDP-938 (Zelicapavir) to support human balance study.","skills":["Quality Assurance","Request for Proposal (RFP)","ICH"]},{"title":"Technical Lead, Sr Scientist, API Manufacturing","company":"Tetraphase Pharmaceuticals · 全职","date_range":"2015年5月 - 2018年4月","duration":"3 年","location":"Watertown, Massachusetts","description":"* Led the first two GMP campaigns of TP-6076 drug substances production (Including hand-on process development and optimization, tech transfer, salt & polymorphs screening, oversight of starting materials and API productions at external CMOs). \n* 14-C Radiolabelling of Eravacycline (XERAVA®) & pipeline compounds (TP-6076 & TP-271) for nonclinical, clinical and environmental studies (in-house development, external non-GMP & GMP campaigns). \n* Late-stage chemical development and validation: PAR and DOE studies; Risk analysis; CPP and CMA determination; Impurity identification, characterization, fate monitoring, spike and purging studies; GTI control etc. \n* Authoring/reviewing CMC sections of regulatory documents. Drafting of drug substance section of TP-6076 for IND/IMPD filing, contributing to NDA/MAA preparation of Eravacycline filing.","skills":["Marketing Authorisation Application (MAA)","Request for Proposal (RFP)"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Senior Director, Head of Drug Substance Development & Manufacturing at NewAmsterdam Pharma Corporation · 2024年 - 现在 | Director, Drug substance CMC at Relay Therapeutics · 2022年 - 2024年 | Associate Director, Drug Substance CMC at Relay Therapeutics · 2020年 - 2022年 | Principal Scientist, Project leader, CMC at Enanta Pharmaceuticals · 2018年 - 2020年 | Technical Lead, Sr Scientist, API Manufacturing at Tetraphase Pharmaceuticals · 2015年 - 2018年 | Senior Scientist, Chemical Development and Manufacturing at Madrigal Pharmaceuticals · 2012年 - 2015年 | Consultant of Chemistry at Celgene · 2012年 - 2012年 | Scientist II, Process Chemistry at Synta Pharmaceuticals · 2011年 - 2012年 | Scientist II, Medicinal Chemistry at Synta Pharmaceuticals · 2008年 - 2011年 | Scientist I, Medicinal chemistry at Synta Pharmaceuticals · 2005年 - 2008年 | Chemistry Intern at Procter & Gamble · 2002年 - 2002年","education":[{"school":"Brandeis University","degree":"PhD","field_of_study":"Organic Chemistry (with Prof. Barry Snider)","date_range":"2001年 - 2005年","activities":"活动与社团: Procter & Gamble Fellowship recipient","grade":""},{"school":"美国东北大学","degree":"Graduate C