 with the CRO companies. \n• Supervised the gene-editing team and ensured the delivery of high-quality results aligned with pipeline goals. \n• Supported IND enabling studies and filing related document preparation. Draft technical documents, such as SOPs and technical transfer protocols. \n• Published abstracts for SITC and AACR meetings, respectively, and completed one manuscript. \n• Authored three patents for NK cell therapy (WO2023060136A1, WO2024254013A1, WO2024254008A1). \n• Corresponded to a peer-reviewed publication on Cell Reports Methods.\n\n• Human iPSCs Genome Editing and Cell Line Development Platform Leadership. \n• Analytical Development Leadership. \n• Bispecific CAR design and construction. \n• CMC Tech Transfer & IND support. \n• Vender Selection & Management. \n• Strategic Leadership & Team Development.","skills":["技能: Data-driven Decision Making • Data Mining • Data Integration • Data Analysis • Bioinformatics • Supportive Services • Genome Editing Platform Leadership • Hands-on Lab Work • IND-Enabling Expertise • CMC Tech Transfer • Quality & Compliance • CRO Management • Team Management • Cell Line Development • Cross-functional collaboration and coordination • Analytical Support • Research and Development (R&D) • Flow Cytometry","Data-driven Decision Making","Data Mining","Data Integration","Data Analysis","Bioinformatics","Supportive Services","Genome Editing Platform Leadership","Hands-on Lab Work","IND-Enabling Expertise","CMC Tech Transfer","Quality & Compliance","CRO Management","Team Management","Cell Line Development","Cross-functional collaboration and coordination","Analytical Support","Research and Development (R&D)","Flow Cytometry","技能: Public Speaking","Public Speaking","技能: Data-driven Decision Making • Data Mining • Data Integration • Data Analysis"]},{"title":"Invited speaker at 12th Annual Immuno-Oncology Summit","company":"Cytovia Therapeutics","date_range":"3 年 6 个月","duration":"2 年 6 个月","location":"Great Boston","descript