{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:07:02+08:00","record":{"name":"Elise Chen","current_title":"Clinica Affairs Scientist","current_company":"Agilent Technologies","location":"美国 堪萨斯州 Prairie Village","headline":"Clinical Development and Biomarkers","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/elise-chen-729693","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAAZuVEBlIc49_vvK7GeolrcDBDbrb6H8b4","core_skills":["Biomarkers","Assay Development","Immunology"],"positions":[{"title":"Clinica Affairs Scientist","company":"Agilent Technologies","date_range":"2025年9月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 1 个月","location":"","description":"• Lead scientific and operational execution of companion diagnostic (CDx) programs supporting global oncology trials. \n• Develop clinical performance study plans, and external validation approaches for CDx submissions. \n• Partner cross-functionally (Regulatory, Quality, R&D, Biostatistics) to ensure on-time delivery of diagnostic milestones. \n• Guide development of biomarker cutoff strategies and data interpretation plans supporting clinical decision-making.","skills":[]},{"title":"Associate Director, Translational Medicine and Biomarkers","company":"Takeda","date_range":"2021年 - 2024年8月","duration":"3 年 8 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"• Led biomarker strategies across global clinical programs in immunology and rare diseases. \n• Designed and implemented biomarker plans for Phase I–III trials, including patient stratification and pharmacodynamic endpoint development. \n• Partnered with Discovery Teams, Clinical Science, Data Science, and Regulatory teams to bridge preclinical findings with clinical development. \n• Supported clinical design, patient stratification and protocol development. \n• Authored, reviewed, and contributed to clinical study documents, including protocols, informed consents, investigator brochures, and clinical study reports. \n• Managed external partners (CROs, specialty labs, academic c