{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:10:22+08:00","record":{"name":"Bohan C.","current_title":"Computational and Data Science Intern - Spatial Omics & Translational Oncology","current_company":"Amgen","location":"美国 密西根州 安娜堡","headline":"Computational & Systems Biologist","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/bohan11","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAFjhZI8BhMFTadIVsTAqZh8lJAgctCmCxhU","core_skills":["实验室技能","ImageJ","流式细胞术"],"positions":[{"title":"Computational and Data Science Intern - Spatial Omics & Translational Oncology","company":"Amgen","date_range":"2025年6月 - 2025年8月","duration":"3 个月","location":"","description":"- Developed and benchmarked graph-based workflows for CosMx non-small cell lung cancer \n(NSCLC) spatial omics data, integrating transcriptomic state, spatial adjacency, curated gene \nprograms, and sample covariates to identify tumor, stromal, endothelial, macrophage, B-cell, \nand T/NK-cell niches. \n- Characterized niche-specific cell-type enrichment, pathway programs, spatial associations, and \ninter-niche communication; translated latent representations into interpretable hypotheses for \nbiomarker and target discovery. \n- Built modular frameworks for multi-tissue sections integration and query-to-reference \nmapping with transfer-learning workflows; collaborated across computational biology, \nbioinformatics technologies, oncology, functional genomics, and pathology teams","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Computational and Data Science Intern - Spatial Omics & Translational Oncology at Amgen · 2025年 - 2025年","education":[{"school":"University of Michigan Medical School","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy - PhD","field_of_study":"Computational Medicine and Bioinformatics","date_range":"2021年 - 2026年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"密西根大学","degree":"","field_of_study":"","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | University of Mich