{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:10:34+08:00","record":{"name":"Binbin Chen, MD, PhD","current_title":"CEO/Co-founder","current_company":"Vcreate · 全职","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 斯坦福","headline":"Co-founder at Vcreate.io | Physician Scientist | AI for drug development","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/binbin-chen-md-phd-a1a52824","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAUPmbYBc8itFIeq6pVqBfCb1dRmqDTpR3s","core_skills":["JUMP","Data Analysis","Competitive Intelligence"],"positions":[{"title":"CEO/Co-founder","company":"Vcreate · 全职","date_range":"2021年5月 - 现在","duration":"5 年 5 个月","location":"","description":"Co-founded Vcreate, an AI-enabled T-cell engager biotech company against first-in-class targets.  \n \n- Recruited and managed a team of multidisciplinary PhD scientists across target discovery, machine learning, protein engineering. \n- Developed in-house AI protein design capability and advanced novel binders against difficult targets; applied immunogenicity evaluation frameworks to assess developability risk. \n- Hosted board meetings with investors and scientific advisors; built pitch decks and investment cases; recruited and engaged immunology KOLs to shape program strategy. \n- Raised both venture capital and federal non-dilutive funding; Principal Investigator on four NIH/NSF SBIR grants, aligning scientific strategy with milestone-driven execution. \n- Built and supervised end-to-end preclinical pipelines spanning target discovery, hit discovery, hit-to-lead, lead optimization, and IND-enabling studies; translated computational insights into experimental execution. \n- Pipeline strategy planning integrating unmet clinical needs and competition landscape. Initiated three potential first-in-class oncology programs (breast cancer, ovarian cancer, colorectal cancer) with in vivo validation demonstrating tumor inhibition. \n- Signed and executed paid collaboration projects with major biotech companies.\n\n• Founded and lead an AI + high-throughput screening biotech developing next-generation immunotherapies across T-cell therapies, T-cell engagers, and AI-designed biologics (oncology/immunology) for breast cancer, ovarian cancer and colorectal cancer. \n• Delivered target/biomarker discovery strategy using patient data from Phase III oncology trials; led NDA execution and stakeholder alignment to enable compliant data access and analysis. \n• Scaled and managed a lean team (5 FTEs) and coordinated external CRO/CDMO execution with WuXi, GenScript, Sino Biological, and Crown Bioscience for protein production, analytics, and animal studies. \n• Vcreate’s TCR–antigen prediction tool, TAPIR is used by 100+ institutes worldwide.","skills":["Investigational New Drug Application (IND)","Pre-clinical Studies","Grant Administration","Grant Writing","Fundraising","Team Management","Strategic Planning","Competitive Intelligence"]},{"title":"Consultant","company":"Stanford Health Care","date_range":"2019年1月 - 2019年5月","duration":"5 个月","location":"","description":"- Evaluated what drove patient satisfaction with 10 years of longitudinal patient survey data and natural language processing (NLP).  \n- Presented our findings to major shareholders at Stanford Healthcare for patient experience.\n\n• Evaluated drivers of patient satisfaction using longitudinal survey data and natural language processing (NLP). \n• Synthesized findings into executive-ready recommendations and presented to senior Stanford Health Care stakeholders to inform patient experience quality improvement.","skills":["Team Management"]},{"title":"Fellow","company":"Brown Institute for Media Innovation","date_range":"2017年6月 - 2018年9月","duration":"1 年 4 个月","location":"Stanford, CA","description":"To empower journalists to uncover how news articles and readers talk about topics, my colleagues and I developed Iris, a conversational agent to conduct data science tasks. Iris allows non-experts to interact with programming and to build sophisticated machine learning algorithms with human languages.\n\n• Co-developed Iris, a conversational agent enabling non-experts to run data science workflows and build ML models via natural language interfaces.","skills":[]},{"title":"MD Candidate","company":"Stanford University School of Medicine · 全职","date_range":"2014年6月 - 2021年6月","duration":"7 年 1 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 斯坦福","description":"First hand experience and training as a MD candidate in internal medicine, surgery, pediatrics, obstetrics and gynecology, psychiatry, family medicine, neurology, radiology, medical oncology, radiation oncology, rheumatology, and immunology.\n\n• Hands-on clinical experience as a healthcare provider in both in-patient and clinical setting across all medical units: internal medicine, surgery, rheumatology and pathology etc. Personal MD network across all clinical specialties, especially in major cancer centers.","skills":["Team Management"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | CEO/Co-founder at Vcreate · 2021年 - 现在 | Consultant at Stanford Health Care · 2019年 - 2019年 | Fellow at Brown Institute for Media Innovation · 2017年 - 2018年 | MD Candidate at Stanford University School of Medicine · 2014年 - 2021年 | Doctoral Researcher at Stanford University · 2014年 - 2019年 | Researcher at National Institutes of Health · 2012年 - 2012年 | Development Engineer at Procter & Gamble · 2011年 - 2011年 | Research Technologist at Georgia Institute of Technology · 2010年 - 2014年","education":[{"school":"Stanford University School of Medicine","degree":"Doctor of Medicine (M.D.)","field_of_study":"","date_range":"2014年 - 2021年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"美国斯坦福大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy - PhD","field_of_study":"Genetics","date_range":"2016年 - 2019年","activities":"活动与社团: Co-advised by Russ Altman and Ash Alizadeh","grade":""},{"school":"Georgia Institute of Technology","degree":"Bachelor's Degree","field_of_study":"Bioengineering and Biomedical Engineering","date_range":"2009年 - 2013年","activities":"活动与社团: BMES, Tau Beta Pi, SASE","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | Stanford University School of Medicine，Doctor of Medicine (M.D.) · 2014年 - 2021年 | 美国斯坦福大学，Doctor of Philosophy - PhD · 2016年 - 2019年 | Georgia Institute of Technology，Bachelor's Degree · 2009年 - 2013年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 Director Associate Director Manager Team Manager 职位性质 合同制 全职 所在地点 现场办公: 美国 加利福尼亚 斯坦福 旧金山湾区 美国 加利福尼亚 圣荷西 美国 加利福尼亚 南旧金山 远程办公: 美国 加利福尼亚 斯坦福 开始日期 我在积极找工作，可以马上开始 工作场所类型 现场办公 混合办公 远程办公"],"languages":[{"name":"Chinese","proficiency":""}],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
