ills":[]},{"title":"Associate Director / Consultant","company":"Mallinckrodt Pharmaceuticals, Autoimmune & Rare Diseases (formerly Questcor)","date_range":"2014年5月 - 2014年11月","duration":"7 个月","location":"","description":"Non-clinical development, autoimmune disorders","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Senior Director, Head of Discovery and Non-clinical Development at Trevena, Inc. · 2024年 - 现在 | Director, Head of Discovery and Non-clinical Development at Trevena, Inc. · 2023年 - 2024年 | Director, Head of Discovery at Trevena, Inc. · 2021年 - 2023年 | Associate Director, Discovery at Larimar Therapeutics Inc. · 2020年 - 2021年 | Sr Research Investigator at Bristol-Myers Squibb · 2014年 - 2020年 | Associate Director / Consultant at Mallinckrodt Pharmaceuticals, Autoimmune & Rare Diseases (formerly Questcor) · 2014年 - 2014年 | Sr. Principal Investigator at Purdue Pharma · 2013年 - 2014年 | Principal Investigator at Purdue Pharma · 2008年 - 2013年 | Staff Scientist at Novo Nordisk · 2006年 - 2008年 | Senior Research Scientist at Novo Nordisk · 2006年 - 2006年 | Senior Research Molecular Biologist at FMC Corp/Devgen · 2000年 - 2006年","education":[{"school":"University of Kentucky","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)","field_of_study":"","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | University of Kentucky，Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.) | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 Director Vice President 职位性质 全职 所在地点 现场办公: 美国 远程办公: 美国 开始日期 我在积极找工作，可以马上开始 工作场所类型 现场办公 混合办公 远程办公"],"languages":[],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:12:54+08:00","record":{"name":"Tom Chen","current_title":"Senior Director, Head of Biology","current_company":"Cold Start Therapeutics · 全职","location":"波士顿地区","headline":"Experienced Project Leader in Biology (biologics, small molecules and PROTACs)","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/tom-chen-60330426","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAViYmMBAtWr3NOHOzoubQNxZ5iYJnguxrQ","core_skills":["Assay Development","Cancer Research","ELISA"],"positions":[{"title":"Senior Director, Head of Biology","company":"Cold Start Therapeutics · 全职","date_range":"2023年10月 - 现在","duration":"3 年","location":"","description":"• Partnered with computational and biophysics co-founders to translate UCSD-derived molecular dynamics / AI modeling hypotheses into actionable biology assay cascades, SAR feedback, and project decision-making. \n• Led biology strategy and wet-lab execution across three AI/ML-enabled discovery programs — two molecular glue programs and one GPCR program — advancing assets from early discovery into hit-to-lead / lead optimization. \n• Directed global CRO biology teams to generate high-quality biochemical, biophysical, cellular, and translational datasets that informed AI/ML- and molecular-dynamics-guided design cycles. \n• Propose and structure the company’s budget plan, collaborate with and help recruitment of both industrial and academic KOLs to form company’s SAB and consultant partnership. \n• Assist and build the pitch deck and data room for fundraising and external communication need.","skills":[]},{"title":"Director Biology","company":"Civetta Therapeutics","date_range":"1 年 6 个月","duration":"8 个月","location":"美国","description":"• Propel 2 of the 3 company’s pipeline projects (a PPI inhibitor and a DUB inhibitor) from pre-screening stage to hit-to-lead (H2L) and LO by creative and innovative assay design, while guiding and managing the working group team both internally and externally with CROs. \n• Lead the internal biology group and provide guidance on target selections, including 3-4 early-stage discovery projects, across IO, neurodegenerative and oncology. \n• Full-fledged participance in presenting quarterly SAB (Scientific Advisory Board), as well as company direction, budgeting, and science as a member of senior leadership team. \n• Provide expertise and guidance for screening, enhancing existing assays, designing new assays, and implementation of new ideas and technologies. \n• Manage external CRO team and design various in vitro biology and in vivo PKPD studies. \n• Collaborate with external KOLs and form partnership with both industrial and academic alliances to deepen understanding of the therapeutic target area of interest.","skills":["技能: Drug Discovery • High Throughput Screening • Oncology","Drug Discovery","High Throughput Screening","Oncology"]},{"title":"Associate Director of Biology","company":"Civetta Therapeutics","date_range":"1 年 6 个月","duration":"8 个月","location":"美国","description":"• Propel 2 of the 3 company’s pipeline projects (a PPI inhibitor and a DUB inhibitor) from pre-screening stage to hit-to-lead (H2L) and LO by creative and innovative assay design, while guiding and managing the working group team both internally and externally with CROs. \n• Lead the internal biology group and provide guidance on target selections, including 3-4 early-stage discovery projects, across IO, neurodegenerative and oncology. \n• Full-fledged participance in presenting quarterly SAB (Scientific Advisory Board), as well as company direction, budgeting, and science as a member of senior leadership team. \n• Provide expertise and guidance for screening, enhancing existing assays, designing new assays, and implementation of new ideas and technologies. \n• Manage external CRO team and design various in vitro biology and in vivo PKPD studies. \n• Collaborate with external KOLs and form partnership with both industrial and academic alliances to deepen understanding of the therapeutic target area of interest.","skills":["技能: Drug Discovery • High Throughput Screening • Oncology","Drug Discovery","High Throughput Screening","Oncology"]},{"title":"Principal Scientist","company":"Kronos Bio","date_range":"2 年 6 个月","duration":"1 年 3 个月","location":"波士顿地区","description":"• Heading a laboratory that contributes to 4 of the 6 company’s internal originated projects, from discovery efforts to IND-enabling studies mainly focused on transcriptional regulatory network inhibition by either inhibitor or degrader compounds. \n• Leading multiple teams as PTL across different function to perform target discovery, drug screens for both endogenous targets across various cell lines or via engineered cell lines, cell-based assay development, PKPD analysis for animal models and numerous target validation and target engagement. \n• Established and engaged with multiple CRO vendors to develop assay and conduct several translational studies in company’s early stage. \n• Contributed to writing an IND protocol that has been successfully filed. \n• Co-authored a few posters on the company’s first internal developed clinical candidate KB-0742 (a highly selective CDK9i in Phase1/2).","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Scientist, Biology","company":"Kronos Bio","date_range":"2 年 6 个月","duration":"1 年 3 个月","location":"波士顿地区","description":"• Heading a laboratory that contributes to 4 of the 6 company’s internal originated projects, from discovery efforts to IND-enabling studies mainly focused on transcriptional regulatory network inhibition by either inhibitor or degrader compounds. \n• Leading multiple teams as PTL across different function to perform target discovery, drug screens for both endogenous targets across various cell lines or via engineered cell lines, cell-based assay development, PKPD analysis for animal models and numerous target validation and target engagement. \n• Established and engaged with multiple CRO vendors to develop assay and conduct several translational studies in company’s early stage. \n• Contributed to writing an IND protocol that has been successfully filed. \n• Co-authored a few posters on the company’s first internal developed clinical candidate KB-0742 (a highly selective CDK9i in Phase1/2).","skills":[]},{"title":"Staff Scientist","company":"Regeneron","date_range":"4 年 4 个月","duration":"10 个月","location":"Tarrytown, New York","description":"• Leading scientist for cell-based assay development and high-throughput screenings design in 14 projects across multiple disease indications and 3 into clinical trials (NPR1, IL2Rg and IL33). \n• Discovered and revealed novel MOA of targeted therapeutic antibodies that have led to rational designs of therapies in the follow-up clinical studies. \n• Developed hypothesis and validated target biology by correlating antibody screen results with various types of cell line data generated, including mutations in signaling pathways, pathway activity profiles, gene expression array, FACS, imaging-based assays, ELISA-based assays and more. \n• Established cross-functional group collaborations to investigate the targeted therapeutic antibodies. \n• Contributed to writing to multiple patents and IND protocol that has been filed and in trial.","skills":[]},{"title":"Scientist","company":"Regeneron","date_range":"4 年 4 个月","duration":"10 个月","location":"Tarrytown, New York","description":"• Leading scientist for cell-based assay development and high-throughput screenings design in 14 projects across multiple disease indications and 3 into clinical trials (NPR1, IL2Rg and IL33). \n• Discovered and revealed novel MOA of targeted therapeutic antibodies that have led to rational designs of therapies in the follow-up clinical studies. \n• Developed hypothesis and validated target biology by correlating antibody screen results with various types of cell line data generated, including mutations in signaling pathways, pathway activity profiles, gene expression array, FACS, imaging-based assays, ELISA-based assays and more. \n• Established cross-functional group collaborations to investigate the targeted therapeutic antibodies. \n• Contributed to writing to multiple patents and IND protocol that has been filed and in trial.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Senior Director, Head of Biology at Cold Start Therapeutics · 2023年 - 现在 | Director Biology at Civetta Therapeutics · 2023年 - 2023年 | Associate Director of Biology at Civetta Therapeutics · 2022年 - 2023年 | Principal Scientist at Kronos Bio, Inc. · 2021年 - 2022年 | Senior Scientist, Biology at Kronos Bio, Inc. · 2019年 - 2021年 | Staff Scientist at Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc. · 2019年 - 2019年 | Scientist at Regeneron Pharmaceuticals, Inc. · 2015年 - 2018年 | Postdoctoral Research Fellow at Genentech · 2010年 - 2015年 | Postdoc Fellow at UCLA · 2010年 - 2010年 | Vascular Biology Graduate Trainee at UCLA · 2004年 - 2009年 | Teaching Assistant at UCLA · 2004年 - 2005年 | Research Assistant at UCSF Medical Center · 2001年 - 2003年 | Part-time research assistant at USDA · 2001年 - 2003年","education":[{"school":"美国加州大学洛杉矶分校","degree":"PHD","field_of_study":"Molecular Cell and Developmental Biology","date_range":"2003年 - 2009年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"美国加州大学伯克利分校","degree":"BS","field_of_study":"Molecular Cell Biology","date_range":"1999年 - 2001年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 美国加州大学洛杉矶分校，PHD · 2003年 - 2009年 | 美国加州大学伯克利分校，BS · 1999年 - 2001年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":[],"languages":[],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
