{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:13:53+08:00","record":{"name":"Kevin Chen","current_title":"Executive Director, Biologics","current_company":"SciNeuro Pharmaceuticals · 全职","location":"美国 马里兰州 日耳曼镇","headline":"Executive leader/therapeutic Biologics development in immuno-oncology, autoimmune diseases and neurodegenerative diseases.","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kevin-chen-3ab946101","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAABnyKrMBGt6SK5gAoVW33CI9OCmMrg59dJ0","core_skills":["protein/antibody engineering","T cels","ELISA/MSD development"],"positions":[{"title":"Executive Director, Biologics","company":"SciNeuro Pharmaceuticals · 全职","date_range":"2024年11月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 11 个月","location":"","description":"• Lead strategic biologic discovery across CNS indications using proprietary BBB shuttle platforms. \n• Define and execute early discovery strategies, prioritizing targets aligned with the portfolio and corporate vision. \n• Oversee Go/No-Go experiments, ensuring timely advancement of candidates through preclinical pipeline. \n• Support external due diligence efforts and contributed to scientific aspects of BD and licensing discussions.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Director, Discovery and Research","company":"Georgiamune Inc. · 全职","date_range":"2022年9月 - 2024年10月","duration":"2 年 2 个月","location":"Gaitherburg, MD","description":"• Managed internal new drug discovery projects to ensure timelines and goals were met from discovery to IND, intergrateing early research, progression through candidate nomination and selection. \n• Led a group of scientists and reseach associates to identify new drus candidates, design in vitro and in vivo assays for the evaluation of mode of action for immuno-oncology and autoimmune diseases.\n\n• Directed immunology-focused drug discovery (biologics and small molecules) from early-stage validation through IND-enabling studies. \n• Built and mentored a multidisciplinary team focused on autoimmune (IBD, T1D, Lupus, etc. \n• ) and immuno-oncology therapeutics. \n• Designed and executed preclinical pharmacology studies to elucidate MOA and support candidate selection. \n• Interfaced with IP/legal and BD teams to support partnering opportunities and protect innovation.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Director, Preclinical","company":"OncoC4, Inc. · 全职","date_range":"2021年5月 - 2022年9月","duration":"1 年 5 个月","location":"美国 马里兰州 洛克维","description":"• Led cross-function teams in developing therapeutic antibodies including bi-specific and multifunctional antibodies for immune-oncology. \n• Line-managed scientists, providing day to day support, addressing challenges and professional development. \n• Coordinated and led engagement with CROs and in-house resources in efforts related to candidate identification and characterization. \n• Provided domain area expertise and worked collaboratively across the organization to help build and mature therapeutic pipelines for the company.\n\n• Oversaw multifunctional and bispecific antibody programs for immuno-oncology. \n• Directed strategic go/no-go decision experiments to streamline candidate advancement. \n• Collaborated with medicinal chemistry and preclinical safety groups for integrated development plans. \n• Managed CROs and guided internal teams for developability and immunogenicity assessments.","skills":[]},{"title":"Director, antobody and cell engineering","company":"NovaRock Biotherapeutics Ltd · 全职","date_range":"2019年6月 - 2021年5月","duration":"2 年","location":"美国 新泽西州 悠因","description":"Develop bispecific and multi-functional antibodies platforms. \nLead a group of scientists to produce and characterize mAb, bsAb and multi-functional antibodies by bio-analytical assays and cell-based functional assays.\n\n• Led antibody discovery and validation of bispecific and multifunctional formats. \n• Developed potency assays and bioanalytical platforms for antibody characterization. \n• Supported translational science and coordinated internal and CRO resources.","skills":["Assay Development"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Executive Director, Biologics at SciNeuro Pharmaceuticals · 2024年 - 现在 | Senior Director, Discovery and Research at Georgiamune Inc. · 2022年 - 2024年 | Senior Director, Preclinical at OncoC4, Inc. · 2021年 - 2022年 | Director, antobody and cell engineering at NovaRock Biotherapeutics Ltd · 2019年 - 2021年 | Associate Director at Precigen Inc · 2018年 - 2019年 | Senior Scientist at Intrexon Corporation · 2015年 - 2018年 | Principal Scientist at ElAb Bio Inc · 2013年 - 2015年 | Senior Scientist at Intrexon · 2012年 - 2013年 | Senior Scientist at WellStat Immunotherapeutics/Opthalmics · 2007年 - 2012年 | Acting Instructor at University of Washington · 2003年 - 2007年","education":[{"school":"Medical University of South Carolina","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD)","field_of_study":"Microbiology and Immunology","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"National ChungHsing University, Taichung, Taiwan","degree":"DVM","field_of_study":"Veterinary Medicine","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | Medical University of South Carolina，Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) | National ChungHsing University, Taichung, Taiwan，DVM | 保存到项目 | 将Kevin保存到项目 | 发消息给Kevin | Kevin Chen的更多操作","open_to_work":[],"languages":[],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
