{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:15:25+08:00","record":{"name":"Zijun Chen","current_title":"Director (@Structural biology and drug discovery)","current_company":"Risen (Shanghai) Pharma Tech （润佳医药）","location":"中国 上海市","headline":"Structural biology and discovery biology| PhD","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/zijun-chen-b5b4095a","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAyE0zcBpsBLplRU0UDtdEGmzeTiVa17C5U","core_skills":["Hit-to-Lead drug discovery","Assay Development/HTS","Proteomics"],"positions":[{"title":"Director (@Structural biology and drug discovery)","company":"Risen (Shanghai) Pharma Tech （润佳医药）","date_range":"2021年5月 - 现在","duration":"5 年 5 个月","location":"Shanghai","description":"• Spearheaded first-in-class (FIC) drug discovery programs for immune-oncology and hepatitis indications, focusing on small-molecule weight inhibitors (LMWi) and siRNA therapeutics. \n• Led research efforts in target validation, assay development, structural biology characterization and high-throughput screening (HTS), and collaborated with medicinal chemistry teams to drive hit validation, structure-activity relationship (SAR) analysis and lead optimization","skills":["Drug Discovery","Assay Development/HTS","X-ray crystallography"]},{"title":"Director (@Discovery biology)","company":"ETERN Therapeutics （奕拓医药） · 合同","date_range":"2020年5月 - 2021年4月","duration":"1 年","location":"中国 上海市 浦东新区","description":"• Focused on small-molecule innovative drug development targeting undruggable oncological targets, advancing preclinical research for challenging cancer-associated targets. \n• Established an in-house dynamic structural biology platform, and collaborated with computer-aided drug design (CADD) teams to accelerate new drug discovery and hit generation processes.","skills":["Drug Discovery","X-ray crystallography"]},{"title":"Scientific Technical Leader I (@Discovery biology)","company":"Novartis Institutes for BioMedical Research (诺华生物医学研究有限公司)","date_range":"2010年12月 - 2020年5月","duration":"9 年 6 个月","location":"中国 上海市","description":"• Served as a core researcher in multiple early-phase drug discovery and structural biology programs, with a specialized focus on small and large molecule R&D for cancer and liver disease indications. \n• Conducted systematic research in protein production, biophysical/biochemical characterization and macromolecular crystallography. Delivered multiple key protein-ligand complex structures to elucidate drug candidate mechanisms of action (MOAs) and support SAR-guided drug optimization.","skills":["Drug Discovery","Assay Development/HTS","X-ray crystallography","Protein Production"]},{"title":"Team Leader (@Gene Technology & Bioassay)","company":"Dragonfly Sciences, Inc. （宝船生物）","date_range":"2006年8月 - 2010年11月","duration":"4 年 4 个月","location":"Gene Technology & Bioassay","description":"• Led the research in target gene validation, molecular cloning, and functional assay development, with a focus on establishing cellular models for antibody efficacy evaluation. Advanced the development of robust bioassay systems to support preclinical assessment of antibody-based therapeutics.","skills":["Molecular & Cellular Biology"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Director (@Structural biology and drug discovery) at Risen (Shanghai) Pharma Tech （润佳医药） · 2021年 - 现在 | Director (@Discovery biology) at ETERN Therapeutics （奕拓医药） · 2020年 - 2021年 | Scientific Technical Leader I (@Discovery biology) at Novartis Institutes for BioMedical Research (诺华生物医学研究有限公司) · 2010年 - 2020年 | Team Leader (@Gene Technology & Bioassay) at Dragonfly Sciences, Inc. （宝船生物） · 2006年 - 2010年 | Team Leader (@Research & Laboratory) at Newsummit biopharma co. ltd (SHANGHAI, CHINA) · 2005年 - 2006年 | DBS at NUS (新加坡国立大学生物系） - Visitor · 2003年 - 2004年","education":[{"school":"复旦大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy - PhD","field_of_study":"","date_range":"","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"厦门大学","deg