{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:17:01+08:00","record":{"name":"Sharon (Xueyan) chen","current_title":"Quality Control Scientist","current_company":"10x Genomics","location":"美国","headline":"Quality Control Scientist at 10x Genomics","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/sharon-xueyan-chen-01456517","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAN2s9ABpKv3OcysRSL7JA-bDxJyibu0XzU","core_skills":["Single Cell RNASeq","Assay Development","Research Design"],"positions":[{"title":"Quality Control Scientist","company":"10x Genomics","date_range":"4 年 9 个月","duration":"3 年 6 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 普莱森顿","description":"• Directed the development and technical transfer of 10+ complex molecular QC methods, ensuring QC readiness for commercialization in alignment with quality, cost, and timeline objectives. \n• Collaborated cross-functionally to optimize assay robustness, resulting in a significant reduction in failure rates for high-throughput production. \n• Served as primary Subject Matter Expert (SME) for analytical troubleshooting and hands-on execution of high-complexity, urgent assays. \n• Guaranteed 100% adherence to critical lot-release deadlines without compromising quality standards. \n• Managed the comprehensive SOP lifecycle, including the authoring, revising, and providing final technical approval of procedures to ensure total cGMP compliance and Data Integrity. \n• Spearheaded Method Gap and Risk Assessments and led cross-functional root-cause investigations into systemic reagent failures, successfully qualifying superior vendor sources to stabilize the supply chain. \n• Operational Coordination & Mentorship: Coordinated technical support with team schedulers to maintain aggressive turnaround times (TAT). \n• Built team competency by mentoring QC analysts on advanced methodologies and high-throughput workflows.","skills":["技能: Single Cell RNASeq • Troubleshooting • Assay Development • Genetics • Molecular Biology • Data Analysis • Time Management • NGS","Single Cell RNASeq","Troubleshooting","Assay Development","Genetics","Molecular Biology","Data Analysis","Time Management","NGS","技能: Single Cell RNASeq • Troubleshooting • Genetics • Molecular Biology • Data Analysis • Time Management • NGS"]},{"title":"Senior Quality Control Associate","company":"10x Genomics","date_range":"4 年 9 个月","duration":"3 年 6 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 普莱森顿","description":"• Directed the development and technical transfer of 10+ complex molecular QC methods, ensuring QC readiness for commercialization in alignment with quality, cost, and timeline objectives. \n• Collaborated cross-functionally to optimize assay robustness, resulting in a significant reduction in failure rates for high-throughput production. \n• Served as primary Subject Matter Expert (SME) for analytical troubleshooting and hands-on execution of high-complexity, urgent assays. \n• Guaranteed 100% adherence to critical lot-release deadlines without compromising quality standards. \n• Managed the comprehensive SOP lifecycle, including the authoring, revising, and providing final technical approval of procedures to ensure total cGMP compliance and Data Integrity. \n• Spearheaded Method Gap and Risk Assessments and led cross-functional root-cause investigations into systemic reagent failures, successfully qualifying superior vendor sources to stabilize the supply chain. \n• Operational Coordination & Mentorship: Coordinated technical support with team schedulers to maintain aggressive turnaround times (TAT). \n• Built team competency by mentoring QC analysts on advanced methodologies and high-throughput workflows.","skills":["技能: Single Cell RNASeq • Troubleshooting • Assay Development • Genetics • Molecular Biology • Data Analysis • Time Management • NGS","Single Cell RNASeq","Troubleshooting","Assay Development","Genetics","Molecular Biology","Data Analysis","Time Management","NGS","技能: Single Cell RNASeq • Troubleshooting • Genetics • Molecular Biology • Data Analysis • Time Management • NGS"]},{"title":"Lab manager and Postdoctoral Scholar","company":"University of California, Davis · 全职","date_range":"2015年7月 - 2016年1月","duration":"7 个月","location":"Davis","description":"▪ Provided Laboratory management \n▪ Completed bovine rumen sourced Cellulase gene expression in E. coli and their enzymatic activity \n▪ Experimental design, data collection, data analysis, data visualization, and presentation\n\n• Managed laboratory operations including safety compliance, procurement, and SOP development, ensuring regulatory compliance and operational continuity. \n• Spearheaded experimental studies supporting enzyme characterization and process feasibility, generating data that informed development decisions and validated pathway viability. \n• Improved laboratory inventory and SOP controls to enhance operational efficiency.","skills":["Troubleshooting","Assay Development","Genetics","Molecular Biology","Research Design","Data Analysis","Time Management"]},{"title":"Postdoctoral Research associate in Molecular Biology","company":"Texas A&M University · 全职","date_range":"2009年10月 - 2011年3月","duration":"1 年 6 个月","location":"College station, Texas","description":"Structure dynamics guided drug discovery and classification analysis for breast cancer \n▪ Developed a protocol to produce soluble proteins of estrogen receptor (ER) in E. coli system and purify ERα through Fast Protein Liquid Chromatography (FPLC) \n▪ Dissected the structure dynamics-function relation for ERα responsible to different drug treatments based on Hydrogen/Deuterium exchange (HDX) detected by LC-MS/MS \n▪ Completed a screen and classification of drug targets of ERα \n▪ Completed DNA extraction and library preparation for next-generation sequencing (NGS) using Illumina sequencer \n▪ Performed various data analysis, data visualization, and the results were published in a peer-reviewed journal\n\n• Designed and executed molecular biology, genomics, and protein biochemistry studies across oncology and microbial pathogenesis, including protein expression and purification in E coli using FPLC, and genetic manipulation of microbial strains through targeted gene deletion to investigate gene function and disease mechanisms. \n• Collaborated with multidisciplinary academic teams and industry partners on translational research projects. \n• Developed immunoassays (ELISA) and conducted structural and functional protein studies, generating high-quality data that advanced assay readiness and supported downstream analytical decisions. \n• Supervised junior researchers and published peer-reviewed research, strengthening team capability and contributing validated scientific findings to the field.","skills":["Troubleshooting","Assay Development","Genetics","Molecular Biology","Research Design","Data Analysis","Time Management","NGS"]},{"title":"Postdoctoral fellow in Microbiology and Molecular Biology","company":"University of Tennessee · 全职","date_range":"2008年2月 - 2009年10月","duration":"1 年 9 个月","location":"诺克斯维尔地区","description":"Genome-wide discovery of virulence factors and other bio-molecules and associated data analysis \n▪ Investigated the conservation of sua gene in strains of Streptococcus uberis isolated from geographically diverse areas \n▪ Developed a protocol of electroporation for Streptococcus uberis wild isolate UT888 \n▪ Completed deletion of sua gene in Streptococcus uberis UT888 and the phenotype screen of the mutant strain \n▪ Collaborated with Pfizer on Streptococcus uberis study \n▪ Published a total of 3 papers including first-author on Veterinary Microbiology","skills":["Troubleshooting","Assay Development","Genetics","Molecular Biology","Research Design","Microbiology","Data Analysis","Time Management"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Quality Control Scientist at 10x Genomics · 2023年 - 现在 | Senior Quality Control Associate at 10x Genomics · 2022年 - 2023年 | Lab manager and Pos