uild -omics data knowledge graphs to support company target discovery and target biology understanding efforts. \n• Manage early discovery platform programs o Act as a core team member in exploring and pitching platform based external business partnerships. \n• o Drive computational and data strategy planning, execution and results delivery to align with critical business needs. \n• o Manage early discovery project research planning, project resource and budget, program milestone definition, progress tracking, go/no-go decision making, and stakeholder communications.","skills":["Artificial Intelligence (AI)","Biomarker Discovery","Biomarker Development","Translational Medicine","Early Discovery","Cross-functional Initiatives","Data Science Leader","Cross-functional Team Leadership","Team Influence","Program Management","Translational science leader","Strategic Planning","Team Building","Building Business Partnerships"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Director, Neuroscience NGTx at Eli Lilly and Company · 2024年 - 现在 | VP and Co-Founder at BioSpark Group · 2017年 - 现在 | Consultant at InScienceWeTrust BioAdvisory · 2023年 - 2024年 | Director, Precision Medicine & Bioinformatics at Exo Therapeutics · 2022年 - 2024年 | Sr Investigator (Project lead), Data Science at H3 Biomedicine Inc. (An Eisai Company) · 2020年 - 2022年 | Senior Investigator, Clinical Biomarker and Data Science at Eisai US · 2020年 - 2022年 | Head of Data Science and Strategy, Co-founder at PepGene · 2018年 - 2020年 | Scientist, Computational Biology at Sanofi · 2017年 - 2018年 | Scientist at MD Anderson Cancer Center · 2016年 - 2017年 | Computational Biologist at UT MD Anderson Cancer Ctr · 2016年 - 2017年 | Intern at Pfizer · 2015年 - 2015年 | Research Assistant, Bioinformatics at UT MD Anderson Cancer Center · 2011年 - 2016年 | Research Assistant, Cancer biology and Immunology at Xiamen University · 2007年 - 2011年","education":[{"school":"UT MD Anderson UTHealth Houston Graduate School of Biomedical S