{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:18:20+08:00","record":{"name":"Xiaohong Chen","current_title":"Senior Scientific Lead, Medical Chemistry","current_company":"Eli Lilly and Company · 全职","location":"美国","headline":"Senior Scientific Lead, medicinal chemistry","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/xiaohong-chen-19718327","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAWK2UMB9-OGXb3jmAWtECAK6bKegLcVwHA","core_skills":["safe handling chemicals","design strategy for synthesis","teaching skill"],"positions":[{"title":"Senior Scientific Lead, Medical Chemistry","company":"Eli Lilly and Company · 全职","date_range":"2024年10月 - 现在","duration":"2 年","location":"美国","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Scientific Lead, Medicinal Chemistry","company":"Loxo Oncology at Lilly · 全职","date_range":"2021年8月 - 2024年9月","duration":"3 年 2 个月","location":"美国 科罗拉多州","description":"--Passionate and experienced in medicinal chemistry, breakthrough challenge project; \n--Experienced in structure-based drug design, multi-parameter lead optimization; \n--Good at using mastro, MOE and other computational tools for understanding protein pockets and  \ndesigning better drug molecules; \n--Knowledge of drug discovery disciplines, including chemistry, biology, ADME/PK, etc. \n--Excellent at trouble shooting synthetic problems; \n--Constructively communicate with CROs, providing suggestions, feedbacks and synthetic procedures to  \nCROs to speed up target delivery; \n--Great team player, collaborating with people from different backgrounds to push projects forward.","skills":[]},{"title":"Scientist, medicinal chemistry","company":"Hansoh Bio · 全职","date_range":"2021年2月 - 2021年7月","duration":"6 个月","location":"美国 马里兰州 洛克维","description":"• Design and synthesize novel small molecules for the treatment of heart disease; \n• In put idea for IP landscape; \n• Present research progress at team meetings; \n• Help CRO solve the synthesis problem by trouble shooting and propose alternative synthetic routes.","skills":[]},{"title":"Assistant Project Scientist","company":"UCLA · 全职","date_range":"2017年9月 - 2021年2月","duration":"3 年 6 个月","location":"LA","description":"• Synthesized a series of analogues for the ENPP1 inhibitor for treatment of . Some of the analogues showed better inhibitory effect compared to the hit compound. In 2020, a provisional patent has been filed and several pharmaceutical companies expressed interest of licensing this patent.  \n• Even though the High Throughput Screening generated false-positive hit compounds, Dr. Chen managed to discover active compounds during her persistent troubleshooting process. \nProject Three: Developing Novel Therapies Targeting Cancer Stem Cells for the Treatment of Glioblastoma (11/2019 to 01/2021)  \n• Glioblastoma is an aggressive type of cancer that can occur in the brain or spinal cord with only around 10% five-year survival rate. Prof. Frank Pajonk at the UCLA Radiation Oncology Department discovered that the commonly used radiotherapy and chemotherapy promoted the generation of cancer stem cells, which undermined the efficacy of medical treatment. \n• As the only medicinal chemist on this collaborative project, Dr. Xiaohong Chen designed and synthesized more than one hundred analogues for biological tests within one year. A provisional patent will be filed in the near future. \n• The false-positive hit compound provided by the biologist made the medicinal chemistry super hard. After five-month troubleshooting, Dr. Chen identified three distinct and novel lead compounds showing promising anti-cancer activity by blocking the generation of cancer stem cells. She also conducted multi-gram synthesis of the lead compounds to support the study of mechanism of action and in vivo study.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Senior Scientific Lead, Medical Chemistry at Eli Lilly and Company · 2024年 - 现在 | Loxo Oncology at Lilly - Scientific Lead, Medicinal Chemistry · 2021年 - 2024年 | Scientist, medicinal chemistry at Hansoh Bio · 2021年 - 2021年 | Assistant Project Scientist at UCLA · 2017年 - 2021年 | University of California at Los Angeles - Staff Research Associate · 2016年 - 2017年 | University of Illinois at Chicago - Postdoctoral Research Associate · 2010年 - 2016年","education":[{"school":"四川大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.)","field_of_study":"Organic chemistry","date_range":"2005年 - 2010年","activities":"","grade":"advanced"}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 四川大学，Doctor of Philosophy (Ph.D.) · 2005年 - 2010年 | 档案分析行 | 最新动态 | 1 条消息 | 1 次浏览 | 保存到项目 | 将Xiaohong保存到项目 | 发消息给Xiaohong | Xiaohong Chen的更多操作","open_to_work":[],"languages":[{"name":"English","proficiency":"母语"}],"native_chinese":false,"detail_error":""}}
