{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:19:19+08:00","record":{"name":"Andy Chen, MD MBA","current_title":"Senior Director of Finance","current_company":"agilon health","location":"美国 纽约 纽约","headline":"Healthcare Finance Leader","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/andy-chen-md","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAABp1VH0BvTRYhYO3leFzEjWB9LobJS6S16k","core_skills":["Pharmaceutical Industry","DCF Valuation","Financial Analysis"],"positions":[{"title":"Senior Director of Finance","company":"agilon health","date_range":"2025年11月 - 现在","duration":"11 个月","location":"美国 纽约 纽约","description":"Finance Leader for agilon's North Central Region\n\n• Reports directly to the Market CFO and serve as the Northcentral region CFO for multiple joint ventures in New York, Ohio, and Pennsylvania, overseeing a revenue P&L responsibility of ~$2 billion. \n• Leads the finance team and financial operations function and presents financial results to key stakeholders during internal and partner reviews, as well as at quarterly joint venture board meetings.","skills":[]},{"title":"Director of Finance","company":"Honest Health","date_range":"2024年 - 2025年10月","duration":"1 年 10 个月","location":"美国 纽约 纽约","description":"Market CFO for Honest's New York market\n\n• Reported directly to the CFO and serve as the market CFO for 6 value-based care joint ventures in New York, overseeing a revenue P&L responsibility of ~$1 billion. \n• Focus on driving financial performance across ACO REACH, Medicare Advantage, and MSSP programs in the market and provide operational insights to the market leadership team through regular reporting.","skills":[]},{"title":"New Ventures Lead","company":"Aledade, Inc.","date_range":"2022年 - 2023年10月","duration":"1 年 10 个月","location":"美国 纽约 纽约","description":"Corporate Development (M&A) & Strategy\n\n• Lead evaluation, diligence and execution of M&A and other strategic partnerships, develop Aledade’s first inorganic growth str