s & Tagmentation • Transfection • Transduction • DNA Extraction • Methylation array","Flow Cytometry","Single Cell Sequencing","RNAseq","Reduced-representation bisulfite sequencing","Cleavage Under Targets & Tagmentation","Transfection","Transduction","DNA Extraction","Methylation array"]},{"title":"Research Assistant","company":"National Health Research Institutes","date_range":"2018年7月 - 2019年6月","duration":"1 年","location":"台湾 台北市","description":"- Investigated the modulations of transcription factors in CD4+ T cell autoreactivities (proliferation, polarization, and cytokine secretion) for the initiation and development of autoimmune diseases, including type 1 diabetes, multiple sclerosis, and inflammatory bowel disease (IBD) \n- Maintained and characterized 7 transgenic (overexpression, conventional/conditional knockout) mouse strains for pharmacology and mechanistic studies","skills":[]},{"title":"Master Thesis Student","company":"National Defense Medical Center · 全职","date_range":"2016年8月 - 2018年5月","duration":"1 年 10 个月","location":"Taipei City, Taiwan","description":"- Examined the regulatory roles of xbp1 (ER stress/unfolded protein response sensor) in two different dendritic cell subsets during the development of type I diabetes in non-obese diabetic mice \n- Established a standardized procedure for isolating conventional DC subsets from lymphoid organs and pancreases with FACS \n- Developed bone marrow-derived/splenic DC subset-T cell co-culture experiment  \n- Set up a nucleic acid gel electrophoresis for detecting 26bp mRNA difference with less than 10K cell-input \n- Teaching assistant for Advanced Immunology","skills":["Flow Cytometry","Mouse Models","Cell Sorting","qRT-PCR","GraphPad Prism","FlowJo","Polymerase Chain Reaction (PCR)","reactive oxygen species (ROS) detection"]},{"title":"Research Assistant (Summer Intern)","company":"Institute of Biomedical Sciences, Academia Sinica","date_range":"2015年7月 - 2015年8月","duration":"2 个月","location":"台湾 台北市