-of-concept, competitive positioning, and commercial potential of emerging therapeutics.","skills":["技能: Clinical Development • Biomarker Development • Analytics • Machine Learning • Biological Data Analysis • Python (Programming Language) • Monte Carlo Simulation • Portfolio Management • Clinical Trials","Clinical Development","Biomarker Development","Analytics","Machine Learning","Biological Data Analysis","Python (Programming Language)","Monte Carlo Simulation","Portfolio Management","Clinical Trials","技能: Due Diligence • DCF Valuation • Forecasting • Portfolio Management","Due Diligence","DCF Valuation","Forecasting"]},{"title":"Associate","company":"Mass Medical Angels · 兼职","date_range":"2021年9月 - 2023年9月","duration":"2 年 1 个月","location":"","description":"Investment decision-making, due diligence on drug and devices committee.","skills":[]},{"title":"Principal Scientist","company":"诺华","date_range":"3 年 10 个月","duration":"3 年 10 个月","location":"波士顿地区","description":"- Multi-Omics data analysis and integration to support key Novartis therapeutic areas such as CVM, Oncology, and Hematology. \n- Subject matter expert in Gene and Cell therapy, with experience in supporting various drug modalities such as CRISPR, AAV, siRNA, CAR-T, ADC, and small molecular therapies.\n\n• Venture Capital Practice & Investment Diligence ⚫ Mass Medical Angels, Novartis Venture Partner (12-month part-time rotation): Conducted end-to-end scientific and commercial due diligence for two early-stage biotech investments. \n• ⚫ Evaluated therapeutic rationale, preclinical/clinical data packages, technology platforms, and competitive market positioning. \n• ⚫ Prepared comprehensive investment memos analyzing risk-benefit profiles, return potential, and strategic alignment. \n• ⚫ Collaborated with management teams, KOLs, and advisors to assess team capabilities and execution feasibility. \n• Portfolio Management & Strategic Planning ⚫ Advised senior leadership on data-driven program prioriti