{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:21:36+08:00","record":{"name":"Jessie Chen","current_title":"Head of Business Development","current_company":"Hummingbird Bioscience · 全职","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 旧金山","headline":"Head of Business Development at Hummingbird Bioscience","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/lameijessiechen","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAACelgUBBketUBFkldC29Mlvutvh8GcA3UI","core_skills":["Pharmaceutical Industry","Lifesciences","Bioinformatics"],"positions":[{"title":"Head of Business Development","company":"Hummingbird Bioscience · 全职","date_range":"2025年10月 - 现在","duration":"1 年","location":"","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Founder","company":"Morningstar Strategy LLC · 自雇","date_range":"2024年11月 - 2025年10月","duration":"1 年","location":"美国 加利福尼亚","description":"Launched a consulting firm specializing in corporate strategy, business development, and fundraising within the life sciences sector.","skills":[]},{"title":"SVP, Business Development","company":"Pediatrix Therapeutics · 全职","date_range":"2021年 - 2024年","duration":"3 年 1 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚","description":"• Joined as one of the first ten employees, collaborating closely with the CEO and the Board to drive corporate strategy, business development and alliance management efforts. \n• Built, developed and managed a capable business development team, with up to 3 team members based in Shanghai, China. \n• Formulated and executed a product portfolio strategy, culminating in a diverse portfolio of 11 products within targeted therapeutic areas in pediatric space over three years. \n• Utilized various deal structures including licensing, co-development and strategic investments. \n• Managed alliances with various partners in the US and China. \n• Successfully supported the commercial launch of three products and advanced the development of additional products.","skills":[]},{"title":"VP, Business Development","company":"EverInsight; C-bridge Capital · 全职","date_range":"2020年 - 2021年","duration":"1 年 1 个月","location":"旧金山湾区","description":"• Led business development for EverInsight Therapeutics and subsequently spearheaded BD activities in the CNS field for Affamed Therapeutics following the merger of the two portfolio companies. \n• Collaborated closely with CBC managing directors and EverInsight founding members to establish the company, preparing the business case to the CBC Investment Committee. \n• Analyzed the drug development landscape in CNS and Ophthalmology, pinpointing two strategic growth areas within these therapeutic areas. \n• Led efforts in deal sourcing, business case, due diligence, valuation, negotiation, and contracting. \n• Signed two license-in deals with total deal size approximately $300,000,000.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Head of Business Development at Hummingbird Bioscience · 2025年 - 现在 | Founder at Morningstar Strategy LLC · 2024年 - 2025年 | SVP, Business Development at Pediatrix Therapeutics · 2021年 - 2024年 | VP, Business Development at EverInsight; C-bridge Capital · 2020年 - 2021年 | Executive Director at Fosun Private Equity · 2018年 - 2020年 | VP Business Development at SciClone Pharmaceuticals · 2017年 | VP, External Reseach & Development at Klus Pharma · 2016年 | Strategy Director, Asia at Hospira, a Pfizer company · 2013年 - 2015年 | Sr. Manager in Business Development at Eli Lilly and Company · 2010年 - 2013年 | Research Scientist at Roche · 2006年 - 2009年 | Cheminformatics Research Scientist at GlaxoSmithKline · 2005年 - 2006年","education":[{"school":"欧洲工商管理学院 (INSEAD)","degree":"MBA","field_of_study":"Business Administration and Management, General","date_range":"2009年 - 2010年","activities":"活动与社团: President of the Healthcare Club; member of the Consulting Club","grade":""},{"school":"美国加州大学洛杉矶分校","degree":"Ph.D.","field_of_study":"Bioinformatics","date_range":"2000年 - 2005年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"中国科学技术大学","degree