ical needs. \n• Mentor the entrepreneurs and scientists in early-stage biotech companies on developing novel analytical and diagnostic technologies.","skills":[]},{"title":"Associated Director","company":"JNJ Innovation Medicine","date_range":"2021年2月 - 2023年9月","duration":"2 年 8 个月","location":"","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Scientific Associate Director - Clinical biomarkers, Translational Medicine","company":"Bristol Myers Squibb · 全职","date_range":"2019年9月 - 2021年2月","duration":"1 年 6 个月","location":"美国 新泽西州 普林斯顿","description":"• Translation Medicine lead responsible for the development of Biologics and siRNA clinical programs in autoimmune rheumatological and liver fibrosis disease areas. \n• Develop translational biomarker plans with suitable target engagement and PD markers related to MOA, and precision medicine biomarkers and biomarker-enabled novel endpoint for clinical studies. \n• Lead collaborative work aligning multiple internal functional groups to convey derisked product development strategy: candidate drug approval, clinical campaign investment decisions and identification of new indications and new combinations for pipeline molecules. \n• Key accomplishments Led Translational Biomarker efforts on 3+ clinical assets from achieving the phase 1 first-in-human study start to developing late stage phase 2b/3 compound development strategy. \n• Led computational efforts to inform drug development design and the development of CDx to facilitate Precision Medicine clinical strategies to optimize company’s asset position in the competitive landscape. \n• Led academic partnership and vendor selection, due diligence and engagement to ensure scientific excellence in program and study strategies. \n• Author 3+ manuscripts and conference abstracts, and the biomarker sections of the regulatory documents, and study procedural manuals.","skills":["Drug Discovery","Communication","Biomedical Sciences","Data Analytics","Clinical Research"]}],"experience_fal