{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:24:37+08:00","record":{"name":"Rong Chen","current_title":"Research Fellow","current_company":"AbbVie · 全职","location":"美国 伊利诺伊州 苏黎世湖","headline":"A veteran in bioinformatics, data science, data engineering, genetics, genomics, oncology, neuroscience, rare disease, infrastructure","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/rongchen1","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAAURBAB8c3762569uKMa65td6Dn7mejcpY","core_skills":["data platform","antibody therapeutics","structure genomics"],"positions":[{"title":"Research Fellow","company":"AbbVie · 全职","date_range":"2023年6月 - 现在","duration":"3 年 4 个月","location":"美国 伊利诺伊州 莱克县","description":"Collaborate with precision medicine and lead reverse translation and biomarker discovery  \n \nPioneered, launched, deployed, and implemented an enterprise data and AI platform CodeOcean in AWS to centralize data, analytics, ML models, and applications across departments to promote collaboration and increase team productivity \n \nLead target identification, evaluation, and prioritization for neuroscience and immunological diseases \n \nSubtype diseases to identify targets, MoA, and understand treatment response by integrating longitudinal EHR, WGS, survey, imaging, and omics data  \n \nUnderstand tumor resistance to ADC by integrating RWD and clinical data \n \nDesign data strategy and ecosystem, lead the standardization and curation of genetic, RNA-Seq, scRNA-Seq, CRISPR, spatial genomics, RWD, and clinical trial data empowering data science community to perform scalable and innovative analytics \n \nLead the strategy of RWD, coordinate internal and external stakeholders on the acquisition, assessment, enhancement, and education of RWD, driving the growth and application of RWD\n\n• Develop a strategy and infrastructure roadmap to scale up bioinformatics and computational biology analytics, facilitating data-driven discovery and pipeline transition. \n• Desi