Wind Ensemble - Honorable Mention \n• 2018 - Moonshot - Vantaa Pops Orchestra - Sixth Place \n• 2019 - Tomorrow's Promise - Lakeview Orchestra - First Place \n• 2020 - Pharm Pharaoh Suite - Brazosport Symphony Orchestra - First Place \n• 2021 - I am Da State - Greater Bridgeport Symphony - Finalist \n• 2022 - Gamestomp - Florida Bandmasters Association - Honorable Mention \n• 2022 - A Drop in the Ocean - United Composers Collective - First Place \n \nGames (Year - Title): \n• 2019 - Pharm Pharaoh \n• 2023 - PumpNDump \n• 2024 - Deprompto \n• 2025 - Notatio","skills":[]},{"title":"Business Intelligence Analyst II","company":"Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center","date_range":"2021年4月 - 2023年5月","duration":"2 年 2 个月","location":"","description":"• Developed algorithmic code in JavaScript, Python, and SQL to analyze billions of hospital records to provide expertise on ontology architectural decision-making and data stewardship work covering multiple data domains \n• Developed Tableau dashboards to process real-time data coming out of the Unified Data Fabric \n• Led graph theory-based ontological architecture initiatives to improve institutional data quality in data governance involving tools such as IBM Watson Knowledge Catalog and Informatica \n• Authored user story plans and sprints via Rally and Jira for management and user acceptance purposes \n• Authored technical documentation in Confluence to document technical best practices \n• Authored workflow diagrams in Lucid to facilitate understanding of business processes \n• Implemented key performance indices to monitor project deadlines across the company’s technological portfolio \n• Implemented, documented, and gathered business requirements from hospital staff and vendors to import 2000+ ontological concepts into the institution’s Technology Division’s Unified Data Fabric covering data domains such as: \n• clinical orders \n• clinical research \n• genomics \n• medications \n• provider billing \n• Developed best practices with oncology-oriented disease management teams in capturing discrete data from data sources such as: \n• Allscripts \n• CoPath \n• Epic \n• master data management \n• MSK Impact \n• MPath \n• Optum \n• Tumor Registry \n• Developed hospital enterprise concepts and definitions with data owners/stewards from cross-functional hospital departments such as: \n• clinical research \n• clinical orders \n• nursing \n• pathology \n• patient financial services \n• pharmacy \n• Led ontology and natural language processing initiatives pertaining to best practices in data structuring and interpretation of data sets such as: \n• CPT \n• HCPCS \n• ICD-10 \n• NDC \n• RedCap \n• RxNorm \n• UMLS\n\n• Planned user stories and sprints via Rally and Jira for management and user acceptance. \n• Developed best practices with oncology-oriented disease management teams in capturing discrete data from data sources such as: Allscripts, CoPath, Epic, master data management, MSK Impact, MPath, Optum, Tumor Registry. \n• Developed hospital enterprise concepts and definitions with data owners/stewards from cross-functional hospital departments such as: clinical research, clinical orders, nursing, pathology, patient financial services, pharmacy. \n• Implemented proof-of-concept experimental projects involving technologies such as: AWS, IBM, Jupyter, Kubernetes, MS Azure, Oracle.","skills":[]},{"title":"Equities Analyst/Writer","company":"The Motley Fool","date_range":"2021年3月 - 2021年4月","duration":"2 个月","location":"","description":"• Authored scientific and financial due diligence research on publicly-traded biotech companies by analyzing, reviewing, and synthesizing clinical trial literature, pipelines, presentations, and stock information \n• Authored and published original investment insight analyses online on publicly-traded biotech companies \n• Nurtured a global audience to debate the impact of specific biotech stocks on the Internet \n• Developed multiple financial models to project anticipated pharmaceutical revenues and expenses for pharmaceutical companies by auditing publicly available financial statements  \n• Researched publicly-available information on investigational treatments covering disease states such as: \n• Duchenne's Muscular Dystrophy \n• hypoglycemia \n• non-alcoholic steatohepatitis \n• oncology\n\n• Researched publicly-available information on investigational treatments covering disease states such as: Duchenne’s Muscular Dystrophy, eye diseases, hearing loss, hypoglycemia, NASH, oncology.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Biotech Opinion Analyst at BioSpace · 2023年 - 现在 | Composer at Stealth Company · 2012年 - 现在 | Software Engineer at Stealth Company · 2018年 - 现在 | Game Developer at Stealth Company · 2018年 - 现在 | AI Innovator at Stealth Company · 2017年 - 现在 | Business Intelligence Analyst II at Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center · 2021年 - 2023年 | Equities Analyst/Writer at The Motley Fool · 2021年 - 2021年 | Biotech Analyst/Writer at Exar North Partners · 2018年 - 2021年 | Clinical Quality Programmer at Antidote.me · 2018年 - 2020年 | Clinical Research Contractor at Antidote.me · 2017年 - 2018年 | Pharmacy Intern - Clinical Informatics at Hospital for Special Surgery · 2017年 | Pharmacy Aide at Boreum Drugs · 2013年 - 2016年","education":[{"school":"圣约翰科技大学","degree":"Doctor of Pharmacy - PharmD","field_of_study":"Pharmacy","date_range":"2012年 - 2018年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"General Assembly","degree":"","field_of_study":"Computer Software Engineering","date_range":"2020年 - 2020年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 圣约翰科技大学，Doctor of Pharmacy - PharmD · 2012年 - 2018年 | General Assembly · 2020年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":["职位头衔 Healthcare Analyst Music Composer Equity Research Analyst Game Developer Biotechnology Analyst 职位性质 全职 所在地点 现场办公: 纽约地区 远程办公: 纽约地区 工作场所类型 现场办公 混合办公 远程办公"],"languages":[{"name":"Chinese","proficiency":"母语"}],"native_chinese":true,"d