{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:25:23+08:00","record":{"name":"Lin Chen","current_title":"Clinical Safety Physician-oncology","current_company":"BioNTech SE · 全职","location":"美国 新泽西州 Belle Mead","headline":"Global Drug Safety Physician","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/lin-chen-a5799132","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAbocaMB2lE3y3dPxiO55dYGujFfWJxl6mA","core_skills":["Pharmaceutical Industry","Clinical Development","Clinical Research"],"positions":[{"title":"Clinical Safety Physician-oncology","company":"BioNTech SE · 全职","date_range":"2023年1月 - 现在","duration":"3 年 9 个月","location":"美国","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Global Drug Safety Physician-oncology","company":"Innovent Biologics · 全职","date_range":"2022年1月 - 2022年12月","duration":"1 年","location":"","description":"SMT chair for multiple products in clinical development.  \n \nCoach and mentor for the PV team in China. Training sessions included causality assessment, signal identification and validation, ADR/RSI, Medical strategy for DSUR/IB, starting dose and R2DP determinations.  \n \nPerformed gap analysis, created SOP and WI for the PV function, established the corporate safety governance, function as the chair of the Safety Review Committee.","skills":[]},{"title":"Product Safety Leader, AbbVie Oncology","company":"AbbVie · 全职","date_range":"2019年7月 - 2022年1月","duration":"2 年 7 个月","location":"remote","description":"Safety lead for multiple oncology assets in clinical development and post-marketing.","skills":[]},{"title":"Global Safety Leader-oncology","company":"Bayer Pharmaceuticals · 全职","date_range":"2017年10月 - 2019年7月","duration":"1 年 10 个月","location":"美国 新泽西州 Whippany","description":"Global safety physician for multiple oncology and immune-oncology products clinical development.","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | Clinical Safety Physician-oncology at BioNTech SE · 2023年 - 现在 | Global Drug Safety Physician-onco