{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:28:41+08:00","record":{"name":"Valerie Chen","current_title":"Staff Scientist, Protein Chemistry","current_company":"Slingshot Biosciences · 全职","location":"旧金山湾区","headline":"Biochemist","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/vchen917","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAs7K3EBuPBgG-LbCR_wQHwW9sFnZOCuriQ","core_skills":["Molecular & Cellular Biology","Structural Biology","Protein Purification"],"positions":[{"title":"Staff Scientist, Protein Chemistry","company":"Slingshot Biosciences · 全职","date_range":"2025年6月 - 现在","duration":"1 年 4 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 爱莫利维尔","description":"• ​ Designed, performed, and optimized site-specific and non site-specific protein conjugation reactions to generate hydrogel-based cell mimics for flow cytometry applications. \n• ​ Performed protein characterization using SDS-PAGE, native PAGE, and Western blotting to assess protein purity and oligomeric state, and designed and optimized protein constructs to maximize stability, solubility, and proper folding for downstream biochemical studies. \n• ​ Acquired and analyzed high-dimensional flow cytometry datasets using conventional (BD FACSLyric, Beckman Coulter CytoFLEX LX) and spectral systems (Cytek Aurora), ensuring successful antibody binding to conjugated proteins. \n• ​ Developed and implemented standard operating procedures (SOPs) for conjugation workflows, enabling technology transfer to the manufacturing team and enhancing process reproducibility. \n• ​ Led project feasibility assessments, training, and pricing discussions with the commercial team, aligning scientific feasibility with business objectives. \n• ​ Managed and mentored two scientists within the protein conjugation/expression team.","skills":[]},{"title":"Senior Scientist, Biochemistry","company":"Tempest Therapeutics","date_range":"3 年 2 个月","duration":"1 年 5 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 布里斯班","description":"• ​ Led biochemical screening efforts and subsequently served as Project Leader for a preclinical PPARα immuno-oncology program focused on a backup molecule. \n• ​ Drove the discovery of novel chemical matter through AS-MS and DNA-encoded library (DEL) screening and coordinated hit validation using SPR, biochemical activity assays, HTRF, cell-based target engagement, and functional activity assays to advance lead identification. \n• ​ Oversaw the generation of tool antibodies using mouse hybridoma technology to support clinical assay development in response to FDA feedback. \n• ​ Contributed to strategic decision-making discussions and portfolio reviews across discovery research programs. \n• ​ Managed and mentored an Associate Scientist and multiple interns, providing scientific guidance and supporting professional development.","skills":[]},{"title":"Scientist, Biochemistry","company":"Tempest Therapeutics","date_range":"3 年 2 个月","duration":"1 年 5 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 布里斯班","description":"• ​ Led biochemical screening efforts and subsequently served as Project Leader for a preclinical PPARα immuno-oncology program focused on a backup molecule. \n• ​ Drove the discovery of novel chemical matter through AS-MS and DNA-encoded library (DEL) screening and coordinated hit validation using SPR, biochemical activity assays, HTRF, cell-based target engagement, and functional activity assays to advance lead identification. \n• ​ Oversaw the generation of tool antibodies using mouse hybridoma technology to support clinical assay development in response to FDA feedback. \n• ​ Contributed to strategic decision-making discussions and portfolio reviews across discovery research programs. \n• ​ Managed and mentored an Associate Scientist and multiple interns, providing scientific guidance and supporting professional development.","skills":[]},{"title":"Associate Scientist","company":"Nitrase Therapeutics · 全职","date_range":"2020年8月 - 2022年4月","duration":"1 年 9 个月","location":"","description":"• ​ Managed outsourced CRO projects that resulted in successful protein production (mammalian, bacterial, and insect expression systems) and antibody generation (mouse hybridoma and rabbit monoclonal antibodies). \n• ​ Expressed and purified active enzymes and protein substrates from bacterial and mammalian expression systems. \n• ​ Employed conventional biochemical purification and chromatography techniques to isolate enzymes from human tissue. \n• ​ Characterized novel enzymes through mass spectrometry analysis and biochemical activity assays.","skills":[]},{"title":"Graduate Student Researcher: Protein Science | Mass Spectrometry","company":"UC Santa Cruz · 全职","date_range":"2013年9月 - 2020年6月","duration":"6 年 10 个月","location":"","description":"The Millhauser Lab  \n• Optimized and piloted mammalian expression and biochemical characterization of integral membrane proteins in the lab \n• Determined the membrane topology of an obesity-associated membrane protein, the melanocortin receptor accessory protein 2 (MRAP2), through fluorescence microscopy and flow cytometry  \n• Characterized the oligomerization of MRAP2 by immunoprecipitation, western blot, and cell-based assays (luciferase reporter) \n• Identified cellular protein partners of MRAP2 through whole-cell chemical cross-linking, purification of membrane protein complexes, and LC-MS/MS peptide mapping  \n• Synthesized or recombinantly expressed and purified melanocortin peptide hormones for cell-based assays and in vivo feeding studies for several collaborations \n• Maintained and trained users on a Sciex X500B quadrupole time-of-flight LC-MS system and assisted users with data analysis \n• Maintained and optimized peptide-mapping methods on a Thermo LTQ-Orbitrap Velos Pro LC-MS system \n• Trained and mentored undergraduate and new graduate students","skills":[]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | Staff Scientist, Protein Chemistry at Slingshot Biosciences · 2025年 - 现在 | Senior Scientist, Biochemistry at Tempest Therapeutics · 2024年 - 2025年 | Scientist, Biochemistry at Tempest Therapeutics · 2022年 - 2024年 | Associate Scientist at Nitrase Therapeutics · 2020年 - 2022年 | Graduate Student Researcher: Protein Science | Mass Spectrometry at UC Santa Cruz · 2013年 - 2020年 | Graduate Student Researcher, Dr. Glenn Millhauser at University of California, Santa Cruz · 2013年 - 2020年 | Undergraduate Researcher, Dr. Scott Lokey at University of California, Santa Cruz · 2012年 - 2013年","education":[{"school":"University of California, Santa Cruz","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy - PhD","field_of_study":"Chemistry and Biochemistry","date_range":"2013年 - 2020年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"University of California, Santa Cruz","degree":"Bachelor of Science (BS)","field_of_study":"Biochemistry and Molecular Biology","date_range":"2009年 - 2013年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | University of California, Santa Cruz，Doctor of Philosophy - PhD · 2013年 - 2020年 | University of California, Santa Cruz，Bachelor of Science (BS) · 2009年 - 2013年 | 档案意向行装饰","open_to_work":[],"languages":[{"name":"English","proficiency":"母语"}],"native_chinese":false,"detail_error":""}}
