{"type":"record","version":2,"saved_at":"2026-09-17T11:29:19+08:00","record":{"name":"Kai-Yuan Chen","current_title":"VP, Platform","current_company":"NOETIK · 全职","location":"旧金山湾区","headline":"Biotech Platform | AI/ML | Multimodal & Multi-Omics Data | NGS & Lab Automation | Computational Biology | Gene Editing","public_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/kychen","recruiter_url":"https://www.linkedin.com/talent/profile/AEMAAAN34R8BBsSuholOvy6RgMLShESMWm0iHOI","core_skills":["Genomics","Functional Genomics","Data Science","Data Engineering","Cloud Computing","Computation biology","systems biology"],"positions":[{"title":"VP, Platform","company":"NOETIK · 全职","date_range":"2026年7月 - 现在","duration":"3 个月","location":"旧金山湾区","description":"","skills":[]},{"title":"Head of Data Science and Tech Platform","company":"Scribe Therapeutics · 全职","date_range":"2023年5月 - 2026年6月","duration":"3 年 2 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 阿拉米达","description":"• Leading cross-functional teams encompassing Next Generation Sequencing (NGS), Lab Automation, Bioinformatics, and Data Science to propel Lab-In-A-Loop R&D data strategy.","skills":[]},{"title":"Director, Data Science","company":"Omega Therapeutics · 全职","date_range":"2021年4月 - 2023年4月","duration":"2 年 1 个月","location":"美国 马萨诸塞州 剑桥","description":"•Managed and built a team of computational biologists, data scientists, and engineers focused on genomics discovery and lipid nanoparticle (LNP)/mRNA drug design. \n•Directed cloud strategy for hybrid genomic computation and ML/AI modeling; responsible for data analytics across pre-clinical R&D, mRNA production, and drug delivery. Implemented cutting-edge deep learning architecture and NLP/Transformer methods. \n•Led AI/ML strategy development for Omega’s technical platforms; created an in-house knowledgebase using NLP, data mining, big data, and graph methods for business development and target identification. \n•Supported IND filings and led NGS analytics for pre-clinical programs. Drove innovative analysis and integration of multi-genomic data with tangible impacts on Omega’s clinical and pre-clinical pipelines. \n•Designed and implemented NGS pipeline workflow management systems to enable reproducible and scalable NGS analytics, integrated with cloud computation. Developed pipelines for whole-genome methylation sequencing, ChIP-Seq, RNA-Seq, ATAC-Seq, HiC, capture methylome, amplicon sequencing, 10X single-cell RNA sequencing, and multi-omics integrations.\n\n• Led the analysis, integration, and AI/ML-driven modeling of complex genomics and epigenomics data to accelerate the translation of therapeutic targets to clinical applications.","skills":["Genomics · Functional Genomics · Data Science · Data Engineering · Cloud Computing","Computation biology","Gene Therapy","Machine Learning","Artificial Intelligence (AI)"]},{"title":"Principal Scientist, Machine Learning","company":"Engine Biosciences · 全职","date_range":"2019年 - 2021年3月","duration":"2 年 3 个月","location":"旧金山湾区","description":"1. Established enterprise-level cloud architecture for high-throughput genomics/target discovery using state-of-the-art scalable computation/ML/AI methods \n2. Led a team of computation biologists, data scientists, and data engineers to build Engine's proprietary computational biology methods, ML modeling, data lake, and data strategy for genomics ML and NLP modeling \n3. Led and initiated company's dual-CRISPR screening NGS/analytics pipelines, including combinatory genomic-wide sgRNA library design, NGS QC, pipeline development, deep data interpretation, etc.. \n4. Initiated and established a knowledge base for complex target discovery integrating Engine's proprietary data and external public databases \n5. Implemented ML/AI/DNN/NLP models to predict genetic interactions on genome-wide scales \n6. Engaged external partners to integrate state-of-the-art ML and computational methods/platforms into Engine's existing infrastructure. \n7. Supported bioinformatics/computation biology needs for pre-clinical studies\n\n• Led a global team in the creation of an AI-driven knowledgebase for cancer target discovery, utilizing advanced machine learning (ML) and data science techniques to streamline drug development processes.","skills":["Machine Learning","Artificial Intelligence (AI)","Data Engineering","Data Science","Cloud Computing","Genomics","Functional Genomics"]}],"experience_fallback":"职业档案中列出的工作经历 | 已添加简历进行完善 | VP, Platform at NOETIK · 2026年 - 现在 | Head of Data Science and Tech Platform at Scribe Therapeutics · 2023年 - 2026年 | Director, Data Science at Omega Therapeutics · 2021年 - 2023年 | Principal Scientist, Machine Learning at Engine Biosciences · 2019年 - 2021年 | Computational Scientist at Intellia Therapeutics, Inc. · 2018年 - 2019年 | Postdoctoral Associate at Duke University · 2016年 - 2018年 | Irwin M. and Joan K. Jacobs Fellow/Research Associate at School of Electrical and Computer Engineering, Cornell University · 2010年 - 2015年","education":[{"school":"美国康奈尔大学","degree":"Doctor of Philosophy (PhD)","field_of_study":"Electrical and Computer Engineering","date_range":"2010年 - 2015年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"美国康奈尔大学","degree":"M.Eng","field_of_study":"Biomedical Engineering","date_range":"2009年 - 2010年","activities":"","grade":""},{"school":"台湾大学","degree":"M.S","field_of_study":"Electrical Engineering","date_range":"2005年 - 2007年","activities":"","grade":""}],"education_fallback":"职业档案中列出的教育经历 | 美国康奈尔大学，Doctor of Philosophy (PhD) · 2010年 - 2015年 | 美国康奈尔大学，M.Eng · 2009年 - 2010年 | 台湾大学，M.S · 2005年 - 2007年 | 成功大学，B.S · 2001年 - 2005年 | 保存到项目 | 将Kai-Yuan保存到项目 | 发消息给Kai-Yuan | Kai-Yuan Chen的更多操作","open_to_work":[],"languages":[{"name":"English","proficiency":"高级 (无障碍商务沟通)"}],"native_chinese":null,"detail_error":""}}
