inical trial phase I study. \n \n• Conducted literature review for building TPP and performed retrospective historical clinical data analysis.  \n \n• Maintained partnerships with cross-functional teams including Regulatory Affairs, Clinical Operation, CMC on the management of early phase clinical study.\n\n• Data review on Pharmacokinetic and Pharmacodynamic for combo vs single agents. \n• Regular monitoring of patient performance with clinicians and operation across institutions. \n• Conducted clinical trial protocol review with the legal team to ensure compliance. \n• Successfully reached target number of enrolled patients in 2 months by reviewing eligible packages, analyzing patient data including tumor assessment for clinical trial phase I study. \n• Conducted literature review for building Target Product Profile and performed retrospective historical clinical data analysis over 15 studies.","skills":["Clinical Research","Regulatory Affairs","clinical trial management","Clinical Data Analysis","Cross-functional Collaborations"]},{"title":"Postdoctoral Scholar | Microbiology, Immunology, and Molecular Genetics","company":"美国加州大学洛杉矶分校","date_range":"6 年","duration":"5 个月","location":"美国 加利福尼亚 洛杉矶","description":"• Investigated clinical lentiviral system for preclinical development of T-Cell Receptor immunotherapy (TCR-T) in prostate cancer \n \n• Tested different affinity maturated TCRs in vitro with co-culture killing assays and cytokine profiling using FACS  \n \n• Assisted three collaborative research projects simultaneously by coordinating cross-functional teams, planning and executing in vitro and in vivo experiments.","skills":["技能: Immunotherapy • Oncology • Project Management","Immunotherapy","Oncology","Project Management","技能: Single Cell Sequencing • Pre-clinical Studies • Cancer Research • Bioinformatics • Data Analysis","Single Cell Sequencing","Pre-clinical Studies","Cancer Research","Bioinformatics","Data Analysis","技能: Cell Biology • Teaching • Co